  [2] = {
    rule_type = "company",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Run your company. Fulfill your dreams. Reach the top of your career. Strive to become a better you.

The Company Strength is determined by the company's level, department level, and all your experts' attributes. The department and expert level cannot exceed the company level.

[c][C74848]Training:[-][/c]
You can upgrade the level of the corresponding department. Level up departments to upgrade the corresponding attributes. You can view the corresponding attributes of each department in the Training interface.

[c][C74848]Expert Upgrade:[-][/c]
You can upgrade experts' attributes, which count towards the company's total attributes. Spend Gold to upgrade Experts. When the investigation title in [City News] reaches [c][C74848]Senior Investigator[-][/c], Investigation Medals can also be used to upgrade experts.
All hired experts can be summoned in the level Special Event stages.

[c][C74848]Cooperation Project:[-][/c]
The [c][C74848]Cooperation Project[-][/c] feature can be unlocked after clearing Season 2 Main Story 1-1 to unlock further cooperation with him.

Select the character you wish to work with to unlock a cooperation project. Complete the daily to-do list and accumulate project attribute data to advance the project progress. Complete the project to claim project rewards.

[c][C74848]Spend energy points[-][/c] to complete the to-do list. Energy points will be automatically restored to [c][C74848]4[-][/c] at [c][C74848]5:00[-][/c] every day. You can get more energy points by spending Gems.
*Work overtime only in moderation. You can purchase up to [c][C74848]6 extra [-][/c]energy points each day.

Daily To-Do List Types:
1.[c][C74848]Decision-making[-][/c]
Swipe left and right to choose a response plan. You will be rewarded with attribute upgrades and items according to the decision.
2.[c][C74848]Financial Approval[-][/c]
Tap on the red keywords to annotate and audit. You will be rewarded with attribute upgrades and items after the approval is complete.
3.[c][C74848]Employee Incentive[-][/c]
Tap to remind the employees who slack off to make them more efficient and speed up the work progress. After the countdown, you will be rewarded with attribute upgrades and items according to the percentage of work progress.
4.[c][C74848]Karma Commission/Assigning Expert[-][/c]
Summon Character Karma's or Expert's corresponding items and wait for its completion to be rewarded with attribute upgrades and item rewards.
*Karmas can only be summoned after reaching lv. 30.
5.[c][C74848]Answering Reporter's Questions[-][/c]
Answer the reporter's questions within the time limit. You will be rewarded with attribute upgrades and items according to your response.

Complete the items marked with [c][C74848]New![-][/c] in the to-do list to unlock the nodes in the project milestone and claim rewards like project exclusive titles and gems.]]
