Courage and speed, wit and luck, with these, you will become a better journalist.
 
 [c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]
 
 1. For City News missions, the most important thing is the strength, which is determined by the total strength of deployed Karma, the strength of company (department strength and expert strength).
 
 2. In City News missions, please quickly tap the screen until a red exclamation point appears, then you answer the question. A wrong answer will lead to the failure of the investigation, please carefully answer.
 
 3. Even if the investigation mission fails, the corresponding daily mission can be completed~ 
 
 4. The lowest Strength is demanded to start every investigation in City News. Unqualified ones cannot start the investigation.
 
 5. Completing investigation grants Investigation EXP, Investigation Medal and other rewards. Investigation EXP can be used to upgrade your title of the investigation.
 
 6. Investigation Medal can be used to hire experts in Talent Market. The higher the title, the more experts can be selected.
 
 7. The City News system provides daily rewards based on the title of the investigation. Daily rewards reset at 5:00.]]
