  [12] = {
    rule_type = "backflow",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Welcome back! Complete tasks to earn Returning Points and exchange them for fabulous rewards. Bind a Recall Code to earn double points!\n\n[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. Producers who [c][C74848]haven't logged in since 00:00 on May 27, 2025, and are level 20 or above[-][/c] can return and log in [c][C74848]between 05:00 on July 7 and 23:59 on August 17, 2025[-][/c] to accept their returning missions from the main screen.\n\n2. Returning producers can earn Returning Points by completing daily quests. As these points reach specific milestones, you'll unlock corresponding rewards. The maximum you can earn includes: [[c][C74848]Galaxy Wish Coupons x10, VIP Trial Cards x7, Radiant Shards x5[-][/c], Stamina x160, and Gold x100,000].\n\n3. Each player has a unique Recall Code available on their [Producer Recall] event page. When a returning producer binds another player's Recall Code, all Returning Points earned will be [c][C74848]doubled[-][/c]. The player who provided the code will also receive an equal number of Popularity Medals based on the points earned. Returning producers cannot bind their own code, but they can enter codes from players on different servers.\n\n4. After the mission countdown ends, you will no longer be able to earn Returning Points through daily quests. However, the event page will remain open for 7 more days, during which you can still enter a Recall Code to receive the double points bonus.\n\n5. Each returning producer can only enter one Recall Code and bind with one player.\n\n6. Returning producers can also participate in the [Producer Recall] through the event page."
  },
  [13] = {
    rule_type = "recall",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Fun is always meant to be shared; laughter always echoes louder with friends!

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. During the event, you can invite players who [c][C74848]haven't logged in since 05:00 on May 27, 2025, and are level 20 or above[-][/c], to return [c][C74848]between 05:00 on July 7 and 23:59 on August 17, 2025[-][/c]. Once they log in, they can accept their return missions from the main screen.

2. On the [Producer Recall] event page, you can find your unique Recall Code. When a returning producer accepts their recall tasks and enters your code, you'll receive the same amount of Popularity Medals as the Returning Points they earn from completing their daily quests. These medals can be exchanged in the event shop for exclusive rewards, including [c][C74848]limited Avatar Frames, Galaxy Wish Coupons, Radiant Shards[-][/c], and more.

3. Every day at 5 AM, the [c][C74848]number of Popularity Medals you receive[-][/c] will be calculated based on the [c][C74848]Returning Points earned the previous day by returning producers who entered your code[-][/c].

4. You can earn 20 bonus Popularity Medals the first time you share your Recall Code each week. This sharing bonus resets every Monday at 5 AM.

5. Your Recall Code can be bound by multiple returning producers at the same time. You will earn Popularity Medals equal to the combined total of all Returning Points earned by the players who have entered your code. Players from different servers can also enter your code.

6. Returning producers who log in before August 17 at 23:59 but haven't entered a Recall Code will still be able to do so until [c][C74848]September 3 at 23:59[-][/c]. Entering a code within this period will double the Returning Points they've already earned, and the bound player will receive the same number of Popularity Medals.

7. After September 5 at 23:59, the event shop will close. The limited Avatar Frames will no longer be available through any other methods.]]
