    rule_type = "bosschapter",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "You have come to the [c][C74848]Dream Edge[-][/c]. \n\nThe beauty in front of you is like hot milk with honey, gently inviting you to indulge in the sweet dream — a dream that is warm and tender, and as long as you close your eyes, it will be eternal. Are you really willing to stop in front of this flourishing world? Choose to go ahead bravely. Don't worry about fighting alone. All memories and Karmas will turn into your sword, accompanying you all the way. \n\n[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c] \n\n1. In this chapter, you need to clear [c][C74848]exploration[-][/c] missions to obtain [c][C74848]Snow Crystals[-][/c].\n\n2. For each Snow Crystal obtained, you can get [c][C74848]1 Point of Personal Exploration Progress[-][/c] and [c][C74848]1 point of Server Exploration Progress[-][/c].\n\n3. When your Personal Exploration and Server Exploration Progress meet the requirements [c][C74848]after the opening time (00:00 on March 7)[-][/c], you can trigger the follow-up plots.\n\n4. Each exploration costs 5 Stamina. The [c][C74848]higher[-][/c] the score, the [c][C74848]more[-][/c] Snow Crystals you will obtain.\n"
  },
  [24] = {
    rule_type = "bossexplor",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c] 

