4. When the Server Exploration Progress reaches the specified percentage, all players can claim rewards in the "Server Rewards" page. All server rewards must be claimed [c][C74848]before 23:59 on March 23, 2020[-][/c]. Please [c][C74848]claim them in time[-][/c].]]
  },
  [25] = {
    rule_type = "bossrank",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] Rules of Exploring Truth Rankings:[-][/c] 

1. In exploration missions, for [c][C74848]each Snow Crystal[-][/c] obtained, you can get [c][C74848]1 Exploring Truth Rankings Point[-][/c].

2. The [c][C74848]higher[-][/c] the score, the [c][C74848]more[-][/c] Snow Crystals (equal to the ranking Points) you will obtain.

