4. [c][C74848]The Rank Rewards[-][/c] will be sent by [c][C74848]mail[-][/c] within 1 day after the ranking is settled. The [c][C74848]validity[-][/c] of the reward mail will expire at [c][C74848]23:59 on May 13, 2020[-][/c]. Please get the rewards as soon as possible.]]
  },
  [26] = {
    rule_type = "chapter19",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c] 

1. From [c][C74848]5:00 on March 5, 2020 to 23:59 on March 23, 2020[-][/c], you can [c][C74848]go directly to Chapter 19[-][/c] to watch the plot and unlock the follow-up mission no matter whether you have completed Chapter 18 or not.

2. When the event ends, all mission scores and unlocking progress gained during the event will be [c][C74848]retained[-][/c]. If you have not completed Chapter 18, you can still enter Chapter 19-21 to watch the [c][C74848]unlocked[-][/c] plots, but you [c][C74848]cannot unlock[-][/c] the follow-up missions.

3. In this chapter, you can get [c][C74848]Jigsaw Puzzle[-][/c] by participating in any shooting or exploration mission.

4. To unlock new [c][C74848]plot[-][/c] missions, a certain amount of Jigsaw Puzzle need to be [c][C74848]consumed[-][/c].

5. When the plot develops to a certain stage, [c][C74848]Plot Branches[-][/c] will be available.

6. You can [c][C74848]choose any branch[-][/c] to enter, only one at a time. You [c][C74848]can't switch[-][/c] to another branch until you finish reading the plot of the selected branch.

7. In the branch, only the Karma of the corresponding character can be deployed.

8. The selection of branches will [c][C74848]NOT[-][/c] affect the plot development and clearance rewards in follow-up chapters.

9. After completing the selected branch plot, [c][C74848]the follow-up plots and chapters[-][/c] will be available; You can also continue to unlock other branches to experience different plots.

10. The [c][C74848]higher[-][/c] the clearance score, the [c][C74848]more[-][/c] Jigsaw Puzzle you will obtain.]]
  },
  [27] = {
    rule_type = "TalentTreeBattle",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Just like hardships can improve your character, Heart Trials can ascend your Karma.

[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]

1. Heart Trial is divided into four trials: Heart Trial - Victor, Heart Trial - Lucien, Heart Trial - Kiro, Heart Trial - Gavin

2. Each trial has different opening times, as follows:

[c][C74848]Monday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Victor, Heart Trial - Lucien
[c][C74848]Tuesday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Kiro, Heart Trial - Gavin
[c][C74848]Wednesday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Victor, Heart Trial - Kiro
[c][C74848]Thursday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Lucien, Heart Trial - Gavin
[c][C74848]Friday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Victor, Heart Trial - Gavin
[c][C74848]Saturday[-][/c]: Heart Trial - Lucien, Heart Trial - Kiro
[c][C74848]Sunday[-][/c]: All Open [c][C74848](Double Drops)[-][/c]

3. Each trial is either a Decision Test, Creativity Test, Affinity Test, or Execution Test. When trying to pass a trial, you can only select Karma for the corresponding character. Try to select Karma that has a high attribute for the type of trial you're challenging.

4. Challenging a Heart Trial costs a [c][C74848]Heart Key[-][/c]. Every day at [c][C74848]05:00[-][/c], [c][C74848]3[-][/c] new keys will refresh for free (unused keys do not roll over to the next day). You can also purchase more using Gems, 1 per purchase and up to 6 purchases per day. [c][C74848]Every Sunday[-][/c] in [Love Supply] you can purchase up to [c][C74848]5[-][/c] Heart Keys at a limited time discount.

Other Ways to Get: Privilege Ascension Pack (Daily Limited Purchase) 

5. The first time you pass a Heart Trial stage, or if you fail, it will [c][C74848]not cost[-][/c] a Heart Key. After passing a stage, you can [c][C74848]Retry[-][/c] to quickly get rewards. You can also claim a one-time 1st Pass Reward when you pass a stage.

6. Heart Trial rewards an items used for Karma Ascension. Ascending and developing will greatly increase Karma attributes.

7. [c][C74848]Every Sunday, there will be a Double Drops event[-][/c] during which you'll get double the Ascension item rewards when you pass or retry stages (does not apply to First Clearance rewards).]]
  },
  [28] = {
    rule_type = "BoardDesc",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Whenever you miss him, just follow your heart and Go See Him.\n\n[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Sweet Reminders[-][/c]\n    Set up a schedule or calendar and you will receive sweet reminders from him in and outside the game.\n    Up to 10 reminders can be set up for each character.\n    If you meet him past the agreed time, he might react in unexpected ways.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ AR Camera[-][/c]\n    Tap the Camera button in the bottom left corner of the screen to take a photo of him or of you and him together.\n    The Camera has the photo and video modes. The max length of a single video recording is 15 seconds.\n    On the Camera screen, you can change his clothes and apply owned scenes, music and voices.\n    Aside from basic portraits, there are also Karma scenes in the AR format.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Interaction[-][/c]\n    When meeting him, you can tap on the screen to interact with him. If you don't interact with him for a certain amount of time, he will get on with his own business or take the initiative to interact with you.\n    New interactions will be unlocked as your Intimacy with him increases; interactions will change as your Karma with him increases. \n    The interactions available will change when you change his clothes or the background. Feel free to explore!\n    When he is wearing dynamic clothes, slide your finger on his body and see how he reacts to your [c][C74848]touch[-][/c].\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Sign-In Greetings[-][/c]\n    Sign in the game at different times during the day and you will receive different greetings from him. You will receive special greetings on special occasions!\n    Every sign-in grants 15 Intimacy. Up to 30 Intimacy can be gained per day per character.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Character Present[-][/c]\n    Here you can choose the character you want to meet. If you change the character, the change will take place [c][C74848]when you enter the game again[-][/c].\n    If you choose multiple characters, a random one of them will appear every time you sign in.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Music Settings[-][/c]\n    Tap the Music button in the bottom right corner of the screen to enter the music settings menu, where you can select the BGMs for the main menu and Go See Him. You can designate a separate BGM for each character in Go See Him.\n    BGMs can be unlocked by spending Time Coupons in the music settings menu. Certain character-exclusive BGMs are only unlocked when Intimacy reaches a certain level, and these BGMs can only be applied to their corresponding characters.\n    (Time Coupons can be acquired from Daily Missions and Official Events)\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Whisper Mode[-][/c]\n    Tap the magnifying glass in the left bottom corner of the screen to enter Whisper Mode, where you can free yourself from all UI constraints and talk to him face-to-face.\n     To exit Whisper Mode, tap the magnifying glass again.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Day and Night[-][/c]\n    When your Bond with him reaches Lv.20, you can unlock \"Day and Night\" in Go See Him. \n    Tap the Go See Him entrance and select the mode and time (No need to select the time in the Word Learning mode) to spend time with him.        \n    While being with you, he would continue to focus on his own business, which means he does not respond to your every tap. \n    After spending time with him, you will receive an item reward (up to one reward per day). Learning a whole vocabulary book in the Word Learning mode grants you a special title.                  \n    After completing \"Day and Night\" once a week, you can go to [c][C74848]Memories[-][/c] and leave a stamp mark on the corresponding character's journal calendar. After gathering 4 stamp marks for a particular character within a month, you will receive a corresponding monthly reward. You can claim rewards for multiple characters at the same time."
  },
  [29] = {
    rule_type = "BoardMakeUpDesc",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Here you can plan trips with him.\n\n[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c]\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Recommend outfits and accessories[-][/c]\n    When preparing for a trip, you can recommend unlocked outfits and accessories to him. See how he reacts to your fashion advice.\n    But if you recommend him too many outfits, he might get tired.\n    Outfits cost Time Coupons to unlock. Some outfits can only be unlocked when you hold certain cards.\n    After a static outfit is unlocked, you can spend Time Coupons to upgrade it to a Live 2D Outfit.\n    Select Random Outfits, and he will choose among his existing outfits every day based on his preferences. Select Random Accessories, and he will freely match his existing accessories every day. What will he look like today?\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Change scenes[-][/c]\n    When preparing for a trip, you can also select the scene you wish to go to.\n    Scenes cost Time Coupons to unlock.\n    Certain character-exclusive scenes can be unlocked using Time Coupons only when your Intimacy with that character reaches a certain level. And when unlocked, those scenes only apply to that character.\n    (Time Coupons can be obtained from Daily Quests and other official events.)"
  },
