    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Give Shards to Friends: [-][/c]

1. To give a Shard to a Friend, you need to consume 1 [c][C74848]Friendship Feather[-][/c], and your Karma Shards won't be consumed.

2. After giving, the beneficiary will get 1 Karma Shard of his/her wishes.

3. During the event, you can have the chance to get up to 1 [c][C74848]Friendship Feather[-][/c] a day after completing any Normal or Elite [c][C74848]Missions[-][/c] in the Main Story.

4. During the event, you can claim an extra reward after giving Shards to a total of 7 [c][C74848]different Friends[-][/c].

[c][C74848]Publish Wish:[-][/c] 

1. You need to have at least 1 Event Karma Shard or Event Karma to publish a wish.

2. Each player can only publish 1 wish a day, and another after 5:00 the next day.

3. After publishing the wish, Friends can see your wish in the "Shard Exchange" page and consume the Friendship Feathers to realize it.

4. The Karma Shards obtained from Friends will be sent by [c][C74848]mail[-][/c], and the mail will be retained for 8 days. Please claim them in time.

5. The wish that has been realized won't appear again in the Wish Lists of Friends. If the wish hasn't been realized, it will be removed at 5:00 the next day and you will need to publish another one.

6. The wish that has been realized won't be shown in the Wish List.]]
