  [55] = {
    rule_type = "spcard",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]1. SP Evolution Explained[-][/c]

1) SP Karma requires both Evolution and Tier Up. [c][C74848]Evolution[-][/c] yields great [c][C74848]stats bonus[-][/c] and [c][C74848]a variety of beautiful artwork[-][/c]. [c][C74848]Tier Up[-][/c] gives you even more stats bonus.

2) [c][C74848]Refined Shards[-][/c] can be used to redeem any SP Karma Shards that you already own, and then be spent to Evolve or Tier Up SP Karma. Participate in events to obtain Refined Shards.

[c][C74848]2. Memory Silhouette and Exclusive Radio[-][/c]

When a card reaches certain Evolution milestones, the male protagonist's [c][C74848]Memory Silhouette[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Exclusive Radio[-][/c] will be unlocked. You can view it either in the rewards interface or Mind's Quest.

[c][C74848]3. SP Artwork and Poses[-][/c]

SP Karma come in many different types. Some have one picture with two poses, and you can choose one of them. Some have two pictures but the poses cannot be changed.

[c][C74848]SP Karma with Pose Options[-][/c]
