[c][C74848]SP Karma with Two Pictures[-][/c]
1) Evolve to Stage II to fully unlock the first picture. Evolve to Stage IV to fully unlock the second picture.
2) Backgrounds and poses in the pictures cannot be changed.]]
  },
  [56] = {
