Level Up can raise Karma Attributes by a small amount and requires [c][C74848]Dharma EXP[-][/c]. When you use a Karma to clear a stage, it directly increases its Dharma EXP. Dharma EXP received from [c][C74848]Blitzing[-][/c] stages will automatically accumulate, which you can then use to manually upgrade Dharma Level (supplement EXP needed to level up).

For every 5 levels Dharma Level increases, you can use Tier Up to raise Dharma Tier, greatly increasing Karma Attributes. After completing a Tier Up, you can continue raising Dharma Level. Materials needed for Tier Up mainly come from [c][C74848]Occult Trial[-][/c] drops. Stages in [c][C74848]Journey[-][/c] will also drop Tier Up materials.

As Dharma Tier rises, the Karma's Core Skill, Synergy Skill, and Clearive Skill will be unlocked. [c][C74848]At Tier 4, a new card face can be unlocked for Westmoon Limited Karma (Tier Up card faces of Limited Karma cannot be unlocked via Loveland City Evolving)[-][/c].

]]
