  [89] = {
    rule_type = "tournament",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
1.Box Office Contest adopts the [c][C74848]Tier Score[-][/c] competition system.

2.Every time, you have 3 opponents to choose from; 

If you win, you'll gain scores;if you lose, the score will remain the same;

You'll earn different scores depending on the opponent you beat, choose wisely; 

Depending on the opponent and the result, you will be awarded different numbers of [c][C74848]Box Office Medals[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Gold[-][/c] after each contest;

No matter you win or lose, the 3 opponents will be refreshed.

3.Each day, every player has 5 free [c][C74848]attempts[-][/c] and 5 free chances to [c][C74848]refresh opponents[-][/c], reset every day at 05:00.

4.If you gain enough scores, your tier goes up, when you reach a designated tier in season you can claim the [c][C74848]Tier rewards[-][/c] for that tier. Tier rewards will be sent automatically.

5.After the season ends, according to the final Tier Score [c][C74848]Seasonal rewards[-][/c] will be calculated and sent out at the start of the new season.

6.If you reach the [c][C74848]Champion Producer[-][/c] tier and enter the [c][C74848]Top 100 Ranking[-][/c], you'll receive Champion [c][C74848]Ranking rewards[-][/c]  which will rmain claimable during [c][C74848]the next season[-][/c].

7.Choose Karma based of Strength and [c][C74848]Guest[-][/c], this will help you get better results in contest.

8.When new season starts, your scores will be reset based on your tier last season; the higher tier you reached last season, the high reset score you get.

9. Players with VIP Card can save their Challenge Times up to 35 times. Every Monday at 5:00, unused Challenge Times from last week will be turned 1:100 into scores (Challenge Times of Monday will be released after 5:00 as usual); If a Season is coming to an end, the Challenges Times saved will be turned into scores before the seasonal calculation starts. The scores will be counted into that of the former Season.


- Reset score for Champion Producer: 13000

- Reset score for Ace Producer: 10000

- Reset score for Master Producer: 8000

- Reset score for Senior Producer: 4500

- Reset score for Mid-level Producer: 2500

- Reset score for Junior Producer: 1000

- Reset score for Novice Producer: 1000

- Reset score for Intern Producer: 1000

- Reset score for Apprentice Producer: 1000]]
