  [90] = {
    rule_type = "tenDaysRule47002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "暮色四合，云幕昏黄。\n\n记录最美的日落时刻，进行「暮色」主题拍摄，积累[c][C74848]拍摄经验[-][/c]、提升[c][C74848]训练等级[-][/c]，领取丰厚奖励~\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.完成训练任务，累计[c][C74848]拍摄经验[-][/c]，即可提升[c][C74848]训练等级[-][/c]，领取对应的[c][C74848]训练等级奖励[-][/c]。\n\n2.[c][C74848]训练等级奖励[-][/c]分为两种：[c][C74848]基础奖励[-][/c]、[c][C74848]进阶奖励[-][/c]。\n\n  [c][C74848]基础奖励[-][/c]：只要达到对应等级，即可领取基础奖励；\n\n  [c][C74848]进阶奖励[-][/c]：[c][C74848]解锁进阶[-][/c]后，即可领取更丰厚的进阶奖励。\n\n3.点击【获得经验】，前往完成训练任务，即可获得[c][C74848]拍摄经验[-][/c]。\n\n训练任务分为两种：[c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]、[c][C74848]常规任务[-][/c]。\n\n  *[c][C74848]常规任务[-][/c]：共16个任务，每个任务可完成10次，每次奖励[c][C74848]1点[-][/c]拍摄经验。常规任务可连续完成，累计奖励一次性领取。\n\n  *[c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：每天5:00随机刷新1个终极目标。每日任务每天只能完成1次，每次奖励[c][C74848]10点[-][/c]拍摄经验。在任务未完成时，可以随时使用[c][C74848]【刷新】[-][/c]更换其他目标。\n\n除了完成任务获得拍摄经验外，还可以在[c][C74848]【快速提升】[-][/c]中购买[c][C74848]【一日千里礼包】[-][/c]快速升级~\n\n4.活动结束后，活动界面延迟展示2天（11/28 0:00~11/29 23:59），延迟展示期间，可以正常领取[c][C74848]拍摄经验[-][/c]以及[c][C74848]训练等级奖励[-][/c]。延迟展示结束后，若有未领取的[c][C74848]训练等级奖励[-][/c]，将会在3日内发放至邮箱。\n\n  活动延迟展示期间，无法获得拍摄经验。但可以正常领取已经完成的训练任务奖励及训练等级奖励，也可以【解锁进阶】，获取训练等级进阶奖励。"
  },
  [91] = {
    rule_type = "subway_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
The subway cars hurtle through the tunnel,
Their couplings shifting endlessly in the darkness.
Don't look back; grip your ticket tight,
This time, just trust in yourself.

[c][C74848]Rules - Time Subway:[-][/c]

In the Time Subway players can Explore different stations, collect items and unlock exclusive Subway storylines. You can also redeem generous item rewards!

[c][C74848] [Station Exploration][-][/c]
Spend [c][C74848]Stamina[-][/c] to explore Station exits. Every time you explore, there's a chance of triggering [c][C74848]Events or Storyline[-][/c].

[c][C74848][Exploration Rewards][-][/c]
Every time you explore you can earn rewards, which may include the following items:

1. Time Key: Long drop, used to unlock Main Story chapters 29-32;
2. Star-up Items: Long drop star-up items also available in Subway stages.

[c][C74848]Special Note:[-][/c]
When participating in the annual "Milky Way" event, collect Chapter 29-32 Main Story karma and deploy Exploration line-ups to earn even more Time Key rewards. For more details, tap the [c][C74848]Exploration Bonus[-][/c] button.
[c][C74848][Unlocking New Stations][-][/c]
In order to unlock a new station, collect the designated number of Events or Storylines at the preceding station.]]
  },
