  [99] = {
    rule_type = "BoardAccompany",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "He will always be by your side come rain or shine.\n\n[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Word Learning[-][/c]\n    Tap the Go See Him entrance and select \"Word Learning\" to start learning words in the company of him.     \n    In the vocabulary books menu, you can download the audio file corresponding to each book and view the learning progress for a particular book.\n    While being with you, he would continue to focus on his own business, which means he does not respond to your every tap.\n    \n[c][C74848]◆ Work and Study[-][/c]    \n    Tap the Go See Him entrance and select the Work or Study mode and a timeline to start spending time with him. \n    While being with you, he would continue to focus on his own business, which means he does not respond to your every tap.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Companionship Rewards[-][/c]    \n    After spending time with him, you will receive an item reward (up to one reward per day). Learning a whole vocabulary book in the Word Learning mode grants you a special title.                  \n    After completing \"Day and Night\" once a week, you can go to [c][C74848]Memories[-][/c] and leave a stamp mark on the corresponding character's journal calendar. After gathering 4 stamp marks for a particular character within a month, you will receive a corresponding monthly reward. You can claim rewards for multiple characters at the same time.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Character Selection[-][/c]    \n    If you wish to change the character you want to spend time with, go to the settings in Go See Him.\n\n[c][C74848]◆ Music Settings[-][/c]\n    Tap the Music button to enter the music settings menu, where you can select the BGM to be played when you spend time with him.\n    BGMs can be unlocked by spending Time Coupons in the music settings menu. Certain character-exclusive BGMs are only unlocked when Intimacy reaches a certain level, and these BGMs can only be applied to their corresponding characters.\n    (Time Coupons can be acquired from Daily Missions and Official Events)"
  },
  [100] = {
    rule_type = "ActivityAnnualReview",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
We braved the wind and rain together. Always right beside you.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. This is where you can review the year you spent together in great detail. This event records the Texts, Phone Calls, Moments, Karma and Dates which occurred during the past year (Mar 5th 2020 0:00 - Mar 11th 2021 23:59) and generates a Memory List according to Karma attained during that period.

2. After reviewing the year, players can choose three of their favorite moments to share. The first share earns one Galaxy Wish Coupon. One Share Reward can be collected for each protagonist.

3. Content unlocked after Mar 11th 2021 23:59 will not be included in the event.]]
  },
  [101] = {
    rule_type = "NotebookEchoesOfTime",
