  },
  [102] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineSaleRule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
In a tiny moment, the universe bursts forth. Life begins to appear, and the sun radiates warmth.
And His past with you glistens in this moment in the boundless night sky.

[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]

1. Select the Karma that makes the deepest impression on your memory, and take [c][C74848]Memory Starcases[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupons[-][/c] to Star Ocean to seek your Karma with Him. You will receive [c][C74848]one Shard reward[-][/c] and [c][C74848]two Pure Shards[-][/c] for this Karma.

2. When you pick a star, you may also get a bonus [c][C74848]Pure Shard[-][/c] or [c][C74848]a random Karma Shard[-][/c].
  *After receiving all 80 Shards of a certain Karma, you will no longer receive this Karma Shard among bonus random rewards when continuing to tap Pick 1 or Pick 10.

3. [c][C74848]Pure Shards[-][/c] obtained from picking stars can be exchanged in the [c][C74848]Star Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupons[-][/c] and other item rewards.

4. [c][C74848]Memory Starcases[-][/c] can be obtained in the following ways:
  *Time-limited drops in Main Story stages
  *Time-limited drops in Time Subway
  *After the event ends, any unused Memory Starcases will be converted to Gold at a rate of [c][C74848]1 Memory Starcase = 10 Gold[-][/c], sent via in-game mail.

5. [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupons[-][/c] can be obtained in the following ways:
  *Available for a limited time in Evol Supply - Love Supply
  *Rewards in Evol Supply - Packs - Hot Sale Packs
  *Exchange for them using Pure Shards in Star Shop]]
  },
  [103] = {
    rule_type = "33006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
After encountering interesting news in Loveland City, what kind of chemistry will there be between you and Gavin?
[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c]
1. Encounter news every day to certain times to unlock [c][C74848]SR Karma Gavin: Starting Line[-][/c].
2. Encounter and record to get Fun-seeking Points and claim extra rewards.
3. You can encounter news once a day and record it 6 times for free after that.
4. Encountering chance will be reset every day at 5:00. [c][C74848] Unused chances of encountering will not be accumulated to the next day.[-][/c]
5. When all interesting news has been collected, the first time of recording each day after will offer you 40 Fun-seeking Points.]]
  },
  [104] = {
    rule_type = "74001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "亲爱的制作人：\n\n根据国家相关政策法规规定，2020年1月1日起，将对游戏内实名认证绑定系统进行升级调整。还请制作人及时完善实名信息，否则将影响后续的游戏时长等体验。\n\n具体调整如下：\n\n【已注册用户】\n根据政策规定，1月1日后，将陆续强制落实游戏账号实名认证措施。\n已经完成注册，但未填写实名认证信息的制作人，需要尽快完善实名认证信息，否则将影响后续的游戏时长等体验。\n*点击活动页面按钮，即可前往完善认证信息。\n\n【新注册用户】\n新注册用户必须完成实名认证才可注册完毕进入游戏。\n\n【游客用户】\n根据政策规定，1月1日后，游客账号有效游戏时长仅限1小时；\n每台设备15天内仅能创建1个游客账号。\n使用游客账号进行游戏的制作人，还请及时注册并绑定账号，以免影响您后续的游戏体验。\n\n*点击活动页面按钮，即可前往注册并绑定游客账号信息。\n"
  },
  [105] = {
    rule_type = "LzyBirth73001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Every note a story, every beat a tribute to the past.\nInnocent, mysterious, romantic, precious.\nAs the melody sounds, his memories are rekindled.\n\nRules:\n\n◆Play the melody of memories and receive Karma.\n\n1. Play songs using [c][C74848][Memory Notes][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Wish Stickers][-][/c] to receive Victor's exclusive Mini House gift [Handmade Collar Pin] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. While redeeming, you will also receive a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Victor's [c][C74848]childhood birthday story[-][/c].\n\n4. After reading all six of the stories, you can claim Victor's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Victor: Romance Symphony][-][/c].\n\n◆The more you play, the more you get.\n\nPlay the melody a certain number of times to claim rewards including Birthday Commemorative R Karma, Stamina, Markers.\n\n*[Markers] can be used to [c][C74848]customize special birthday outfits[-][/c] in Victor's [Date Plans].\n\n◆Listen to the past for a hopeful future.\n\nAfter receiving Birthday Karma [Romance Symphony], the [c][C74848][Corridor of Wishes][-][/c] will be unlocked. Tap the arrow at the right side of the screen to write down your wishes and dreams for your future together with him!"
  },
  [106] = {
    rule_type = "LzyBirth21552",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848] ◆Date Plans:[-][/c]\n\n1. In Date Plans, you can use [c][C74848][Markers][-][/c] to choose one out of two outfits to customize for him. Every time you choose one, it will count towards the total customization attempts.\n\n*You may obtain Markers through [Play Piano] progress rewards or [Write Wishes].\n\n2. After the event ends, the outfits for both themes will be created and can be found in Go See Him. The outfit that has been chosen more times in the server will be on sale first for a discount, and you may purchase it with [Time Coupon*1]. Meanwhile, the Live 2D effects can be unlocked with Time Coupon*198.\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Server Score Rewards:[-][/c]\n\n1. Your customization attempts will be counted as your Personal Score [c][C74848]at the ratio of 1:1[-][/c]\n\n2. If the total Personal Scores in the server reach the designated number, Server Rewards will be unlocked. Tap [Server Score Rewards] to view and claim.\n\n3. Server Score Rewards must be claimed manually.\n\nPlease stay tuned for future announcements for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available."
  },
  [107] = {
    rule_type = "LzyBirth73001_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the past and future converge at the present, our eternal sentiments will be forever engraved in time.\nOn this special day, use a Wish Note to write down your dreams of a future together with him!\n\n[c][C74848][Corridor of Wishes][-][/c] rules:\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Write down your wishes and redeem multiple awards including Right Beside You.[-][/c]\n\n1. Write down your wishes using [Memory Notes] and [Wish Stickers] to obtain item [Marker] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. Besides Markers, you will also receive [Wish Dewdrops] which can be used to redeem Birthday Karma of past years, outfits and other items in the shop. \n\n◆Make as many wishes as you can to get customized outfits!\n\nWrite down a designated number of total wishes to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Right Beside You, Stamina, and Markers[-][/c].\n\n* [Markers] can be used to customize special birthday outfits in Victor's [Date Plans]."
  },
  [108] = {
    rule_type = "LzyBirth73001_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Players will receive ranking rewards according to their position on the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent through Mail in 1-2 workdays after the event is over.

2. The outfit which players consume more Markers on will be displayed in the ranking.

3. Players who rank in the top 50 will also receive Special Edition title [c][C74848][Entwining Hearts][-][/c] and [c][C74848]2 customized outfits[-][/c] from [Date Plans]. If the server progress for the event reaches 100%, the top 50 players will also receive [c][C74848]Outfit Upgrade Items[-][/c] (can be used to upgrade the two outfits to Live2D outfits).

*Special Edition titles will be sent through Mail in 3 workdays after the event is over. As for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available, please stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [109] = {
    rule_type = "HomeLottery_44002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Celebrate New Year's with Him, in a home for just the two of you.

[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]

1. From 2025/1/26 5:00 to 2025/2/4 23:59, you can enter from Mini House into the event page. Each Man's corresponding event is only accessible from his Mini House.

2. During the event, you can spend Gems to purchase [c][C74848]Fondness Giftboxes[-][/c] and get one [c][C74848]random event gift or limited edition themed furniture[-][/c]. Each piece of themed furniture will only be received once during the tournament. Once unlocked, it will not be received again. After unlocking all furniture, subsequent purchases will grant event gifts.

3. If you do not receive furniture after [c][C74848]6[-][/c] purchases in a row, the [c][C74848]7th[-][/c] purchase must give out furniture. After furniture is received, the [c][C74848]count will be reset[-][/c].

4. The furniture received during the event can be arranged in the room via the Mini House's [c][C74848]Furnish[-][/c] function. You can also long-press on a piece of furniture to open its Furnish list.

5. The first time a Fondness Giftbox is purchased each day, you will get a [c][C74848]1-time half-off discount[-][/c]. This discount is applicable to each Man separately and resets daily at 5:00 a.m.

6. Some new furniture styles for this event are [c][C74848]Personal Space[-][/c] furniture which Producers can only furnish with after unlocking [c][C74848]Personal Space[-][/c]. After the event ends, furniture styles received will not disappear, and after their corresponding areas are unlocked, they can be furnished.]]
  },
  [110] = {
    rule_type = "XMVlog33007",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the Seasons, discover with Lucien the winter that belongs only to the two of you.
Event Time: 1/5 5:00-1/31 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Go on an outing with Lucien and take photos of him at the attractions to preserve the memory!
    Visit the attractions and take photos to unlock the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] of the corresponding location with a record of the memories of the trip.
    Visit the attractions and take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. After obtaining 12 stages, you can claim [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Lucien: Love in the Eyes][-][/c]!
    [c][C74848]New poses[-][/c] will be unlocked as you travel, so take more photos of him! You can use [Retake] to take different photos of him!

2. Tap [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] to take photos in a new location. The photos will be added to your travel album.
    You can obtain 1 chance to [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated. After finished taking photos at all the attractions, there will be no more chance to take photos.

3. Tap [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to take new photos of him at the attractions you have already visited.
    You can obtain 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated; Retakes can be purchased unlimitedly after being used up.
    Note: The retaken photos will not be updated in the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please make sure to save the retaken photos!

4. Use the [c][C74848]Quick Retake[-][/c] function to retake multiple photos and earn points.

5. Take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Innocence Points[-][/c]. Accumulate required Innocence Points to claim [c][C74848]Item Rewards[-][/c].
    Each photo grants 10 Innocence Points; each retaken photo grants 5 Innocence Points.]]
  },
  [111] = {
    rule_type = "62002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
On a sunny afternoon, give him delicately wrapped macaroons to get his heartfelt gift in return.

[c][C74848]Boxed Sweetness[-][/c] Rules

1. During the event, tap the gift package to give him [c][C74848]Macaroons[-][/c] and get his heartfelt gift in return. Tap [Treasure List] to see the return gift rewards.

2. Gifting Macaroons has a chance to encounter romance and randomly obtain a Sweet love limited Karma.

If no Karma has been obtained after [c][C74848]35[-][/c] consecutive times[-][/c] of gifting Macaroons, you will obtain a random Karma on [c][C74848]the 36th[-][/c] time[-][/c].

The number of times will [c][C74848]reset[-][/c] once you obtained a Karma.

3. Tap [Obtain] to see how to obtain Macaroons.

- [c][C74848]Daily Quests[-][/c]: Complete daily quests and claim Macaroon as the activeness rewards.

- [c][C74848]Mission Drops[-][/c]: Clear normal or elite missions for possible drops of Macaroon.

- [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c]: Buy Macaroon with Gold in Love Supply. Daily purchase limit 10.

4. The [c][C74848]Ribbon[-][/c] used to wrap Macaroons can be used to redeem specified items in Sweet Shop.]]
  },
  [112] = {
    rule_type = "preheat",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Gather the unheard voices, \nInvestigate to put together the truth,\nCreate a program that combines all your efforts,\nThat can become the light that illuminates the path ahead.\nThe production of the new Miracle Finder Special Episode needs the participation of [c][C74848]all producers[-][/c].\nThe event has two stages, the pre-production preparation focused [c][C74848]Collect Material[-][/c] stage and the post-production editing focused [c][C74848]Create Program[-][/c] stage. Stage Two will unlock after Stage One is completed.\n\n[Stage One: Collect Material]\n1.During Stage One, producers should go to [c][C74848]the four areas[-][/c] to search and film materials, every shoot will increase the [c][C74848]Server Progress[-][/c] of the corresponding area, and gain [c][C74848]Usable Material[-][/c]. The difficulty and output of the three missions [c][C74848]increases one by one[-][/c]. The higher shooting score the producer gets, the added Server Progress increases and the more Usable Material will drop. [c][C74848]The last mission of each area[-][/c] will provide the best output in material and scores.\n2.When the Server Progress of any area reaches 100%, all producers will get rewards and special buffs.\nHacker Consortium: [c][C74848]Creativity Up[-][/c], EXP and Creativity of all Karma +20%\nUltima Bioresearch: [c][C74848]Affinity Up[-][/c], EXP and Affinity of all Karma +20%\nNo Man's Island: [c][C74848]Decision Up[-][/c], EXP and Decision of all Karma +20%\nSTF: [c][C74848]Execution Up[-][/c], EXP and Execution of all Karma +20%\n\n3.Every shoot will consume one [c][C74848]Film Idea[-][/c]. During event, every day the number of Film Ideas will be reset to 5 at 05:00, but if the number of Film Ideas is over 5 then it won’t be reset.\nEvery day, you can use [c][C74848]Box Office Medal[-][/c] to redeem 5 Film Ideas additionally.\n4.After consuming Film Ideas 5 times in a day, you will randomly get one of the following additional one day special buff that will last until 05:00 the next day:\n[c][C74848]Broad View[-][/c]: All Victor’s Karma’s Attributes +25%\n[c][C74848]Focused[-][/c]: All Lucien’s Karma’s Attributes +25%\n[c][C74848]Quick-minded[-][/c]: All Kiro’s Karma’s Attributes +25%\n[c][C74848]Prompt Decision[-][/c]: All Gavin’s Karma’s Attributes +25%\n5.Please note: All the event buffs will only take effect in event shoot missions.\n\n\n[Stage Two: Create Program]\n1.When the Collect Material progress in all four areas is completed, the event will [c][C74848]automatically enter[-][/c] the second stage [c][C74848]Create Program[-][/c].\n2. During Stage Two, producers can submit Usable Material collected in Stage One, push forward server production progress, and get reward items.\nComplete daily quests in Stage Two to get more server rewards!\n*More details will be available after Stage Two is unlocked"
  },
  [113] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth21559",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]◆Date Plans:[-][/c]\n\n1. In Date Plans, you can use[c][C74848][Markers][-][/c] to choose one out of two outfits to customize for him. Every time you choose one, it will count towards the total customization attempts.\n\n*You may obtain Markers through [Solve Puzzles] progress rewards or [Write Wishes].\n\n2. After the event ends, the outfits for both themes will be created and available in Go See Him.\nThe outfit that has been chosen more times in the server will be sold first at a discount, and you may purchase it with [1 Time Coupon].\n\n[c][C74848]◆Server Score Rewards:[-][/c]\n\n1. Your customization attempts will be counted as your Personal Score [c][C74848]by a certain ratio[-][/c].\n\n2. If the total Personal Scores in the server reach the designated number, Server Rewards will be unlocked. Tap [Server Score Rewards] to view and claim.\n\n3. Server Score Rewards must be claimed manually.\n\n4. If you've completed the full score progress, both outfits in Date Plans can be upgraded to [c][C74848]Live2D outfits[-][/c] later on!\n\nStay tuned for future announcements."
  },
  [114] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth73002_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the past and future converge at the present, our eternal sentiments will be forever engraved in time.\nOn this special day, use a Wish Note to write down your dreams of a future together with Him!\n\n[c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c] rules:\n\n[c][C74848]◆Write down your wishes and redeem multiple awards including Right Beside You.[-][/c]\n\n1. Write down your wishes using [Rainbow Paint] and [Wish Stickers] to obtain item [Marker] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. Besides Markers, you will also receive [Wish Dewdrops] which can be used to redeem Birthday Karma of previous years, outfits and other items in the shop. \n\n◆Make as many wishes as you can to get customized outfits!\n\nWrite down a designated number of total wishes to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Right Beside You, Stamina, and Markers[-][/c].\n\n* [Markers] can be used to customize special birthday outfits in Kiro's [Date Plans]."
  },
  [115] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth73002_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Players will receive ranking rewards according to their position on the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent through Mail in 1-2 workdays after the event is over.

2. The outfit which players consume more Markers on will be displayed in the ranking.

3. Top 50 players will also receive event exclusive title [c][C74848][Dream Song][-][/c] and [c][C74848]2 customized outfits[-][/c] from [Date Plans]. If the server progress for the event reaches 100%, the top 50 players will also receive [c][C74848]Outfit Upgrade Items[-][/c] (can be used to upgrade the two outfits to Live2D outfits).

*Event exclusive titles will be sent through Mail in 3 workdays after the event is over. As for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available, please stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [116] = {
    rule_type = "PayReward",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "四季同行，与许墨共同寻找只属于二人的春天。\n活动时间：2020/2/26 更新后 - 2020/3/23 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.与许墨一同出游，在景点中为他拍摄照片留念吧！\n    游览景点并拍照后，可以解锁对应地点的[c][C74848]旅行相册[-][/c]，收录记录旅行的点点滴滴。\n    游览景点并拍照后，可以获得[c][C74848]旅拍进展[-][/c]，获得12次进展后，即可领取[c][C74848]SSR羁绊[许墨·眼底情句][-][/c]！\n    在旅行的过程中，将会不断解锁[c][C74848]更多新姿势[-][/c]，请多试试为他拍照吧！可以使用【重新拍照】，为他拍摄更多不同的照片哦~\n\n2. 点击[c][C74848]拍照[-][/c]，可以前往一个新的地点进行拍照，并记录进旅行相册中。\n    每天可获得1次[c][C74848]拍照[-][/c]次数，每天5:00刷新，次数不累计。完成全部景点拍摄后，将不会再获得拍照机会。\n\n3.点击[c][C74848]重新拍照[-][/c]，可以前往已经拍过的景点为他重新拍摄新的照片。\n    每天可获得6次免费[c][C74848]重新拍照[-][/c]次数，每天5:00刷新，次数不累计；使用完后可以购买，购买不限次数。\n    注意：重新拍照的照片不会在[c][C74848]旅行相册[-][/c]中更新，请注意保存好重拍照片哦！\n\n4.使用[c][C74848]快速拍照[-][/c]功能，可以一次性消耗多次重拍次数并获得积分。\n\n5.拍照可获得[c][C74848]童心值[-][/c]。童心值累计达到档位要求后，即可领取[c][C74848]道具奖励[-][/c]。\n    每次拍照可获得10点童心值；每次重新拍照可获得5点童心值。"
  },
  [117] = {
    rule_type = "preheat2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Gather the unheard voices, \nInvestigate to put together the truth,\nCreate a program that combines all your efforts,\nThat can become the light that illuminates the path ahead.\nAll four areas have reached 100% progress, material collection has completed, post-production stage begins now!\n\n[Stage Two: Create Program]\n1.During Stage Two, you can choose of three phases of production (Film Editing, Sound Effects and Music Score) and submit Usable Materials gathered in Stage One, push forward the [c][C74848]Server Progress[-][/c] of the corresponding phase, and get same amount of [c][C74848]Rough Cuts[-][/c]. After a phase is completed, you’ll get [Starpicking Coupon] which can be used to pull new Main Story Karma, Chapter Item [Lapis Lazuli] and other rewards\n2.Use Rough Cut to redeem [c][C74848]Crystal·Feeling[-][/c], open to get [Lapis Lazuli],  [Starpicking Coupon] and other items.\n3.When the server progress of a phases reaches 100%, all producers can claim completion rewards.\nWhen the server progress of all three phases reaches 100%, Create Program is completed.\n4. After the end of the production, you can still submit materials to get Rough Cuts and redeem Crystal. \nThe number of Usable Material submitted will be counted in the [c][C74848]Ranking[-][/c], after the event ends rewards will be sent based on your rank.\n5.During Stage Two, every day a new layer of buff will be activated that will [c][C74848]last until the end of the event[-][/c].\n[c][C74848]Inspiration[-][/c]: For each layer, the Usable Material dropped in event missions will increase by 15%\n\n6.Please note: All the event buffs will only take effect in event shoot missions."
  },
  [118] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth73002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Every color a story, every key a keeper of the past.\nInnocent, mysterious, romantic, precious.\nAs the treasure map unfolds, memories with him are rekindled.\n\nEvent Time:\nApr 6th 05:00 - Apr 12th 23:59\n\nRules:\n\n◆Solve puzzles to receive Karma.\n\n1. Fill the map with [c][C74848][Rainbow Paint][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Wish Stickers][-][/c] to receive Kiro's birthday exclusive Mini House gift [Feather Pillow] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. While redeeming, you will also receive a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Kiro's [c][C74848]childhood birthday story[-][/c].\n\n4. After reading all six stories, you can claim Kiro's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Kiro: Candy Party][-][/c].\n\n◆The more puzzles you solve, the more rewards you get.\n\nSolve puzzles a certain number of times to claim rewards including [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, Markers].\n\n*[Markers] can be used to [c][C74848]customize special birthday outfits[-][/c] in Kiro's [Date Plans].\n\n◆Listen to the past to unlock the future.\n\nReceiving Birthday Karma [Candy Party] will unlock [c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c]. Tap the arrow at the right side of the screen to write down your wishes and dreams for your future together with Him!"
  },
  [119] = {
    rule_type = "MainLineRule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
At the very first moment of time, universe came into existence. As the sun started to shine, lives were formed. All the past you spent with him now shines brilliantly in the endless night sky.  

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]  
1. Select your favorite Karma, then bring along [c][C74848]Memory Starcase[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupon[-][/c] to the Star Ocean to receive [c][C74848]one Karma Shard[-][/c] of the selected Karma and [c][C74848]two Pure Shards[-][/c].  
2. Additionally, you may also get [c][C74848]one Pure Shard[-][/c] or [c][C74848]one random Karma Shard[-][/c].  
 *Once all the 80 Shards of a particular Karma are obtained, you will no longer receive this Karma Shard in random rewards via Starpicking.  
3. The [c][C74848]Pure Shards[-][/c] obtained in Starpicking can be redeemed for [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupons[-][/c] or other rewards in [c][C74848]Star Shop[-][/c].  
4. [c][C74848]Memory Starcase[-][/c] can be earned from: 
 *Main story stage time-limited drop  
 *After the event ends, unused Memory Starcase will be converted into Gold at a ratio of [c][C74848]1 Memory Starcase =10 Gold[-][/c] and sent via mail.  
5. [c][C74848]Starpicking Coupon[-][/c] can be earned from: 
 *EVOL Supply - Love Supply Limited Sale 
 *EVOL Supply - Gift Package - Hot Sale Reward 
 *Redeemed with Pure Shard in Star Shop]],
    rule_icon = "z"
  },
  [120] = {
    rule_type = "46004",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Give Shards to Friends: [-][/c]

1. To give a Shard to a Friend, you need to consume 1 [c][C74848]Friendship Feather[-][/c], and your Karma Shards won't be consumed.

2. After giving, the beneficiary will get 1 Karma Shard of his/her wishes.

3. During the event, you can have the chance to get up to 1 [c][C74848]Friendship Feather[-][/c] a day after completing any Normal or Elite [c][C74848]Missions[-][/c] in the Main Story.

4. During the event, you can claim an extra reward after giving Shards to a total of 7 [c][C74848]different Friends[-][/c].

[c][C74848]Publish Wish:[-][/c] 

1. You need to have at least 1 Event Karma Shard or Event Karma to publish a wish.

2. Each player can only publish 1 wish a day, and another after 5:00 the next day.

3. After publishing the wish, Friends can see your wish in the "Shard Exchange" page and consume the Friendship Feathers to realize it.

4. The Karma Shards obtained from Friends will be sent by [c][C74848]mail[-][/c], and the mail will be retained for 8 days. Please claim them in time.

5. The wish that has been realized won't appear again in the Wish Lists of Friends. If the wish hasn't been realized, it will be removed at 5:00 the next day and you will need to publish another one.

6. The wish that has been realized won't be shown in the Wish List.]]
  },
  [121] = {
