    rule_desc = [[
Reality and illusion intertwine. The truth is so close yet so far. With each step of the investigation, will you find the answer buried deep in your heart...


[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]


1. Obtain [c][C74848]Event Exclusive Karmas[-][/c] of the Memory Maze to [c][C74848]automatically[-][/c] unlock Buff! It will [c][C74848]increase the number of Round Tokens[-][/c] dropped in stages and [c][C74848]grant[-][/c][c][C74848]Exploring Pts[-][/c], so stay tuned!

