  [124] = {
    rule_type = "SpringAprilBingo",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "给自己放个假，和他一起静静享受这一份悠闲和温暖。\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.首次开启活动时，可选择任意一名角色，进入他的活动界面；每个角色的界面中有9块拼图\n\n2.活动期间，通关任意普通或精英关卡，均可获得[c][C74848]毛毯[-][/c]；消耗毛毯即可[c][C74848]点亮拼图[-][/c]\n\n3.点亮方法：拼图数量足够时，点击2下拼图，即可点亮\n\n4.点亮同一角色的9块拼图后，点击[c][C74848]“拆开”[-][/c]，就能看到他给你的假日寄语\n\n5.假日寄语可分享到微博或微信朋友圈，首次分享这名角色的寄语，可领取一个[c][C74848]按摩仪[-][/c]；按摩仪可在[c][C74848]温心小铺[-][/c]中兑换[c][C74848]半晌得闲系列R羁绊[-][/c]\n\n6.活动期间，可以更换选择的角色；分享不同角色的寄语，可领取多次分享奖励；每位角色只能分享领取一次\n\n7.毛毯还可以在[c][C74848]温心小铺[-][/c]中兑换其他丰厚奖励"
  },
  [125] = {
    rule_type = "SpringMayBingo",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
You speak each other's unspoken language and share a tacit understanding.

[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c]

1. When you enter the event for the first time, you can choose one character and go to his event page; there are 9 pieces of puzzles on each character's page.

2. During event, whenever you clear a Normal or Elite Mission, you will get [c][C74848]Block Box[-][/c]; consume Block Box to [c][C74848]light up the puzzle[-][/c].

3. How to light up a puzzle: When you have enough Block Box, tap a puzzle two times and it will light up.

4. When you have lit up all 9 puzzles of one character, tap [c][C74848]Open[-][/c] to see his Tender Words.

5. Share his Tender Words for the first time and you will get one [c][C74848]Wind-Up Key[-][/c]; use Wind-Up Key in [c][C74848]Heart Joy Shop[-][/c] to redeem [c][C74848]Between the Lines R Karma[-][/c].

6. During event, you can change the character chosen; share Tender Words from different characters to get multiple rewards; for each character, rewards will only be give for the first time you share his Tender Words.

7. You can use Block Box to redeem other rewards in [c][C74848]Heart Joy Shop[-][/c].]]
  },
  [126] = {
    rule_type = "lxBirth21561",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848] ◆Date Plans:[-][/c]\n\n1. In Date Plans, you can use[c][C74848][Markers][-][/c] to choose one out of two outfits to customize for him. Every time you choose one, it will count towards the total customization attempts.\n\n*You may obtain Markers through [Perform Divination] progress rewards or [Write Wishes].\n\n2. After the event ends, the outfits for both themes will be created and available in Go See Him.\nThe outfit that has been chosen more times in the server will be sold first at a discount, and you may purchase it with [1 Time Coupon].\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Server Score Rewards:[-][/c]\n\n1. Your customization attempts will be counted as your Personal Score [c][C74848]by a certain ratio[-][/c].\n\n2. If the total Personal Scores in the server reach the designated number, Server Rewards will be unlocked. Tap [Server Score Rewards] to view and claim.\n\n3. Server Score Rewards must be claimed manually.\n\n4. If you've completed the full score progress, both outfits in Date Plans can be upgraded to [c][C74848]Live2D outfits[-][/c] later on!\n\nStay tuned for future announcements."
  },
  [127] = {
    rule_type = "lxBirth73003_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the past and future converge at the present, our eternal sentiments will be forever engraved in time.\nOn this special day, use a Wish Note to write down your dreams of a future together with your favorite guy!\n\n[c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c] rules:\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Write down your wishes and redeem multiple awards including Right Beside You.[-][/c]\n\n1. Write down your wishes using [Divination Coins] and [Wish Stickers] to obtain item [Marker] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. Besides Markers, you will also receive [Wish Dewdrops] which can be used to redeem other items in the shop. \n\n◆Make as many wishes as you can to get customized outfits!\n\nWrite down a designated number of total wishes to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Right Beside You, Stamina, and Markers[-][/c].\n\n* [Markers] can be used to customize special birthday outfits in Shaw's [Date Plans]."
  },
  [128] = {
    rule_type = "lxBirth73003_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Players will receive ranking rewards according to their position on the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent through Mail in 1-2 workdays after the event is over.

2. The outfit which players consume more Markers on will be displayed in the ranking.

3. Top 50 players will also receive Special Edition title [c][C74848][Summer Imprint][-][/c] and [c][C74848]2 customized outfits[-][/c] from [Date Plans]. If the server progress for the event reaches 100%, the top 50 players will also receive [c][C74848]Outfit Upgrade Items[-][/c] (can be used to upgrade the two outfits to Live2D outfits).

*Special Edition titles will be sent through Mail in 3 workdays after the event is over. As for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available, please stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [129] = {
    rule_type = "lxBirth73003",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Under each wisp of dust buries a precious memory. Each of which is an unknown and novel experience.\nMysterious, flamboyant, complex, pure.\nDivine the real him with your sincere heart.\n\nEvent Time:\nJune 20, 2021, 5:00 to June 26, 2021, 23:59.\n\nRules:\n\n◆Solve puzzles to receive Karma.\n\n1. Perform Divination with [c][C74848][Divination Coins][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Wish Stickers][-][/c] to receive Bond Wish (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. While redeeming, you will also receive a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Shaw's [c][C74848]childhood birthday story[-][/c].\n\n4. After reading all six stories, you can claim Shaw's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Shaw: Midsummer Sparks][-][/c].\n\n◆The more puzzles you solve, the more rewards you get.\n\nSolve puzzles a certain number of times to claim rewards including [Birthday Commemorative R Karma, Stamina, Markers].\n\n*[Markers] can be used to [c][C74848]customize special birthday outfits[-][/c] in Shaw's [Date Plans].\n\n◆Listen to the past to unlock the future.\n\nReceiving Birthday Karma [Midsummer Sparks] will unlock [c][C74848][Corridor of Wishes][-][/c]. Tap the arrow at the right side of the screen to write down your wishes and dreams for your future together with your man!"
  },
  [130] = {
    rule_type = "MemoryMazePermenant",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the barriers of time and space, you finally met each other again in Loveland City. The long-awaited reunion, the desperate longings, the choices with unexpected outcomes... The Memory Slot captured every bittersweet moment, but together you will overcome all the dangers ahead. The love between you lasts beyond time.  

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Memory Maze is now available permanently! Clear the main story to unlock the corresponding Memory Maze and obtain the main story Karma.

- Clear Main Story 11-1 to unlock [c][C74848]Memory Maze - The Darkest Hour[-][/c]
- Clear Main Story 15-1 to unlock [c][C74848]Memory Maze - End of The Abyss[-][/c]
- Clear Main Story 19-1 to unlock [c][C74848]Memory Maze - Daybreak[-][/c]
- Clear Main Story 22-1 to unlock [c][C74848]Memory Maze - Infinite Future[-][/c]
- Clear Main Story 25-1 to unlock [c][C74848]Memory Maze - Homecoming[-][/c]

2. When the producer clears the above stages [c][C74848]for the first time[-][/c], the Memory Maze of the corresponding volume can be unlocked. Each Memory Maze lasts for 10 days.

3. Only one Memory Maze can be unlocked at a time. The next Memory Maze can only be unlocked after the current Memory Maze's duration ends.

4. Memory Maze can be unlocked again at any time using the Destiny Dice.

*[Destiny Dice] can be redeemed at the Box Office Contest shop once per month and is valid for the month. The Redeem attempt will be refreshed at 5:00 on the first day of every month.]]
  },
  [131] = {
    rule_type = "MemoryMazeLimitTime",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the barriers of time and space, you finally met each other again in Loveland City. The long-awaited reunion, the desperate longings, the choices with unexpected outcomes... The Memory Slot captured every bittersweet moment, but together you will overcome all the dangers ahead. The love between you lasts beyond time.  

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. The time-limited Memory Maze Main Story Karma event is now open with no precondition! Producers can choose to unlock the Memory Maze of any selected main story chapters for free to obtain the corresponding main story Karma.

2. During the time-limited event, you can unlock the corresponding Memory Maze without clearing the corresponding chapter.

3. You can only unlock Memory Maze with no precondition [c][C74848]once[-][/c].

4. The selected Memory Maze will be closed after the time-limited event. Please pay attention to the time limit.

5. Memory Maze will become permanently available after the event. Clear specified chapters to unlock the desired Memory Maze event again with items. The required item will be regularly available in the Box Office Contest shop. Please stay tuned for further information.]]
  },
  [132] = {
    rule_type = "title_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
The title system has been updated!

There are two types of titles; [c][C74848]Combination titles and Standalone titles[-][/c].

1. There are two types of combination titles, one that is used in the former half and one in the latter half. The two can be combined together as a whole title. However, titles with different character attributes cannot be used together, while attributeless titles can match with all other titles.

2. Combination titles can be obtained by completing the [Momentos] series in [Achievement: Romance]. You can also obtain each character's exclusive title by raising your Bond Level in the [Momentos] system.

3. Titles that cannot be combined can be found in "Standalone Titles". These titles can be equipped on their own on the corresponding page.

4. You may check all titles that you've obtained or not yet obtained as well as methods to obtain them on Title Origin page. Try experimenting and coming up with your own unique title!]]
  },
  [133] = {
    rule_type = "my_daybook_rank_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Momentos Rankings rules:[-][/c]

1. Your place on Total Bond Points Rankings is decided by the sum of Bond Points you obtained from all characters.  Your places on another four rankings are determined by the Bond Points you have with the corresponding character.

2. All Momentos Rankings will be tallied at [c][C74848]5:00 on the first day of each month[-][/c]. All players ranking in the [c][C74848]Top 50[-][/c] can receive corresponding [c][C74848]title rewards[-][/c], which can be used for 30 days.

3. If you reach Top 50 in multiple rankings when the monthly results are out, you can receive multiple rewards.

4. After the results are tallied, you'll find your rewards the next time you enter the "Momentos: Rankings" interface. If you haven't claimed the rankings rewards by the time the following month's results are tallied, the rewards will be automatically deleted, so remember to claim them in time!]]
  },
  [134] = {
    rule_type = "my_daybook_rank_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Momentos Ranking details: [-][/c]

1. Only players whose Bond Points are 500 points or above will appear on the total Bond Points Ranking. As for the rankings for individual characters, only those who have 100 Bond Points or above can appear on the ranking.

2. The Top 50 players with the most points will appear on each ranking. Rankings are refreshed every 10 minutes.

3. Ranking results are tallied at 5:00 on the first day of each month, and the results will be displayed until 12:00 on the same day (meaning that the rankings will remain frozen and cannot be refreshed). After 12:00, the rankings will be updated as usual.]]
  },
  [135] = {
    rule_type = "SevenDays61001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Every day we're together things happen that are worth writing down, a record of precious moments, from budding feelings to love in full bloom.\n\n[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c]\n1. Complete [c][C74848]Main Story 1-4[-][/c] to begin the Event. The Event lasts for [c][C74848]15[-][/c] days with countdown continuing when offline. Pay close attention to the countdown on the Event page and claim your rewards promptly.\n\n2.[c][C74848]Mission Series[-][/c]: When the Event starts, a 12 [c][C74848]Mission Series[-][/c] is unlocked, with each Mission containing [c][C74848]multiple stages[-][/c]. Completing each stage of the mission to earn token rewards and to unlock the next stage of the mission.\n\n3. Every time a stage is completed you gain 1 [c][C74848]Feeling[-][/c]. Accumulate [c][C74848]Feeling[-][/c] to claim Progress [c][C74848]Rewards[-][/c] and unlock [c][C74848]Leisure Records[-][/c].\n* The Growth Diary is also included in the [c][C74848]Leisure Records[-][/c]—\n\nWhen progress reaches a specified target you also receive an [c][C74848]SSR Karma[-][/c] Reward!\n\n4. Time-limited Event shops are open for the duration of the Event, [c][C74848]Scribe Shop[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Keepsake Shop[-][/c], where you can use tokens and gems to buy discount items!\n* Energy shop items will also appear in the [c][C74848]Keepsake Shop[-][/c]—\n\n5. At the end of the Event, Event SSR Karma become available at the [c][C74848]Wish Tree - Heart Flower[-][/c] Exchange Shop, where they can be purchased with [c][C74848]Heart Flowers[-][/c]."
  },
  [136] = {
    rule_type = "LZYVlog33008",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Travel through the seasons and trace the curvature of your heart with Victor at your side.
Event period: 2023/8/15 5:00~2023/9/3 23:59


[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Head out with Victor and take pictures for him in the scenic spots!
    Snapping a photo at a scenic spot will unlock that location inside the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] and record your trip.
    Snapping a photo at a scenic spot will award [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. Gaining 9 progressions will award you the [c][C74848]SR Karma [Victor: Athletic Charm][-][/c]!
    You'll unlock [c][C74848]more poses[-][/c] during your trip. Try them out and take your favorite photo for him! You can tap on [Retake] to take a photo of him in a different pose.

2. Tap on [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] to head to a new location and take photos for your Travel Album.
    You get one [c][C74848]Photo Shoot[-][/c] per day that refreshes each day at 5 AM and does not accumulate to the next day. Once you've taken a photo at each location, you will stop getting additional Photo Shoots.

3. Tap on [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to retake the photo at a previously visited scenic spot.
    You get 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day that refresh each day at 5 AM and do not accumulate to the next day. These can also be purchased without limit.
    Please note: Retakes will not be updated inside the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please save them yourselves!

4. You can use the [c][C74848]Quick Photo[-][/c] feature to quickly use all Retakes and gain points.

5. Taking photos will award [c][C74848]Sunlight Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Sunlight Point milestones will unlock [c][C74848]amazing items[-][/c].
    Taking a photo each time awards 10 Sunlight Pts. Each retake awards 5 Sunlight Pts.]]
  },
  [137] = {
    rule_type = "Card_Adv_52002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Go on a free-wheeling trip with Him and discover wonders unknown. 

[c][C74848][On the Way] Rerun Event Rules:[-][/c]   
 
1. Tap the "Travel Prep" button and spend a [c][C74848]Heart Stationery[-][/c] and take a trip. On each trip, you're guaranteed to get 1 [c][C74848]Checklist Stamp[-][/c], with a chance of getting a random reward, including [c][C74848][Gavin: Summer Trades] Karma Shards[-][/c]~ 

2. Each trip will have a random destination, time, and weather for the itinerary. If the itinerary is a good fit, there's a chance of activating an [c][C74848]Incident[-][/c]. Incidents that you've already activated will be recorded in the [c][C74848]Travelogue[-][/c]. Collect and [c][C74848]read[-][/c] all of the incidents to claim a bonus reward.

3. [c][C74848]Checklist Stamps[-][/c] received on your trips can be redeemed in the [c][C74848]Roadside Shop[-][/c] for various rewards.]]
