  [138] = {
    rule_type = "LastDayEve",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Though light fades and the world falls apart,
Hold tight to that constant faith and karma.
The path to tomorrow is still yours to decide.

2021/9/19 5:00 - 2021/9/25 23:59

The Apocalypse Eve event is running for a limited time. During the event, every day brand new exploration content will be unlocked. By taking part in the event and explorations, you can experience a [c][C74848]special plot[-][/c] leading up to the apocalypse. For each exploration, you'll receive a corresponding exploration points. Gather enough points to claim [c][C74848]Ch.37 Main Story Unlock Coins[-][/c] and other rewards.

*After the event ends, it will be placed permanently in the Main Story stages. After passing [c][C74848]Ch.36 Main Story[-][/c], Producers can enter this event page.

[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]

1. Before the apocalypse comes, choose the One you hold in the depths of your heart. Enter His event page and go with Him on [c][C74848]7 days[-][/c] in a row of explorations. During the event, you can tap to switch between the male protagonists and enter another event page.
*Each Man has His own separate exploration progress.

2. During the event, [c][C74848]every day at 5:00 a.m. we will unlock[-][/c] brand new exploration content. Producers must take part in daily exploration events for each date in order. Daily exploration content includes [c][C74848]2 plot incidents[-][/c]. When everything is gathered, this day's exploration is completed, and you may take part in the next day's exploration.
*Each Man has different exploration plots.

3. Each exploration will cost [c][C74848]8 pts of Stamina[-][/c], for a total of [c][C74848]1 exploration point[-][/c]. During explorations, little incidents will randomly occur. Complete these little incidents to obtain small item rewards. When you reach a certain amount of exploration points, you can claim a free corresponding item reward. Among them, at [c][C74848]25/75/125/175/225/275/325/375[-][/c] point totals, you can claim [c][C74848]Ch.37 Main Story Unlock Coins[-][/c].

4. Complete daily explorations and gather plot incidents to get exclusive event messages, Moments posts, SMS texts, News posts, and other content rewards. Collected incidents can be viewed any time in the Incidents Overview page. Other content rewards can be viewed in their corresponding in-game systems.]]
  },
  [139] = {
    rule_type = "MainlinePresaleRule_40008",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848] Rules and Instructions: [-][/c]\n1. [c][C74848] Bay of Memory [-][/c] will start after the Sep. 29, 2021 update. New Main Story SSR Karma including [c][C74848] Victor - Rosy Night, Lucien - Fleeting Moments, Kiro - 52 Hz Melody, Gavin - Sea of Stars, and Shaw - Captured [-][/c] will be available at the time.\nMeanwhile, new ER Karma including [c][C74848] Victor - Emotional Walls, Lucien - A Way Out, Kiro - Hide and Seek, Gavin - Sharp Blade, and Shaw - Scorching Heat [-][/c] will be released.\n\n2. [c][C74848] Bay of Memory Pre-Sale [-][/c] will start on September 26, 2021. Buy the Pre-Sale Pack during the event and win extra-value rewards: Echoing Conch ×10 and Gem ×88. The Pre-Sale Pack can only be purchased once.\n\n3. After the puchase targets set for all producers are met, those having purchased the Pre-Sale Pack can claim [c][C74848] extra rewards [-][/c]:\nPearl Shell×2 and Stamina×60 for 750 purchases;\nPearl Shell×2 and Stamina×80 for 1,500 purchases;\nPearl Shell×2 and Stamina×100 for 2,250 purchases;\nPearl Shell×2 and Stamina×120 for 3,000 purchases;\nProducers purchasing the Pre-Sale Pack after the targets are met can claim these rewards too.\n\n*[c][C74848] Pearl Shell [-][/c] can be used during [c][C74848] Bay of Memory [-][/c] to obtain new Main Story SSR Karma;\n*[c][C74848] Echoing Conch [-][/c] can be used during [c][C74848] Bay of Memory [-][/c] to obtain new Main Story ER Karma;\n"
  },
  [140] = {
    rule_type = "62003",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]恋与知味[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击点单并使用[c][C74848]赏味券[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用赏味券有概率随机获取恋与知味限定R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用赏味券未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n[c][C74848]通过相关线下活动也有机会获得限定羁绊。[-][/c]\n\n3.点击赏味券数量右侧的加号可以查看赏味券的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得赏味券奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落赏味券；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费钻石购买赏味券。\n\n4.使用赏味券点单获得的[c][C74848]鸡密宝箱[-][/c]可以在【食味驿站】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
