  [143] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_15015",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "In a lightless world, longing and karma slumber in the depths of memory. Seek out every moment of your entwined past with him, light up the bubbles, and unleash the most indispensable love and oxygen.\n\n[c][C74848]Bay of Memory · Beach of Pearls  Rules[-][/c]\n\n1. In Beach of Pearls, spend the item [c][C74848]Pearl Shell[-][/c] to perform [c][C74848]Gathering[-][/c], and you will receive a Pearl guaranteed, plus an extra random reward, with a chance of getting a Season One brand new [c][C74848]Main Story SSR Karma[-][/c].\n\n2. While gathering, you can only get SSR Karma that you have wished for. Unwished for SSR Karma will not be available. Your Wish Karma can be changed any time.\n\n3. When you've gathered a certain amount of Pearls, you can claim a bonus reward in [c][C74848]Total Reward[-][/c]. Bonus rewards include [c][C74848]Galaxy Wish Coupons and Event SSR Karma Giftboxes[-][/c]. Tide of Recollection and Beach of Pearls total progress are counted separately. After switching your Wish Karma, your accumulated progress will not be altered."
  },
  [144] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_15016",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "In a lightless world, longing and karma slumber in the depths of memory. Seek out every moment of your entwined past with him, light up the bubbles, and unleash the most indispensable love and oxygen.\n\n[c][C74848]Bay of Memory · Tide of Recollection Rules[-][/c]\n\n1. In Tide of Recollection, spend the item [c][C74848]Echo Conch[-][/c] to perform [c][C74848]Calling[-][/c], and you will receive an Echo guaranteed, plus an extra random reward, with a chance of getting a Season Two brand new rarity level of Karma -- [c][C74848]ER Karma[-][/c].\n\n2. While calling, you can only get ER Karma that you have wished for. Unwished for ER Karma will not be available. Your Wish Karma can be changed any time.\n\n3. When you've gathered a certain amount of Echoes, you can claim a bonus reward in [c][C74848]Total Reward[-][/c]. Bonus rewards include [c][C74848] Outfit Giftboxes and Event ER Karma Giftboxes[-][/c]. Tide of Recollection and Beach of Pearls total progress are counted separately. After switching your Wish Karma, your accumulated progress will not be altered."
  },
  [145] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_267",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "In a lightless world, longing and karma slumber in the depths of memory. Seek out every moment of your entwined past with him, light up the bubbles, and unleash the most indispensable love and oxygen.\n\n[c][C74848]Bay of Memory  Rules[-][/c]\n\n1. The event is divided into two parts, Bay of Memory · Tide of Recollection and Bay of Memory · Beach of Pearls:\nIn Tide of Recollection, you can receive the brand new rarity level Main Story Karma -- [c][C74848]ER Karma[-][/c].\nIn Beach of Pearls, you can receive Season One brand new [c][C74848]Main Story SSR Karma[-][/c].\nProgress for the two parts are separate, and you can switch between them any time.\n\n2. Before entering Tide of Recollection or Beach of Pearls, you must [c][C74848]select any 3 cards[-][/c] from among the 5 Limited Karmas to make a wish. [c][C74848]Once your wish is made, you can only receive those Wish Karmas[-][/c]. The odds for receiving any of the 3 Wish Karmas is the same, and each Karma can be received repeatedly. Any Karmas not wished for at this point will be unavailable.\n\n3. Wish Karmas can be [c][C74848]switched at any time[-][/c].\n\n4. In Tide of Recollection, when you gather a certain number of Echoes, you can claim a [c][C74848]Outfit Giftbox or Event ER Karma Giftbox[-][/c] reward. In Beach of Pearls, when you gather a certain number of Pearls, you can claim a [c][C74848]Galaxy Wish Coupon or Event SSR Karma Giftbox[-][/c] reward."
  },
