  [151] = {
    rule_type = "ERcard",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]I. ER Development Rules[-][/c]

1. ER development can raise Karma Attributes. [c][C74848]2[-][/c] ER cards of the [c][C74848]same character[-][/c] that meet development requirements can be used in the [c][C74848]Karma Combine[-][/c] feature to greatly raise Karma values by spending [c][C74848]Memory Starlocks[-][/c] to combine them into an SER Karma.
*ER Karma has a more simplified Ascend system so that you can meet development requirements faster.

2. Memory Starlocks can be obtained via [c][C74848]Passing ER Karma[-][/c]:

(1) [c][C74848]Passing[-][/c] 1 ER Karma yields 2 Memory Starlocks.

(2) [c][C74848]Crafting[-][/c] 1 SER costs 2 Memory Starlocks. When SER Karma is [c][C74848]split[-][/c] into ER Karmas, you will get back 1 Memory Starlock.

3. Corresponding [c][C74848]Karma Advancement[-][/c] tiers for ER Karma will be unlocked after [c][C74848]reading accompanying Dates or Rumors & Secrets[-][/c]. After a tier is unlocked, you can spend [c][C74848]Memory Stardust[-][/c] to advance.

[c][C74848]2. SER Development Rules[-][/c]

1. SER Karma can only be obtained by combining [c][C74848]2[-][/c] ER cards of the [c][C74848]same character[-][/c]. Developing SER Karma can raise Karma Attributes.

(1) The first 10 SER Karma Ascend nodes are already completed during ER Karma ascension.

(2) The first six stars of SER Karma Star Up rewards are obtained for developing 2 ER Karmas. The seven star reward is for developing SER Karma.

2. SER Karma can be split into its original 2 ER Karmas via the [c][C74848]Split[-][/c] feature. After splitting, the upgrade materials spent based on the SER Karma's level will be returned. Star Up rewards will not be rescinded, nor will Star Up materials be refunded.

(1) SER Karma Split requires [c][C74848]resetting ascension[-][/c] and removing ascension Attribute boosts, along with a 100% refund of development materials.

(2) SER Split will refund 1 [c][C74848]Memory Starlock[-][/c].

(3) After splitting, you will receive 2 ER Karma cards which [c][C74848]keep their pre-Combine development level[-][/c].

3. You can [c][C74848]switch the Karma Picture[-][/c] for SER Karma any time using the button in the lower left corner of the Karma. After switching, the corresponding Karma name will be displayed. You can then enter the Karma's accompanying Date or Rumors & Secrets via the "Go on a Date" link.]]
  },
