  [153] = {
    rule_type = "bqBirth21566",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848] ◆Date Plans:[-][/c]\n\n1. In Date Plans, you can use[c][C74848][Markers][-][/c] to choose one out of two outfits to customize for him. Every time you choose one, it will count towards the total customization attempts.\n\n*You may obtain Markers through [Tap Wind Chime] progress rewards or [Write Wishes].\n\n2. After the event ends, the outfits for both themes will be created and available in Go See Him.\nThe outfit that has been chosen more times in the server will be sold first at a discount, and you may purchase it with [1 Time Coupon].\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Server Score Rewards:[-][/c]\n\n1. Your customization attempts will be counted as your Personal Score [c][C74848]by a certain ratio[-][/c].\n\n2. If the total Personal Scores in the server reach the designated number, Server Rewards will be unlocked. Tap [Server Score Rewards] to view and claim.\n\n3. Server Score Rewards must be claimed manually.\n\n4. If you've completed the full score progress, both outfits in Date Plans can be upgraded to [c][C74848]Live2D outfits[-][/c] later on!\n\nStay tuned for future announcements."
  },
  [154] = {
    rule_type = "bqBirth73004_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the past and future converge at the present, our eternal sentiments will be forever engraved in time.\nOn this special day, use a Wish Note to write down your dreams of a future together!\n\n[c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c] rules:\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Write down your wishes and redeem multiple awards including Right Beside You.[-][/c]\n\n1. Write down your wishes using [Wind Chime Sail] and [Wish Stickers] to obtain item [Marker] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. Besides Markers, you will also receive [Wish Dewdrops] which can be used to redeem other items in the shop. \n\n◆Make as many wishes as you can to get customized outfits!\n\nWrite down a designated number of total wishes to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Right Beside You, Stamina, and Markers[-][/c].\n\n* [Markers] can be used to customize special birthday outfits in Gavin's [Date Plans]."
  },
  [155] = {
    rule_type = "bqBirth73004_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Players will receive ranking rewards according to their position on the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent through Mail in 1-2 workdays after the event is over.

2. The outfit which players consume more Markers on will be displayed in the ranking.

3. Top 50 players will also receive Special Edition title [c][C74848][Floating Heart][-][/c] and [c][C74848]2 customized outfits[-][/c] from [Date Plans]. If the server progress for the event reaches 100%, the top 50 players will also receive [c][C74848]Outfit Upgrade Items[-][/c] (can be used to upgrade the two outfits to Live2D outfits).

*Special Edition titles will be sent through Mail in 3 workdays after the event is over. As for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available, please stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [156] = {
    rule_type = "bqBirth73004",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Each past and memory are running forward along with him.\nIn this small courtyard where the past resides, the wind chimes stay still; and the breeze remains silent.\nIt awaits the gentlest and firmest knock to reveal the past it witnessed.\nEvent Time:\nJuly 24, 2021, 5:00 to July 30, 2021, 23:59.\n\nRules:\n\n◆Listen to the wind chimes to receive Karma.\n\n1. Tap the wind chime with [c][C74848][Wind Chime Sail][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Wish Stickers][-][/c] to receive Gavin's birthday exclusive Mini House gift [Hand Puppets] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. While redeeming, you will also receive a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Gavin's [c][C74848]childhood birthday story[-][/c].\n\n4. After reading all six stories, you can claim Gavin's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Gavin: Flawless Azure][-][/c].\n\n◆The more times you Tap Wind Chime, the more rewards you get.\n\nTap a certain number of times to claim rewards including [Birthday Commemorative R Karma, Stamina, Markers].\n\n*[Markers] can be used to [c][C74848]customize special birthday outfits[-][/c] in Gavin's [Date Plans].\n\n◆Listen to the past to unlock the future.\n\nReceiving Birthday Karma [Flawless Azure] will unlock [c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c]. Tap the arrow at the right side of the screen to write down your wishes and dreams for your future together with your man!"
  },
  [157] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※照进屋里的每缕阳光，都因他变得馥郁馨香※\n\n活动时间：8月6日更新后-10月4日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，完成每日任务后，每获得1点活跃度的同时可以获得1点[c][C74848]光照值[-][/c]，每日任务所得光照值[c][C74848]每周上限1000点[-][/c]，每周一早上5：00重置。每增加100点光照值可以提升1级。\n\n2. 等级提升后，可以领取等级对应的[c][C74848]基础奖励[-][/c]；购买[c][C74848]日光特权[-][/c]后，可以额外领取等级对应的[c][C74848]特权奖励[-][/c]。\n\n3. 日光特权分为45元和88元两个档位，仅可选择其一购买，够买后未购档位及其奖励将无法购买和获得。为保证所有时间参与馥郁日光活动的制作人收益一致，日光特权的购买将不会计入任何[c][C74848]限时累计充值[-][/c]活动中；[c][C74848]长期充值活动[-][/c]不受影响，充值金额将照常计入。\n\n4. 玩家每周也可通过[c][C74848]活动限定【相伴任务】[-][/c]获取额外光照值。相伴任务每周仅可完成一次，每周一早上5:00重置。其中，持有日光特权的玩家可完成特权限定任务，获取额外光照值福利\n\n5. 在某些等级玩家可获得[c][C74848]日光币[-][/c]，日光币可以在[c][C74848]日光小铺[-][/c]中换取[c][C74848]星缘石·头像框，星缘石·R羁绊，免费SR自选礼盒及养成资源[-][/c]等缤纷好礼\n\n-星缘石·R羁绊：包含2019年夏日花火活动R羁绊【李泽言·章鱼烧】，【许墨·红蝶尾】，【周棋洛·苹果糖】，【白起·碎碎冰】， 金币*20000，体力*150，告白心愿*5\n     \n-星缘石·头像框：包含七款复刻头像框【冬日恋语】，【蔚蓝梦想】，【绚烂时刻】，【春之声】，【盛夏星语】，【逢考必过】，【晨间新光】，金币*10000，体力*100，告白心愿*3 \n     \n-活动星缘石每次唤醒必定掉落星辰碎片一个，并从对应上述奖励中随机抽取一个。已有头像框/羁绊不会重复获得，但头像框/羁绊在全部获得前，总体掉落概率不会改变。\n\n6. 活动开启30天后活动将开放[c][C74848]等级快速提升[-][/c]功能。开放后，玩家可通过该功能消耗钻石直升等级\n  *购买时钻石消耗数量将按照光照值单价计算，玩家仅需支付直升所选等级所需的最少光照值对应的钻石数量"
  },
