3. How to light up a puzzle: When you have enough Popsicle, tap a puzzle two times and it will light up.
4. When you have lit up all 9 puzzles of one character, tap [c][C74848]Open[-][/c] to see his Summer Greeting.
5. Share his Summer Greeting for the first time and you will get one [c][C74848]Fortune Message[-][/c]; use Fortune Message in [c][C74848]Summer Resort Shop[-][/c] to redeem [c][C74848]Carefree Summer R Karma[-][/c].
6. During event, you can change the character chosen; share Summer Greeting from different characters to get multiple rewards; for each character, rewards will only be give for the first time you share his Summer Greeting.
7. You can use Popsicle to redeem other rewards in [c][C74848]Summer Resort Shop[-][/c].]]
  },
  [161] = {
    rule_type = "BQVlog33009",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the Seasons, store this autumn into your memory.
Event Time: Sept 2nd 05:00 - Sept 28th 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Go on an outing with Gavin and take photos of him at the attractions to preserve the memory!
    Visit the attractions and take photos to unlock the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] of the corresponding location with a record of the memories of the trip.
    Visit the attractions and take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. After obtaining 12 stages, you can claim [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Gavin: Transparent Mind][-][/c]!
    [c][C74848]New poses[-][/c] will be unlocked as you travel, so take more photos of him! You can use [Retake] to take different photos of him!

2. Tap [c][C74848]Take Photos[-][/c] to take photos in a new location. The photos will be added to your travel album.
    You can obtain 1 chance to [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] per day, which will be reset at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated. After finished taking photos at all the attractions, there will be no more chance to take photos.

3. Tap [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to take new photos of him at the attractions you have already visited.
    You can obtain 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day, which will be reset at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated; Retakes can be purchased unlimitedly after being used up.
    Note: The retaken photos will not be updated in the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please make sure to save the retaken photos!

4. Use the [c][C74848]Quick Retake[-][/c] function to retake multiple photos and earn points.

5. Take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Fun Points[-][/c]. Accumulate required Fun Points to claim [c][C74848]Item Rewards[-][/c].
    Each photo grants 10 Fun Points; each retaken photo grants 5 Fun Points.]]
  },
  [162] = {
    rule_type = "100DayChallenge",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "漫漫人生路，偶尔也会有孤独坎坷的时候。\n\n恋语市政府百日相伴活动特别开启!现邀你携手身边的Ta, 一起打卡人生的每一件小事。从磨合到习惯，从点滴到长情, 一起每日签到打卡，解锁有彼此相伴的每一天！\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 8月25日5:00至12月2日23:59，将开启为期100天的百日相伴打卡活动。\n2. 活动期间每日均可通过游戏内邮箱，收到Ta给你发来的相伴问候，邮件仅在当日有效，后续版本中此次活动所有已收取邮件均可永久收纳在游戏内的专题页中。\n2. 活动期间每日在活动界面打卡，均可领取[c][C74848]当日相伴奖励[-][/c]，打卡次数将在每日5:00刷新。\n3. 坚持每日打卡，累计可获得价值[c][C74848]50888钻石[-][/c]的丰厚奖励。\n4. 打卡奖励仅限当日有效，错过将无法领取。"
  },
