2. During the event, clear any Normal or Elite stage to obtain [c][C74848]Moon Fruit Plate[-][/c]. Consume Moon Fruit Plates to [c][C74848]light up the puzzle pieces[-][/c]

3. To light up the puzzle pieces: When you have enough pieces, tap each piece twice to light them up.

4. After lighting up the 9 puzzle pieces for one hero, you can tap [c][C74848]"Open"[-][/c] to see the Moon Whispers from the hero.

5. You can share your Moon Whispers to Facebook or Twitter. When sharing the Moon Whispers of a hero for the first time, you'll receive a [c][C74848]Paper Bunny[-][/c], which can be used to redeem [c][C74848]Moonrise-themed R Karmas[-][/c] in the [c][C74848] Blessed Moon Shop[-][/c].

6. During the event, you can switch to a different hero. By sharing the Moon Whispers of different heroes, you can claim multiple rewards. Sharing rewards can only be claimed once by each hero.

7. The Moon Fruit Plate can be used to redeem other handsome rewards in the [c][C74848] Blessed Moon Shop [-][/c].]]
  },
  [172] = {
