  [175] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Every ray of sunlight shining into the room is more lovely because of Him※\n\nEvent Time: 2022/6/18 5:00 - 2022/8/16 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules: [-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, completing the Daily Quests will grand 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every point of Activeness. You can obtain the [c][C74848]maximum of 1,000 Sunlight Points each week[-][/c], which will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Every 100 Sunlight Points will level up 1 level.\n\n2. You can claim the corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] after leveling up; Purchase [c][C74848]Sunshine Privileges[-][/c] to claim corresponding [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c].\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Only one of them can be purchased. The unpurchased tier and its rewards will not be available after a purchase has been made. To maintain even revenue for all participants in Fragrant Sunshine, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted in any [c][C74848] Time-Limited Total Top-Up[-][/c] events; while the Top-Up amount will be counted as usual in [c][C74848]long-term Top-Up events[-][/c].\n\n4. Players can also obtain extra Sunlight Points through [c][C74848]the event limited [Side-By-Side Quest][-][/c] every week. The Side-By-Side Quest can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete the privilege-exclusive quests to obtain extra Sunlight Point perks.\n\n5. Players at certain levels can obtain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c], which can be redeem great gifts like [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma, free SR Giftbox and Growth materials[-][/c] in [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c].\n\n- Crystal - R Karma : Includes R Karma [Victor: Ameowsing], [Lucien: Meowvelous], [Kiro: Woofderland], [Gavin: Woofulous], Gold*20000, Stamina*150, Confess Wish*5\n     \n- Crystal - Avatar Frame: Includes seven reissued Avatar Frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold*10000, Stamina*100, Confess Wish*3 \n     \n- Each time an event Crystal is awakened, it must drop one Star Shard and one random reward from the items listed above. You will not receive duplicates of Avatar Frames or Karma which you already own, but before all Avatar Frames/Karma are obtained, the overall Drop Odds will not change.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be deleted after this event ends and cannot be used in subsequent similar events, so please exchange them promptly.\n\n6. [c][C74848]Quick Level Up[-][/c] will open 30 days after the start of the event, in which Players can consume Gems to level up.\n  *Gem consumption will be calculated according to the unit price of Sunlight Points. Players only need to pay the required minimum amount of Gems corresponding to the Sunlight Points to level up to the chosen level."
  },
  [176] = {
    rule_type = "xmBirth21584",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]◆Date Plans:[-][/c]\n\n1. In Date Plans, you can use [c][C74848][Markers][-][/c] to choose one out of two outfits to customize for him. Every time you choose one, it will count towards the total customization attempts.\n\n*You may obtain Markers through [Sense Emotions] progress rewards or [Write Down Wishes].\n\n2. After the event ends, the outfits for both themes will be created and available in Go See Him.\nThe outfit that has been chosen more times in the server will be sold first at a discount, and you may purchase it with [1 Time Coupon].\n\n[c][C74848]◆Server Score Rewards:[-][/c]\n\n1. Your customization attempts will be counted as your Personal Score [c][C74848]by a certain ratio[-][/c].\n\n2. If the total Personal Scores in the server reach the designated number, Server Rewards will be unlocked. Tap [Server Score Rewards] to view and claim.\n\n3. Server Score Rewards must be claimed manually.\n\n4. If you've completed the full score progress, both outfits in Date Plans can be upgraded to [c][C74848]Live2D outfits[-][/c] later on!\n\nStay tuned for future announcements."
  },
  [177] = {
    rule_type = "xmBirth73005_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the past and future converge at the present, our eternal sentiments will be forever engraved in time.\nOn this special day, use a Wish Note to write down your dreams of a future together with your favorite guy!\n\n[c][C74848][Wish Corridor][-][/c] rules:\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Write down your wishes and redeem multiple awards including Right Beside You.[-][/c]\n\n1. Write down your wishes using [Repairing Toolkit] and [Wish Stickers] to obtain item [Marker] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. Besides Markers, you will also receive [Wish Dewdrops] which can be used to redeem other items in the shop. \n\n◆Make as many wishes as you can to get customized outfits!\n\nWrite down a designated number of total wishes to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Right Beside You, Stamina, and Markers][-][/c].\n\n* [Markers] can be used to customize special birthday outfits in Lucien's [Date Plans]."
  },
  [178] = {
    rule_type = "xmBirth73005_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Players will receive ranking rewards according to their position on the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent through Mail in 1-2 workdays after the event is over.

2. The outfit on which players consume more Markers will be displayed in the ranking.

3. Top 50 players will also receive Special Edition title [c][C74848][Dark Roamer][-][/c] and [c][C74848]2 customized outfits[-][/c] from [Date Plans]. If the server progress for the event reaches 100%, the top 50 players will also receive [c][C74848]Outfit Upgrade Items[-][/c] (can be used to upgrade the two outfits to Live2D outfits).

*Special Edition titles will be sent through Mail in 3 workdays after the event is over. As for the specific dates where the outfits will be created and become available, please stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [179] = {
    rule_type = "xmBirth73005",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Every moment concealed deep inside his heart continues to slumber in silence as time passes by. Even then, they glow, never to be buried by dust.\nWith those moments in his heart, he travels for many, many years, until he meets the one whom he could tell his memories to.\n\nEvent Time:\nNov 10, 2021, 5:00 to Nov 16, 2021, 23:59.\n\nRules:\n\n◆Sense emotions to receive Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Repairing Toolkit][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Wish Stickers][-][/c] to sense emotions and receive Lucien's birthday exclusive Mini House gift [World Book Collection Balm] (Wish Stickers can be purchased for 20 Gems each).\n\n2. While redeeming, you will also receive a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Lucien's [c][C74848]childhood birthday story[-][/c].\n\n4. After reading all six stories, you can claim Lucien's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Lucien: Embellishment][-][/c].\n\n◆The more times you sense, the more rewards you get.\n\nSense emotions a certain number of times to claim rewards including [Birthday Commemorative R Karma, Stamina, Markers].\n\n*[Markers] can be used to [c][C74848]customize special birthday outfits[-][/c] in Lucien's [Date Plans].\n\n◆Sense the past to unlock the future.\n\nReceiving Birthday Karma [Embellishment] will unlock [c][C74848][Corridor of Wishes][-][/c]. Tap the arrow at the right side of the screen to write down your wishes and dreams for your future together with your man!"
  },
  [180] = {
    rule_type = "new_check_calendar",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]Sign-in rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. Accumulate sign-ins every month for a chance to get Sign-in Karmas, [Sign-in Markers], and other rewards.\n\n2. [Sign-in Markers] can be exchanged for [c][C74848]previous Sign-in Karmas[-][/c] and other rewards in Wish Station.\n\n3. Previous Sign-in Karmas will be made permanently available in Wish Station every month in order of release date. Every Karma can be exchanged for once only and will be removed once the exchange is done.\n\n4. [Sign-in Markers] acquired are permanently retained—they are not cleared monthly.\n\n5. Sign-ins accumulated are reset at 5:00 on the first day of every month."
  },
  [181] = {
    rule_type = "Card_Adv_52004",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
When you can't be by each other's side, checking up on each other keeps you close at heart. 

[c][C74848][On the Way] Rerun Event Rules:[-][/c]   
 
1. Tap [Check Schedule] and spend a [c][C74848]Heart Stationery[-][/c] to check the schedule. Each time you check the schedule, you're guaranteed to get 1 [c][C74848]Checklist Stamp[-][/c], with a chance of getting a random reward, including [c][C74848][Kiro: Cyan Sky] Karma Shards[-][/c]~ 

2. Each schedule check will have a random weather, route, and style for the itinerary. If the itinerary is a good fit, there's a chance of activating an [c][C74848]Incident[-][/c]. Incidents that you've already activated will be recorded in the [c][C74848]Site Scrapbook[-][/c]. Collect and [c][C74848]read[-][/c] all of the incidents to claim a bonus reward.

3. [c][C74848]Checklist Stamps[-][/c] received on your schedule checks can be redeemed in the [c][C74848]Care Shop[-][/c] for various rewards.]]
  },
  [182] = {
    rule_type = "icon_customize_ios_tips",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]iOS 14.0.1及以上操作系统特别帮助：[-][/c]\n\n尊敬的制作人，若您使用的是[c][C74848]iOS 14.0.1[-][/c]及以上版本操作系统，请执行以下操作以保证本游戏图标自定义功能的正常使用：\n\n1. 依次打开【设置】→【辅助功能】→【动态效果】\n2. 打开【减弱动态效果】选项\n3. 打开出现的【首选交叉淡出过渡效果】选项\n4. 返回游戏，即可重新设置心仪的游戏图标\n5. 设置成功后，若有需要，可重新关闭【减弱动态效果】及【首选交叉淡出过渡效果】；关闭后若再次出现无法正常更换游戏图标的情况，重新执行上述操作即可\n\n由于操作系统原因给各位制作人带来的不便，敬请谅解。"
  },
  [183] = {
    rule_type = "62006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Rules of the [c][C74848]Holly & Jolly[-][/c] Event:

1. During the event, tap Ring the Bell to ring the [c][C74848]Xmas Bell[-][/c] and get abundant rewards. Tap [Preview] to view all the rewards. 

2. Use Xmas Bell and you will have the chance to obtain [Holly & Jolly] event R Karma. 

An [c][C74848]unduplicated[-][/c] Karma is guaranteed in the [c][C74848]36th[-][/c] pull, if you use Xmas Bell pulling for [c][C74848]35 times in a roll[-][/c] and receive none. 

A [c][C74848]recount[-][/c] will be triggered if you obtain a Karma during this period.

3. Tap the plus sign next to the number of Xmas Bell to view the ways for obtaining the item:

- [c][C74848]Daily Quests[-][/c]: Complete daily quests and claim Xmas Bell as the activeness rewards.

- [c][C74848]Mission Drops[-][/c]: Clear normal or elite missions for possible drops of Xmas Bell. Up to 20 Xmas Bell can be gained by consuming Stamina.

- [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c]: Buy Xmas Bell with Gold in Love Supply. Daily purchase limit 10.

4. Ring the Xmas Bell to get [c][C74848]Pincone[-][/c], which can be used to redeem certain items in [Very Merry Shop].]]
  },
  [184] = {
    rule_type = "concert2020",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]恋与流年[-][/c]\n\n音乐是有记忆的。\n时光将每段共同走过的回忆谱写成曲，音符交错间，是你与他最特别的周年纪念。\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]\n\n1.[c][C74848]11月19日更新后-11月23日00:00[-][/c]，购买【恋与流年】礼包并登记姓名的制作人，即可获赠三周年庆音乐会门票抽选资格。\n\n2.[c][C74848]11月23日18:00[-][/c]，抽选结果公布，共计300个音乐会入场名额，届时制作人可在本页面查看获奖信息。\n\n3.[c][C74848]11月29日23:59[-][/c]前，抽中门票的制作人需在本页面登记个人信息，逾期将视作自动放弃门票。\n\n4.如因部分制作人放弃参与资格，门票有余量释放，[c][C74848]11月30日23:59[-][/c]前，未抽中门票的制作人可在本页面点击按钮参与回流门票的二次抽选。\n\n5.第二轮门票抽选结果将在[c][C74848]12月1日18:00[-][/c]在本页面公布。\n\n6.[c][C74848]12月7日23:59[-][/c]前，抽中第二轮门票的制作人需在本页面登记个人信息，逾期将视作自动放弃门票。\n\n7.每个账号仅有一次门票抽选资格，若第一轮抽中后放弃参与，也将丧失第二轮抽选资格。"
  },
  [185] = {
    rule_type = "itemQuickGet",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Material Assistant[-][/c]
1. Material Assistant can help you more easily get materials for Karma Evolve and Star Up.

2. Tap the material you want to add it to the Quick Remake list. When you have made your choice, the stamina to be consumed will be displayed on the button below. Tap on the Start button to start Quick Remake and get materials quickly.

3. The material on top of the list will be given priority, for a single material a maximum of 20 Remakes can be done on the corresponding stage.

4. When stamina or mission clearance is insufficient, Remake will stop directly. Please note the stamina cost.

5. Use the tab to switch material type.

6. Use filter to quickly locate the material you need.

7. As materials for Star Up are not clearly categorized, in the filter they are listed by order of appearance to facilitate searching.]]
  },
  [186] = {
    rule_type = "Qinghuai_2020",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n翻看与他的记录，重温这一年的浪漫回忆吧！\n\n1.活动期间内，各位制作人可点击[c][C74848]【点滴铭心】[-][/c]，查看与他相伴的点点滴滴。\n\n2.翻看结束后，制作人可选择一张令你印象深刻的羁绊进行分享，首次分享可获得额外的奖励。\n\n3.本次活动记录了制作人与他的相伴日期（记录至2020.12.3 4:59:59），牵绊等级（记录至12.3 4:59:59）及过去一年中的温馨回忆。（仅记录2019.12.3 5:00~2020.12.3 4:59:59期间内投放并获得的短信、电话、朋友圈、约会）"
  },
  [187] = {
    rule_type = "MainlinePresaleRule_40009",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
