2. Each wonder captured will have a preview of the weather, time, and arrangements. If the preview is a good fit, there's a chance of activating an [c][C74848]Incident[-][/c]. Incidents that you've already activated will be recorded in the [c][C74848]Source Materials[-][/c]. Collect and [c][C74848]read[-][/c] all of the incidents to claim a bonus reward.

3. The [c][C74848]Checklist Stamps[-][/c] that you obtained can be redeemed in the [c][C74848]Theater Shop[-][/c] for various rewards.]]
