    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]『Law of Heartbeat』[-][/c]\n\nIt's a sunny day in Loveland City.Perfect for \nstrolling, chatting, and sipping milk tea.\nAnd also perfect for a romantic date with him.\nMake the best of this beautiful day.\n\n[c][C74848]Rules[-][/c]\n\n1. Tap [Post] to post an update, which costs\n[c][C74848]Guide Chickens[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Bubble Tea for Two[-][/c],and \ngain 4~7 [c][C74848]Popularity[-][/c] and random item rewards.\n\n2. When your Popularity reaches a certain level, \nyou can claim [c][C74848]ER Giftbox[-][/c], [c][C74848]Diary Ornament \nGiftbox[-][/c], and the SER combination item[c] [C74848]Memory \nStarlock[-][/c].\n\n3. Bubble Tea for Two can be obtained from \n[c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c] or [c][C74848]purchased with Gems[-][/c]; Guide \nChickens can be obtained by [c][C74848]clearing Main \nStory stages[-][/c].\n\n4. Activate time-limited quests, grow \nevent-exclusive ER Karmas, and collect \nWooden Pencils. Redeem Wooden Pencils for \nvarious items in [Sky Stationer] in the event \n[Love Equation] "
  },
  [198] = {
    rule_type = "62006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]暖夜欢歌[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击轻摇铃铛并使用[c][C74848]圣诞铃铛[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用圣诞铃铛有概率随机获取恋与暖夜欢歌R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用圣诞铃铛未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n3.点击圣诞铃铛数量右侧的加号可以查看圣诞铃铛的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得圣诞铃铛奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落圣诞铃铛，每日最多可通过体力掉落20个；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费金币购买圣诞铃铛，每日最多可购买10个。\n\n4.轻摇圣诞铃铛获得的[c][C74848]雪愿松果[-][/c]可以在【缤纷橱窗】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
  },
  [199] = {
    rule_type = "backflow_66002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]Rules[-][/c]\n\n1.Producers who have cleared stage 1-10 and haven’t logged onto the game for 21 consecutive days will activate the [c][C74848]Love Returns[-][/c] event.\n\n2.The event starts with a countdown of [c][C74848]15[-][/c] days. Once the specified tasks are finished, you will receive [c][C74848]Diary Book[-][/c] as rewards, which can be used to redeem in-game resources in [c][C74848]Sunset Shop[-][/c].\n\n3.Task progress starts to count from when the event is unlocked. Progress of Total Login tasks will be refreshed at 5:00 a.m. every day. \n\n4.During the event, welcome to enter the [c][C74848]Return Supply[-][/c] to get exclusive supplies, offered only for returning producers."
