  [200] = {
    rule_type = "LZYVlog33011",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Spring is in the air! Spend your leisure time with Victor in a peaceful village!
Event Time: 2023/2/21 5:00 - 2023/3/19 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Go on an outing with Victor and take photos of him at the attractions to preserve the memory!

-Visit the scenic spots and take photos to unlock the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] of the corresponding location with a record of the memories of the trip.

-Visit the attractions and take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. After advancing the progress 12 times, you can claim [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Victor: Steadfast][-][/c]!

-[c][C74848]New poses[-][/c] will be unlocked as you travel, so take more photos of him! You can use [Retake] to take different photos of him!

2. Tap [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] to take photos in a new location. The photos will be added to your travel album.

-You can obtain 1 chance to [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated. After taking photos at all the attractions, there will be no more chance to take photos.

3. Tap [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to take new photos of him at the attractions you have already visited.

-You can obtain 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated; Retakes can be purchased unlimitedly after being used up.

-Note: The retaken photos will not be updated in the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please make sure to save the retaken photos!

4. Use the [c][C74848]Quick Photo[-][/c] feature to retake multiple photos and earn points.

5. Take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Pastoral Points[-][/c]. Accumulate required Pastoral Points to claim [c][C74848]amazing items[-][/c].

-Each photo grants 10 Pastoral Points; each retaken photo grants 5 Pastoral Points.]]
  },
  [201] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86004",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※He makes every ray of sunshine in the room fragrant.※\n\nEvent Time: 2022/12/30 5:00-2023/2/27 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, completing Daily Quests will grand 1 [c][C74848]Light Point[-][/c] for every point of Activeness. You can obtain a [c][C74848]maximum of 1,000 Light Points each week[-][/c]. The limit will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Every 100 Light Points will level up 1 level.\n\n2. You can claim the corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] after leveling up; Purchase [c][C74848]Sunlight Privileges[-][/c] to claim corresponding [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c].\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Only one of them can be purchased. The unpurchased tier and its rewards will not be available for purchase or claim after a purchase has been made. To maintain even revenue for all participants in Fragrant Sunshine, Sunlight Privilege will not be counted in any [c][C74848] Time-Limited Total Top-Up[-][/c] events; while the Top-Up amount will be counted in [c][C74848]long-term Top-Up events[-][/c].\n\n4. Players can also obtain extra Light Points through [c][C74848]the event limited [Side-By-Side Quest][-][/c] every week. The Side-By-Side Quest can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Players with Sunlight Privilege can complete the privilege-exclusive quests to obtain extra Light Point perks.\n\n5. Players at certain levels can obtain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c], which can be used to redeem great gifts like [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma IV, free SR Giftbox and Growth materials[-][/c] in [c][C74848]Sunlight Shop[-][/c].\n\n-Crystal: R Karma IV includes: R Karmas from [Holly & Jolly] Event [Victor: Warm Light], [Lucien: Mail Dream], [Kiro: Cute Chef], [Gavin: Star Wish Delivery], [Shaw: Tailor-made], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes: 7 comeback avatar frames [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold*10,000, Stamina*100, Confess Wish*3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and a random reward from the above list. Owned Avatar Frames/Karma will not be duplicated, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the Avatar Frames/Karma are obtained.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be cleared at the end of the event and cannot be used in subsequent events, so please redeem them in time.\n\n6. [c][C74848]Quick Level Up[-][/c] will open 30 days after the start of the event, in which players can consume Gems to level up.\n  *Gem consumption will be calculated according to the unit price of Light Points. Players only need to pay the required minimum amount of Gems corresponding to the Light Points to level up to the chosen level."
  },
