2. When your Popularity reaches a certain tier, you can claim [c][C74848]ER Giftboxes[-][/c], [c][C74848]Journal Ornament Giftboxes[-][/c], and the SER combination item [c][C74848]Memory Starlocks[-][/c].

3. Bubble Tea for Two can be obtained from [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c] or [c][C74848]purchased with Gems[-][/c]; Guide Chickens can be obtained by [c][C74848]clearing main story stages[-][/c].]]
