  [208] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39009",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Hidden in the little trick, are the two close hearts.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. When the event begins, select one role and enter his event page. There are 9 puzzle pieces on each role's page.

2. During the event, clear any Normal or Elite stage to obtain [c][C74848]Mystery Candy[-][/c]. Consume Mystery Candies to [c][C74848]light up the puzzle pieces[-][/c]

3. To light up the puzzle pieces: When you have enough pieces, tap each piece twice to light them up.

4. After lighting up the 9 puzzle pieces for one role, you can tap [c][C74848]"Open"[-][/c] to see theTricks from the role.

5. You can share your Tricks to Facebook or Instagram. When sharing the Tricks of a role for the first time, you'll receive a [c][C74848]Scare Box[-][/c], which can be used to redeem [c][C74848]Colorful Comedy R Karmas[-][/c] in the [c][C74848]Prank Shop[-][/c].

6. During the event, you can switch to a different role. By sharing the Moonlit Messages of different roles, you can claim multiple rewards. Sharing rewards can only be claimed once by each role.

7. The Mystery Candy can be used to redeem other rewards in the [c][C74848]Prank Shop[-][/c].]]
  },
  [209] = {
    rule_type = "62007",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Blooming Affection[-][/c] Rules

1. During the event, tap Exchange Feelings to use [c][C74848]Coupons[-][/c] and obtain abundant rewards. Tap [Reward Preview] to see the rewards.

2. There's a chance to randomly obtain a Blooming Affection R Karma when using a Coupon.

If no Karma has been obtained after [c][C74848]35 consecutive times[-][/c] of using Coupons, you [c][C74848]will[-][/c] obtain an[c][C74848] unobtained[-][/c] Karma on [c][C74848]the 36th[-][/c] time.

The number of Exchange attempts will [c][C74848]reset[-][/c] once you obtained a Karma.

3. Tap the plus sign on the right of the number of Coupons to see how to obtain Coupons.

- [c][C74848]Daily Quests[-][/c]: Complete daily quests to claim Activity Rewards and Coupon Rewards at the same time.

- [c][C74848]Mission Drops[-][/c]: There is a chance of dropping up to 20 Coupons a day when clearing Normal or Elite stages with Stamina.

- [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c]: You can spend Gold to buy up to 10 Coupons a day in Love Supply.

4. [c][C74848]Bouquets[-][/c] obtained from using Coupons can be used to exchange specific items in Flower Stall.]]
  },
  [210] = {
    rule_type = "new_company_stock_market_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Collaborative Project - Business Start-up:
The company has completed several collaborative projects, achieving substantial growth in every aspect of its operations. To meet more diversified business needs, you, the owner of the company, decide to set a special budget to support your experts in their "mini ventures."

However, these ventures have risks. Your job is to evaluate how well those experts will do in their ventures based on internal sources and external opinions and then allocate the [c][C74848][Budget][-][/c] accordingly!


[c][C74848][Expert Potential][-][/c] is a direct indicator of an expert's performance in the project. If an expert's Potential increases from yesterday, the company receives a boost to certain attributes, and the attribute points gained from completing various tasks during the day increase by a certain percentage! It's vice versa if the Potential drops...


[c][C74848][Note] If you reenter the project after being away for over 30 days, the Potential figure 31 days earlier will be used as the basis for determining the budget change. The budget has an upper limit (999,999,999) and a lower limit (100). Funds exceeding these limits will not be counted.[-][/c] ]]
  },
  [211] = {
    rule_type = "62008",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]Sugary Scent[-][/c]Event Rules:\n\n1. During event, tap Melt the Sugar Cube and use [c][C74848]Colored Sugar[-][/c] for rewards. See rewards in [Preview].\n\n2. Use Colored Sugar and there's a chance for getting random Sugary Scent R Karma\n\nIf you haven't gained any Karma in first [c][C74848]35 attempts[-][/c] by using Colored Sugar, [c][C74848]an unrepeated[-][/c] Karma will be [c][C74848]guaranteed[-][/c] at [c][C74848]the 36th attempt[-][/c]；\n\nIf Karma's obtained in 35 attempts, attempt counts will be[c][C74848]reset[-][/c].\n\n3. Tap on the \"plus\" right to Colored Sugar Amount to learn about the ways for getting Colored Sugar.\n\n- [c][C74848]Daily Quest[-][/c]: Colored Sugar will be rewarded when Daily Quest Rewards are claimed；\n\n- [c][C74848]Stage Drop[-][/c]: There's a chance for Colored Sugar drop in clearing Normal or Elite stages. Daily drops through consuming Stamina maximise at 20;\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c]: Colored Sugar can be purchased in Love Supply by Gold. The maximum amount of purchasing is 10.\n\n4.[c][C74848]Ballon Flower Box[-][/c] obtained by melting the sugar cube can be used in [Warm Love Market] to exchange for certain items."
  },
  [212] = {
    rule_type = "95001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]Main Story Count Down[-][/c] event rules\n\n1.During the event, you can [c][C74848]login daily[-][/c] and [c][C74848]obtain 100 activeness from daily quests[-][/c] to claim rewards. Complete in total 10 login or activeness quests to claim exclusive [c][C74848]Go See Him Background·[General] Misty Street Outdoor Scene[-][/c].\n\n2.[c][C74848]Ghost Card[-][/c] obtained from daily login rewards can be used to unlock the coming main story stages of chap. 14-17, S2.\n\n- After the event, unclaimed rewards will be delivered via mailbox."
  },
  [213] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39010",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
No reason is needed to love you.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. When the event begins, select one character and enter his event page. There are 9 puzzle pieces on each character's page.

2. During the event, clear any Normal or Elite stage to obtain [c][C74848]Childhood Memory Gift Package[-][/c]. Consume Childhood Memory Gift Packages to [c][C74848]light up the puzzle pieces[-][/c]

3. To light up the puzzle pieces: When you have enough pieces, tap each piece twice to light them up.

4. After lighting up the 9 puzzle pieces for one character, you can tap [c][C74848]"Open"[-][/c] to see the Carefree Castles.

5. You can share your Carefree Castles to facebook or twitter. When sharing the Carefree Castles of a character for the first time, you'll receive a [c][C74848]Yoyo[-][/c], which can be used to redeem [c][C74848]Bubble Cloud R Karmas[-][/c] in the [c][C74848]Cotton Candy Shop[-][/c].

6. During the event, you can switch to a different character. By sharing the Moonlit Messages of different characters, you can claim multiple rewards. Sharing rewards can only be claimed once by each character.

7. The Childhood Memory Gift Package can be used to redeem other handsome rewards in the [c][C74848]Marshmallow Shop[-][/c].]]
  },
  [214] = {
    rule_type = "flowerWish94000",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "许下心愿寄语，期待好运的指示。\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]：\n\n1. 每次购买心绪之花进行祈愿，必定可以获得幻梦银铃x1和心绪之花x1，并有小概率（2%）获得[c][C74848]当期限定[-][/c]SR羁绊。\n\n2. [c][C74848]每1组心绪之花（3个）中必定包含1次双倍幻梦银铃[-][/c]。点击单个心绪之花进行1次祈愿，将有概率获得双倍幻梦银铃；点击下方祈愿全部按钮进行3次祈愿，则必定获得1次双倍幻梦银铃。\n\n3. [c][C74848]进行单次祈愿或祈愿全部后都将换1组新的心绪之花[-][/c]。\n\n4. 幻梦银铃可用于[c][C74848]按顺序兑换[-][/c]原梦心湖卡池中的SSR羁绊。\n\n5. 每祈愿30次，可获得一份额外奖励，奖励内容包括微光之月*10，以及[c][C74848]星河许愿券、心绪之石、R羁绊随机礼盒[-][/c]三选一自选奖励。\n\n6. 微光之月可用于兑换原梦心湖活动兑换商店中的3张SR羁绊和1张SSR羁绊；\n\n7. 开启R羁绊随机礼盒可获得[c][C74848]尚未拥有的[-][/c]梦心湖活动R羁绊，如果所有羁绊都已获得，则获得金币x50000\n\n8. 每日5:00可获得1次免费的祈愿机会，可选择免费购买1个心绪之花，或花费120钻购买1组（3个）心绪之花。"
  },
  [215] = {
    rule_type = "74002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "亲爱的制作人：\n\n根据国家相关政策法规规定，2021年4月28日起，将对游戏内实名认证绑定系统进行升级调整。还请制作人及时完善实名信息，否则将影响后续的游戏时长等体验。\n\n具体调整如下：\n\n【已注册用户】\n根据政策规定，4月28日后，将陆续强制落实游戏账号实名认证措施。\n已经完成注册，但未填写实名认证信息或实名信息存在异常的制作人，需要尽快完善实名认证信息，否则将影响后续的游戏时长等体验。\n*点击活动页面按钮，即可前往完善认证信息。\n\n【新注册用户】\n新注册用户必须完成实名认证才可注册完毕进入游戏。\n\n【游客用户】\n根据政策规定，游客账号有效游戏时长仅限1小时；\n每台设备15天内仅能创建1个游客账号。\n使用游客账号进行游戏的制作人，还请及时注册并绑定账号，以免影响您后续的游戏体验。\n\n*点击活动页面按钮，即可前往注册并绑定游客账号信息。\n"
  },
  [216] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86005",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※He makes every ray of sunshine in the room fragrant.※\n\nEvent Time: 2023/5/1 5:00-2023/6/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, completing Daily Quests will grand 1 [c][C74848]Light Point[-][/c] for every point of Activeness. You can obtain a [c][C74848]maximum of 1,000 Light Points each week[-][/c]. The limit will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Every 100 Light Points will level up 1 level.\n\n2. You can claim the corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] after leveling up; Purchase [c][C74848]Sunlight Privileges[-][/c] to claim corresponding [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c].\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Only one of them can be purchased. The unpurchased tier and its rewards will not be available for purchase or claim after a purchase has been made. To maintain even revenue for all participants in Fragrant Sunshine, Sunlight Privilege will not be counted in any [c][C74848] Time-Limited Total Top-Up[-][/c] events; while the Top-Up amount will be counted in [c][C74848]long-term Top-Up events[-][/c].\n\n4. Players can also obtain extra Light Points through [c][C74848]the event limited [Side-By-Side Quest][-][/c] every week. The Side-By-Side Quest can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Players with Sunlight Privilege can complete the privilege-exclusive quests to obtain extra Light Point perks.\n\n5. Players at certain levels can obtain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c], which can be used to redeem great gifts like [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal·Summer Fireworks Event,Crystal·Boxed Sweetness Event, free SR Giftbox and Growth materials[-][/c] in [c][C74848]Sunlight Shop[-][/c].\n\n-Crystal·Summer Fireworks Event includes: R Karmas from [Summer Fireworks] Event [Victor: Takoyaki], [Lucien: Red Butterfly], [Kiro: Apple Candy], [Gavin: Smashed Ice], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5.\n\n-Crystal·Boxed Sweetness Event includes: R Karmas from [Boxed Sweetness] Event [Victor: 70% Sweetness], [Lucien: Memory Between Pages], [Kiro: Love Confession], [Gavin: Breeze in Hands], [Shaw: Magic Heart], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes: 7 comeback avatar frames [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold*10,000, Stamina*100, Confess Wish*3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and a random reward from the above list. Owned Avatar Frames/Karma will not be duplicated, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the Avatar Frames/Karma are obtained.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be cleared at the end of the event and cannot be used in subsequent events, so please redeem them in time.\n\n6. [c][C74848]Quick Level Up[-][/c] will open 30 days after the start of the event, in which players can consume Gems to level up.\n  *Gem consumption will be calculated according to the unit price of Light Points. Players only need to pay the required minimum amount of Gems corresponding to the Light Points to level up to the chosen level."
  },
  [217] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86005_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] [Side-By-Side Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event limited Side-By-Side Quests to obtain extra Light Points. Light Points obtained in this way are not limited by the weekly limit.

2. Side-By-Side Quests can only be completed once a week, and will reset at 5:00 every Monday.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive for players with Sunlight Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant weekly Light Point perks.]],
    rule_icon = "4"
  },
  [218] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth92002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "The inner voices are unlocked, and the key to the past is presented to you.\nYou are now invited to share his exclusive memory.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Golden Tune] and preparing a gift for him, join the event [c][C74848]on the day of Kiro's birthday[-][/c], and you can unlock the exclusive birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special day in his life only with you.\n\n◆ Listen to the Inner Voice to obtain Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Card][-][/c] to listen to young Kiro's inner voices and get the exclusive birthday gift [Mini Dessert Maker]. (You can spend 20 gems for each card)\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848][Memory Items][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Young Kiro's Birthday Memories[-][/c].\n\n4. After unlocking all six memories, you can receive Kiro's [c][C74848]Birthday Memorial Karma [Kiro: Golden Tune][-][/c].\n\n◆ Listen multiple times to obtain multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate a certain number of notes or chords, and you can receive personal progress rewards such as [Birthday Memorial R Karma, Stamina, Chronicle Seal].\n\n*[c][C74848][Chronicle Seal][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Ranking Scores and Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Listen to the past and unlock the future.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Golden Tune] and preparing a gift for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Write Birthday Card] stage[-][/c]. Click the arrow on the right side of the screen to write down wishes face to face with him, and you will also receive multiple rewards such as [c][C74848]Chronicle Seal[-][/c].\n\n\n* After 0:00 on the day of Kiro's birthday, more Plot Reviews including Young Kiro's Birthday Memories will be permanently available on the Birthday Karma [Golden Tune] interface."
  },
  [219] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth92002_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Although we have much time ahead, the precious memories are still worth preserving forever.\nOn this memorable day, flip open the Birthday Card and leave your unfading memories here.\n\n[c][C74848]On the day of Kiro's birthday[-][/c], enter the event interface to unlock the exclusive birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special day in his life only with you.\n\n◆ Write a Birthday Card to redeem multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Card][-][/c] to write down your wishes and get the item [c][C74848][Chronicle Seal][-][/c]. (You can spend 20 Gems for each card)\n\n2. In addition to Chronicle Seals, you will also receive [c][C74848][Gift for the Beloved][-][/c], which can be redeemed in the store for various rewards such as Birthday Karma, Suits and Right Beside You for the previous years.\n\n*[c][C74848][Chronicle Seal][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Personal Ranking Scores and Server Scores when obtained.\n\n\n◆ Accumulate wishes to obtain personal rewards.\n\nFinish a certain number of [c][C74848]writing Birthday Card[-][/c] and you can receive rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Suits, Birthday Backgrounds and Right Beside You Items][-][/c].\n\n\n* After 0:00 on the day of Kiro's birthday, more Plot Reviews including Young Kiro's Birthday Memories will be permanently available on the Birthday Karma [Golden Tune] interface."
  },
  [220] = {
    rule_type = "ZqlBirth92002_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] Ranking Instructions:[-][/c]

1. Different ranking rewards will be awarded according to different percentage intervals of the Personal Score ranking.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the end of the event.


2. The top 50 producers will also receive a Special Edition Title [c][C74848][Starlight Bloom][-][/c]. If the Server Score progress is reached after the event, the top 50 producers will also receive extra items.

*Special Edition Title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event ends, and please check the follow-up announcement.]]
  },
