  [222] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※He makes every ray of sunshine in the room fragrant.※\n\nEvent Time: 2023/3/1 5:00-2023/4/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, completing daily quests will grant you 1 [c][C74848]Light Point[-][/c] for every point of Activeness. You can obtain [c][C74848]up to 1,000 Light Points per week[-][/c], which will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Every 100 Light Points you earn will advance the progress by 1 level.\n\n2. You can claim the corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] after leveling up. Purchase the [c][C74848]Sunlight Privilege[-][/c] to get corresponding [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c].\n\n3. The Sunlight Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Only one of them can be purchased. The unpurchased tier and its rewards will not be available for purchase or claim after a purchase has been made. To maintain even revenue for all participants in Fragrant Sunshine, Sunlight Privilege will not be counted in any [c][C74848] Time-Limited Total Top-Up[-][/c] events, while the top-up amount will be counted as usual in [c][C74848]long-term top-up events[-][/c].\n\n4. Players can also earn extra Light Points through the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c] every week. The Company Quests can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Players with Sunlight Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Light Points.\n\n5. Players at certain levels can receive [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c], which can be used to redeem amazing gifts like [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma II, Crystal: R Karma VI, free SR Giftbox, growth materials[-][/c], and more in the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c].\n\n-Crystal: R Karma II contains limited beginner's R Karmas: [Victor: Ameowsing], [Lucien: Meowvelous], [Kiro: Woofderland], [Gavin: Woofulous], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, Confess Wish*5\n\n-Crystal: R Karma VI contains R Karmas from the [Between the Lines] event: [Victor: Hearts & Tastes], [Lucien: Heart's Promise], [Kiro: Sweet Thoughts], [Gavin: Falling for You], [Shaw: Heart Games], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame contains 7 comeback avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold*10,000, Stamina*100, Confess Wish*3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be cleared at the end of the event and cannot be used in subsequent events, so be sure to redeem them in time.\n\n6. The [c][C74848]Quick Level-Up[-][/c] feature will be available 30 days into the event, by which players can spend Gems to level up.\n*Gem consumption will be calculated according to the unit price of Light Points. Players only need to spend the Gems corresponding to the minimum amount of Light Points required to reach the chosen level."
  },
  [223] = {
