  [224] = {
    rule_type = "XMVlog33012",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Travel through the seasons and let the summer flowers bloom alongside you.
Event duration: 2024/10/2 5:00 - 2024/10/21 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Head out with Lucien and take pictures for him in the scenic spots!

-Snapping a photo at a scenic spot will unlock that location inside the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] and record your trip.

-Snapping a photo at a scenic spot will award [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progression[-][/c]. Gaining 9 progressions will award you the [c][C74848]SR Karma [Lucien: Ripe Plums][-][/c]!

-You'll unlock [c][C74848]more poses[-][/c] during your trip. Try them out and take your favorite photo for him! You can tap on [Retake] to take a photo of him in a different pose.

2. Tap on [c][C74848]Photo Shoot[-][/c] to head to a new location and take photos for your Travel Album.

-You get one [c][C74848]Photo Shoot[-][/c] per day that refreshes each day at 5 AM and does not accumulate to the next day. Once you've taken a photo at each location, you will stop getting additional Photo Shoots.

3. Tap on [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to retake the photo at a previously visited scenic spot.

-You get 6 [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day that refresh each day at 5 AM and do not accumulate to the next day. These can also be purchased without limit.

*Please note: Retakes will not be updated inside the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please save them yourselves!

4. You can use the [c][C74848]Quick Snap[-][/c] feature to quickly use all Retakes and gain points.

5. Taking photos will award [c][C74848]Lush Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Lush Point milestones will unlock [c][C74848]item rewards[-][/c].

Taking a photo each time awards 10 Lush Pts. Each retake awards 5 Lush Pts.]]
  },
  [225] = {
    rule_type = "AgeAppropriateTip",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "1. 本游戏是一款角色扮演类经营游戏，适用于[c][C74848]年满16周岁及以上[-][/c]的用户，建议未成年人在家长监护下使用游戏产品。\n\n2. 本游戏为架空背景，其中涉及的人物和组织，与现实社会形象无关。游戏玩法基于卡牌收集和培养，设有玩家与游戏角色之间不可自主编辑的文字和语音互动，鼓励玩家树立健康的人际交往观念。游戏中没有基于文字和语音的陌生人社交系统。\n\n3. 游戏中有用户实名认证系统，认证为未成年人的用户将接受以下管理：\n1）游戏中部分玩法和道具需要付费。未满8周岁的用户不能付费；8周岁以上未满16周岁的未成年人用户，单次充值金额不得超过[c][C74848]50元[-][/c]人民币，每月充值金额累计不得超过[c][C74848]200元[-][/c]人民币；16周岁以上的未成年人用户，单次充值金额不得超过[c][C74848]100元[-][/c]人民币，每月充值金额不得超过[c][C74848]400元[-][/c]人民币。\n2）未成年人用户仅可在[c][C74848]周五、周六、周日和法定节假日每日20:00-21:00进行一小时[-][/c]游戏体验，其余时间均不得使用。\n3)不进行实名认证或处于认证中的用户，将无法登录游戏。\n\n4. 本游戏为玩家单人游戏模式，需要玩家完成任务来拯救濒临破产的公司、建立良好的人际关系，并应对生活中的各种危机和挑战。游戏设有重要事项提醒、背单词功能以及学习和工作模式，有助于帮助玩家养成劳逸结合的生活习惯。"
  },
  [226] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_68010",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c]

You glide forward in utter silence,
the future your only direction.
Lit up by the Milky Way, your paths intertwine always.

[c][C74848]Rules[-][/c]

1. Tap [Illuminate] to spend [c][C74848]Lingering Echoes[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Dream Handbells[-][/c] to get 9-12 [c][C74848]Illumination Progress[-][/c] and random rewards.

2. Reach specific progress tiers to obtain Season 2 limited [c][C74848]SSR  Giftboxes[-][/c] and matching [c][C74848]Outfit Giftboxes[-][/c].

3. [c][C74848]Dream Handbells[-][/c] can be obtained from [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c] or [c][C74848]purchased with Gems[-][/c]; Lingering Echoes can be obtained by [c][C74848]clearing main story stages[-][/c].]]
  },
  [227] = {
    rule_type = "LxBirth92003",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A lock containing the heart's voice falls before you, and a key to unlock the past clinks to the ground.\nThose stories of His are right now yours for the listening.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [Rain or Sunshine] and prepare a birthday gift for Him, then on [c][C74848]the day of His birthday[-][/c], enter the event page to open special birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special of days with you alone.\n\n◆Listen to Heart Voice and get Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Card][-][/c] to listen to the voice of his heart from his youth, and get a Bond Wish. (If there are not enough Birthday Cards, you can spend 20 Gems per card)\n\n2. Meanwhile, you'll randomly receive [c][C74848][Memory Items][-][/c] or Encounter Wishes, Gold, or Stamina rewards.\n\n3. Memory items can be used to unlock Shaw's [c][C74848]Birthday memories of his youth[-][/c].\n\n4. After unlocking all six Memory Stories, you can claim Shaw's [c][C74848]Birthday memory Karma [Shaw: Rain or Sunshine][-][/c].\n\n◆Listen and claim other rewards.\n\nWhen you gather or collect to a certain amount, you can claim personal progress rewards such as [Birthday Memory R Karma, Stamina, and Chronicle Seals].\n\n*[c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] are automatically converted to corresponding points for Ranking Score and Server Score.\n\n◆Listen to the past, unlock the future.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [Rain or Sunshine] and prepare a birthday gift for him to unlock the [c][C74848][Birthday Card] Phase[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right of the screen to be face-to-face with him and write birthday wishes. You can also get [c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] and other rewards.\n\n\n*At midnight on the day of the birthday, on the Birthday Karma [Rain or Sunshine] page, more event Plot Reviews will be permanently released, including Birthday Memories of his youth.\n"
  },
  [228] = {
    rule_type = "LxBirth92003_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Time may go on, but precious memories will remain forever.\nOn this day worth remembering, open up a birthday card and leave behind an unforgettable memory.\n\n[c][C74848]On the day of the birthday[-][/c], enter the event page to open special birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special of days with you alone.\n\n\n◆Write cards and redeem multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Cards][-][/c] to write down wishes and get the item [c][C74848][Chronicle Seals][-][/c] (If there are not enough Birthday Cards, you can spend 20 Gems per card).\n\n2. Aside from Chronicle Seals, you will also get [c][C74848][Gift for the Beloved][-][/c] which can be exchanged in the Shop for [Shaw: Night Fire], Past Birthday Karma, Outfit, Right Beside You, and lots of other item rewards.\n\n*[c][C74848][Chronicle Seals][-][/c] obtained will be automatically converted to corresponding Server Score and personal Ranking Score points.\n\n\n◆Accumulate Birthday Wishes to claim a personal reward.\n\nAccumulate a certain number of [c][C74848]Birthday Cards[-][/c] to claim rewards such as [c][C74848][Birthday Outfit, Birthday Backgrounds, and Right Beside You][-][/c].\n\n\n*At midnight on the day of the birthday, on the Birthday Karma [Rain or Sunshine] page, more event Plot Reviews will be permanently released, including Birthday Memories of his youth.\n"
  },
  [229] = {
