    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A lock containing the heart's voice falls before you, and a key to unlock the past clinks to the ground.\nThose stories of his are right now yours for the listening.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [Scorching Love] and prepare a birthday gift for him, then on [c][C74848]the day of His birthday[-][/c], enter the event page to open special birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special of days with you alone.\n\n◆Listen to Heart Voice and get Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Cards][-][/c] to listen to the voice of his heart from his youth, and get a Gavin's Birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Sandwich Machine]. (If there are not enough Birthday Cards, you can spend 20 Gems per card)\n\n2. Meanwhile, you'll randomly receive [c][C74848][Memory Items][-][/c] or Encounter Wishes, Gold, or Stamina rewards.\n\n3. Memory items can be used to unlock Gavin's [c][C74848]Childhood Birthday Memories[-][/c].\n\n4. After unlocking all six Memory Stories, you can claim Gavin's [c][C74848]Birthday Commemorative Karma [Gavin: Scorching Love][-][/c].\n\n◆Listen and rack up tons of rewards.\n\nWhen you spin or fix to a certain amount, you can claim personal progress rewards such as [Birthday Commemorative R Karma, Stamina, and Chronicle Seals].\n\n*[c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] are automatically converted to corresponding points for Ranking Score and Server Score.\n\n◆Listen to the past, unlock the future.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [Scorching Love] and prepare a birthday gift for him to unlock the [c][C74848][Birthday Card] Phase[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right of the screen to be face-to-face with him and write birthday wishes. You can also get [c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] and other rewards.\n\n\n*At midnight on the day of the birthday, on the Birthday Karma [Scorching Love] page, more event Plot Reviews will be permanently released, including Childhood Birthday Memories."
