  [235] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86007",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※He makes every ray of sunshine in the room fragrant.※\n\nEvent Period: 2023/7/1 5:00~2023/8/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, completing daily quests will grant you 1 [c][C74848]Light Points[-][/c] for every point of Activeness. You can obtain [c][C74848]up to 1,000 Light Points per week[-][/c], which will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Every 100 Light Points you earn will advance the progress by 1 level.\n\n2. You can claim the corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] after leveling up. Purchase the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c] to get corresponding [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c].\n\n3. The Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Only one of them can be purchased. The unpurchased tier and its rewards will not be available for purchase or claim after a purchase has been made. To maintain even revenue for all participants in Fragrant Sunshine, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted in any [c][C74848]Limited-Time Total Top-Up[-][/c] events, while the top-up amount will be counted as usual in [c][C74848]long-term top-up events[-][/c].\n\n4. Players can also earn extra Light Points through the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c] every week. The Company Quests can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Light Points.\n\n5. Players at certain levels can receive [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c], which can be used to redeem amazing gifts like [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma III, Crystal: R Karma VII, free SR Giftbox, growth materials[-][/c], and more in the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c].\n\n-Crystal: R Karma III contains the \"Hallowed Mirror\" event R Karmas: [Victor: Tea Observor], [Lucien: Meet Cute], [Kiro: I'm Already Taken], [Gavin: For Your Hunger Only], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5\n\n-Crystal: R Karma VII contains the \"Carefree Summer\" event R Karmas [Victor: Summer Sweetness], [Lucien: Whisper of the Sea], [Kiro: Icecream Wonder], [Gavin: Summer Breeze], [Shaw: Water Fight], Gold*20,000, Stamina*150, and Confess Wish*5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame contains 7 rerun avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold*10,000, Stamina*100, and Confess Wish*3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be cleared at the end of the event and cannot be used in subsequent events, so be sure to redeem them in time.\n\n6. The [c][C74848]Quick Level-Up[-][/c] feature will be available 30 days into the event, by which players can spend Gems to level up.\n*Gem consumption will be calculated according to the unit price of Light Points. Players only need to spend the Gems corresponding to the minimum amount of Light Points required to reach the chosen level."
  },
  [236] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86007_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] [Company Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event-limited Company Quests to earn extra Light Points. The Light Points earned in this way are not limited by the weekly limit.

2. Company Quests can only be completed once a week and will reset at 5:00 every Monday.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive to the players with Sunshine Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant you bonus weekly Light Points.]],
    rule_icon = "4"
  },
  [237] = {
    rule_type = "ZQLVlog33013",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the Seasons, stepping through time with him in the autumn.
Event Time: 2022/9/21 5:00 - 2022/10/17 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Go on an outing with Kiro and take photos of him at the attractions to preserve the memory!

-Visit the attractions and take photos to unlock the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] of the corresponding location with a record of the memories of the trip.

-Visit the attractions and take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. After obtaining 12 stages, you can claim [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Kiro: Flourishing Love][-][/c]!

-[c][C74848]New poses[-][/c] will be unlocked as you travel, so take more photos of him! You can use [Retake] to take different photos of him!

2. Tap [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] to take photos in a new location. The photos will be added to your travel album.

-You can obtain 1 chance to [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated. After finished taking photos at all the attractions, there will be no more chance to take photos.

3. Tap [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to take new photos of him at the attractions you have already visited.

-You can obtain 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated; Retakes can be purchased unlimitedly after being used up.

-Note: The retaken photos will not be updated in the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please make sure to save the retaken photos!

4. Use the [c][C74848]Quick Retake[-][/c] function to retake multiple photos and earn points.

5. Take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Memory Points[-][/c]. Accumulate required Memory Points to claim [c][C74848]Item Rewards[-][/c].

-Each photo grants 10 Memory Points; each retaken photo grants 5 Memory Points.]]
  },
  [238] = {
    rule_type = "98001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "限定羁绊复刻票选限时开启。\n\n活动时间：8月13日更新后-8月19日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，通过每日活跃度达指定档位\\n即可获得【拾光车票】，为喜欢的活动进行投票！\n\n2.每进行一次投票，即可获得一份随机道具奖励。\n\n3.活动结束后，获得票数最高的活动将在后续版本中进行复刻。\n\n4.8月20日0:00~8月21日23:59为票选展示期，期间不可进行投票，仅可查看各项票选结果。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的【拾光车票】将自动转换为金币，通过邮件发送至制作人的邮箱中。"
  },
  [239] = {
    rule_type = "PetDecorate",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "争做恋语市最靓的崽。\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]：\n\n1. 宠物身上有四个部位可穿戴饰品，分别为面部、头部、颈部和背部。\n\n2. 这四个部位的饰品可通过点击不同的页签进去查看，也可以通过全部页签查看所有进行穿戴。\n\n3. 未获得饰品也可以进行穿戴预览哦，但是无法进行保存。试穿饰品时，可通过点击[c][C74848]前往获得[-][/c]查看获取方式。\n\n4. 点击屏幕左侧的[c][C74848]放大镜[-][/c]按钮可确认身上穿戴饰品的详细信息。\n\n5. 点击屏幕左侧的[c][C74848]摄像机[-][/c]按钮可查看不同角度下的饰品状态。\n\n6. 确定宠物装扮时，可通过回到初始页点击[c][C74848]确认装扮[-][/c]进行保存，确认时会把未获得饰品进行剔除，可在二级确认弹窗中进行确认~\n\n7. 通过直播大赛进入换装界面时，可直接看到当季直播大赛的主题和宠物当前的萌力值。制作人可以进行自由搭配，也可直接点击[c][C74848]一键最强[-][/c]进行保存参加直播大赛。\n\n   和直播大赛主题相同的饰品将会在直播大赛发挥双倍的作用哦~"
  },
