  [246] = {
    rule_type = "100DayChallenge_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "There are millions of flowers in the world, but only the one I grew with Him blossoms in my heart.\n\nLoveland City Council - Hundred Days Together event is launching again! You're invited to take His hand and witness together a flower go from seed to full bloom.\n\nCare for the flower daily to claim super-value item rewards! When the flower enters a new growth stage, you'll get a an SMS or a phone call from Him! When it blooms, you'll get an exclusive commemorative desktop ornament~\n\n[c][C74848] Rules: [-][/c]\n\n1. From 12/05 05:00 to 03/14 23:59, the 100-day Hundred Fragrant Days event will be held.\n\n2. During the event, the first time you tend to your flower each day, you'll [c][C74848]get 1 Flower Stick, a random amount of 3-5 Growth Pts, and that day's Item Reward[-][/c]. When Growth Pts reach 1/40/80/140/200, you will get an SMS or phone call from Him.\n\nAfter successfully growing your flower, you'll get 1 exclusive commemorative desktop ornament of a corresponding color. After meeting certain conditions, you can spend Flower Sticks in the \"Winter Shop\" in exchange for exclusive commemorative desktop ornaments in other colors, as well as Nutrient Liquid.\n\n3. During the event, chances to tend to your flower will refresh daily at 05:00. For each accumulative 5 days you tend to your flower, you will receive 1 sign-in make-up item -- Pruning Shears.\n\n4. Check in daily during event , and you can receive a total of [c][C74848]Galaxy Wish Coupon ×50, Gems ×2888[-][/c], and other awesome rewards.\n\n5. Check-in rewards are only valid on the day. If you miss out, you can spend a sign-in make-up item, Pruning Shears, in the \"Flowering Phase Calendar\" to manually claim the reward.\n\n6. In the \"Winter Shop\", the special commemorative desktop ornament will be available for redeem after you receive 200 Growth Pts, with a purchase limit of 2 times during the event. Nutrient Liquid will be available 50 days after the start of the event, with a purchase limit of 1 time per day. A single use grants 6 Growth Pts."
  },
  [247] = {
    rule_type = "62009",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]月映良宵[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击分切月饼并使用[c][C74848]花瓣月饼[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用花瓣月饼有概率随机获取月映良宵R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用花瓣月饼未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n3.点击花瓣月饼数量右侧的加号可以查看花瓣月饼的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得花瓣月饼奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落花瓣月饼，每日最多可通过体力掉落20个；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费金币购买花瓣月饼，每日最多可购买10个。\n\n4.分切月饼获得的[c][C74848]桂花酿[-][/c]可以在【琼楼小铺】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
  },
