  [250] = {
    rule_type = "62010",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]人间寄味[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击开启食盒并使用[c][C74848]食盒[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用食盒有概率随机获取人间寄味R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用食盒未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n3.点击食盒数量右侧的加号可以查看食盒的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得食盒奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落食盒，每日最多可通过体力掉落20个；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费金币购买食盒，每日最多可购买10个。\n\n4.开启食盒获得的[c][C74848]猫耳朵[-][/c]可以在【珍馐小铺】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
  },
  [251] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86008",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 2023/9/1 05:00 to 2023/10/30 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Light Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Light Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Light Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you with a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]ltd-time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the [c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Light Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Light Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma IV, Crystal: Avatar Frame VIII, free SR Giftbox, progression materials[-][/c], and other fabulous rewards.\n\n-Crystal: R Karma XI includes the 2020 Holly & Jolly event R Karmas: [Victor: Warm Light], [Lucien: Mail Dream], [Kiro: Cute Chef], [Gavin: Star Wish Delivery], [Shaw: Tailor-made], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: R Karma X includes the 2020 Fun at Zoo event R Karmas: [Victor: Striped Style], [Lucien: Woolly Warmth], [Kiro: Colorful Image], [Gavin: Spotted Delight], [Shaw: Grey Rhapsody], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]accelerate leveling[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the number of required Light Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Light Points required to level up."
  },
