  [253] = {
    rule_type = "MaleTaskHelper",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Shooting Assistant[-][/c]
1. The Shooting Assistant helps players get dropped Karma Shards in Footage more easily.

2. Go to the Footage chapter to bookmark the Footage you want to shoot multiple times. There is no character limit. You can bookmark up to 24 Footage.

3. You can check the progress of your bookmarked Footage and the corresponding drops in the Shooting Assistant.

4. Multiple Shoots will consume all available films and attempts in the bookmark order.

5. You can cancel bookmarks, which will automatically move the next Footage up in order.]]
