  [257] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92005",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A lock containing the heart's voice falls before you, and a key to unlock the past clinks to the ground.\nThose stories of his are right now yours for the listening.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [AM Cloudy PM Sunny] and prepare a birthday gift for him. On [c][C74848]the day of His birthday[-][/c], enter the event page to open special birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special of days with you alone.\n\n◆Listen to Inner Voice and get Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Cards][-][/c] to listen to the inner voice from his youth, and get a Lucien's Birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Chocolate Marshmallow Ball]. (If there are not enough Birthday Cards, you can spend 20 Gems per card)\n\n2. Meanwhile, you'll randomly receive [c][C74848][Memory Items][-][/c] or Encounter Wishes, Gold, or Stamina rewards.\n\n3. Memory items can be used to unlock Lucien's [c][C74848]Young Lucien Birthday Memories[-][/c].\n\n4. After unlocking all six Memory Stories, you can claim Lucien's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Lucien: AM Cloudy PM Sunny][-][/c].\n\n◆Listen and rack up tons of rewards.\n\nWhen the number of moments you've focused or captured  reaches a certain amount, you can claim personal progress rewards such as [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, and Chronicle Seals].\n\n*[c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] are automatically converted to corresponding points for Ranking Score and Server Score.\n\n◆Listen to the past, unlock the future.\n\nObtain Birthday Karma [AM Cloudy PM Sunny] and prepare a birthday gift for him to unlock the [c][C74848][Birthday Card] Phase[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right of the screen to be face-to-face with him and write birthday wishes. You can also get [c][C74848]Chronicle Seals[-][/c] and other rewards.\n\n\n*At midnight on the day of the birthday, on the Birthday Karma [AM Cloudy PM Sunny] page, more event Plot Reviews will be permanently released, including Childhood Birthday Memories.\n"
  },
  [258] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92005_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Time goes on, but precious memories remain forever.\nOn this day worth remembering, open up a birthday card and leave behind an unforgettable memory.\n\n[c][C74848]On the day of the birthday[-][/c], enter the event page to open special birthday wishes. He wants to spend this most special of days with you alone.\n\n\n◆Write cards and redeem them for rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Key to Hope][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Birthday Cards][-][/c] to write down wishes and get item [c][C74848][Chronicle Seal][-][/c] (If there are not enough Birthday Cards, you can spend 20 Gems per card).\n\n2. Aside from Chronicle Seals, you will also get [c][C74848][Gift for the Beloved][-][/c] which can be exchanged in Shop for Past Birthday Karma, Clothing, Right Beside You, and lots of other item rewards.\n\n*[c][C74848][Chronicle Seals][-][/c] obtained will be automatically converted to corresponding Server Score and personal Ranking Score points.\n\n\n◆Accumulate Birthday Wishes to claim a personal reward.\n\nAccumulate a certain number of [c][C74848]Birthday Cards[-][/c] to claim rewards including [c][C74848][Birthday Outfit, Birthday Backgrounds, and Right Beside You][-][/c] etc.\n\n\n*At midnight on the day of the birthday, on the Birthday Karma [AM Cloudy PM Sunny] page, more event Plot Reviews will be permanently released, including Young Lucien Birthday Memories.\n"
  },
  [259] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92005_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848] Ranking Rules: [-][/c]

1. Different Rank Rewards will be given out based on your percentage range in the Personal Score rankings.

*Rewards will be sent out via Mail 1-2 working days after the event ends.

2. The Top 50 Producers will receive a bonus Special Edition Title [c][C74848][Lingering Romance][-][/c] and Avatar Frame [c][C74848][Record the World][-][/c]. If Server Score ultimately reaches the goal, the Top 50 Producers will receive a bonus in-game item.

*Special Edition Titles and Avatar Frames will be sent out via Mail 3 working days after the event ends. For shipping times on physical memorabilia, please stay tuned to official announcements.]]
  },
  [261] = {
    rule_type = "ActivityAnnualReview2021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n活动时间：12月18日5:00-12月26日23:59\n\n翻看与他的纪念册，重温这一年的浪漫回忆吧！\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]\n\n1.活动期间内，各位制作人可点击[c][C74848]【回忆映像】[-][/c]，查看他为你准备的纪念册。\n\n2.翻看至挑选页，制作人可获得[c][C74848]关于他的绘画灵感[-][/c]，灵感可在[c][C74848]妙笔绘他[-][/c]活动中使用。\n\n3.制作人可选择一张羁绊、一个记录及两句他的寄语进行分享，[c][C74848]首次分享[-][/c]可获得[c][C74848]额外奖励[-][/c]。\n\n4.纪念册中记录了制作人与他的相伴日期（记录至2021.12.18 4:59:59），牵绊等级（记录至2021.12.18 4:59:59），萌宠成长记录及过去一年中的温馨回忆。（仅记录2020.12.3 5:00~2021.12.18 4:59:59期间内投放并获得的短信、电话、朋友圈、约会、羁绊）"
  },
  [262] = {
    rule_type = "MainlinePresaleRule_40010",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
The fateful card game is on! Opportunity waits for no one. Stay patient and play your trump card wisely. 

[c][C74848]Rules[-][/c]

1. The [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] event will begin at 2023/3/16 5:00, and the new main story SSR Karmas [c][C74848]Victor: Set In Stone, Lucien: The Dead of Night, Gavin: Unsheathe, Kiro: Blazing Dreams, and Shaw: World's Embrace[-][/c] will be available.

2. The [c][C74848]Memory Corridor pre-sale[-][/c] begins at 2023/3/13 5:00. During this period, buying the pre-sale pack will grant you extra value: [c][C74848]Sealing Wax Bead x10, Gems x320[-][/c]. The pre-sale pack can be purchased once only.
  *[c][C74848]Sealing Wax Beads[-][/c] can be used in combination with [c][C74848]Wax Stamps[-][/c] to unlock the new S2 SSR Karmas in the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] event.
  *[c][C74848]Wax Stamps[-][/c] can be acquired by clearing [c][C74848]main story stages[-][/c] during the event.

3. When the pre-sale goal is achieved on the server (i.e. 2,000 pack purchases), specific [c][C74848]server discounts[-][/c] will be unlocked for the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c].
  Reach 25%: 5% off
  Reach 50%: 10% off
  Reach 75%: 15% off
  Reach 100%: 20% off.]]
