  [266] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Old times flash past until it freezes in the present.\nTick, tock, the journey of life unravels into radiant scenery.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Grand Miracle], and preparing a birthday cake and decorate the room for him, join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Throw him a surprise to get Karma.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to Prepare Surprise and get exclusive birthday gift [Customized Pudding Pen Holder]. (In the case of insufficient ornaments, you can spend 20 Gems for each ornament)\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848][Memory Items][-][/c] or one of the following rewards: [Encounter Wish, Gold, Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock Victor's [c][C74848]past Birthday Memories[-][/c].\n\n4. After unlocking all six memories, you can receive Victor's [c][C74848]Birthday Karma [Victor: Grand Miracle][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparation to obtain multiple rewards.\nDecorate for certain number of times to get personal progress rewards, including [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, Time Points].\n\n*[c][C74848][Time Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Grand Miracle], and preparing a birthday cake and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Send Blessings] stage[-][/c]. Click the arrow on the right side of the screen to give him blessings face to face, and you will also receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Time Points[-][/c].\n\n\nBirthday cake and decoration materials can be obtained in [c][C74848]preparing the surprise[-][/c]."
  },
  [267] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92006_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "The feelings most eager to be expressed cannot be put into words.\nThe change of time does not change the longing shining like a galaxy of stars when your eyes are set on him.\n\n[c][C74848]On his birthday[-][/c], go to the event screen to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Send Blessings to redeem multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to give blessings and get [c][C74848][Time\n  Points][-][/c]. (In the case of insufficient ornaments, you can spend 20 Gems\n  for each ornament.)\n\n* Time Points will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Time Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Gentle Whispers][-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards,\nincluding the Birthday Karma, Suits, and Right Beside You in previous years.\n\n*[c][C74848][Time Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n\n◆ Accumulate Blessings to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Send blessings[-][/c] for certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suits, Birthday-Exclusive Title\nBoxes, and Birthday-Exclusive Avatar Frames][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\n\n* On his birthday, send him cakes in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live Background[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal\nOrnaments[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*The Journal Ornament cannot be modified after obtained.\n\n*A default style cake journal ornament will be available for Producers who has obtained the Karma without preparing a cake."
  },
  [268] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92006_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event. 

2. The top 100 producers will also receive a special-edition title [c][C74848][Caramel Memory][-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c].

*The special-edition title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. For more information, stay tuned for future announcements.]]
  },
  [269] = {
    rule_type = "yearCard2021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明：[-][/c]\n1. 周年馈礼于2021年12月8日更新后 - 2021年12月26日 23:59 期间限时开放购买。\n\n2. 购买周年馈礼后，会将对应金额[c][C74848]3倍[-][/c]数量的钻石暂时存储起来，并于[c][C74848]2022年12月20日 5:00[-][/c]后开启领取。\n\n3. 购买周年馈礼后，自2022年1月1日 5:00 起，每月可领取1个[c][C74848]心蕴结晶/海蕴结晶[-][/c]，结晶可用于膨胀存储的钻石奖励。如果膨胀成功，则钻石的数量会增加1倍（以购买价格为基数）。\n\n4. 单次膨胀成功的概率为[c][C74848]33.3%[-][/c]，如果连续2次膨胀失败，则[c][C74848]第3次膨胀必定成功[-][/c]。（若领取了全部的12个结晶，加上初始的3倍，最终可领取至少[c][C74848]7倍[-][/c]的钻石，最多可领取[c][C74848]15倍[-][/c]的钻石。）\n\n5. 周年馈礼分为680档和500档，可同时购买。如果购买了680档的周年馈礼，每周还可领取一份赠礼，可获得随机奖励：心绪之花x1、寄意币·限定x1、祈福币x1、时光解锁券x6"
  },
