Event time: 2023/12/3 5:00 - 2023/12/29 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Spend the time away from Lucien's company by completing each other's small tasks.

-After completing an event, you will unlock that event's [c][C74848]Diary[-][/c]. Keeping track of the happenings while you are apart.

