5. Using Moves will award [c][C74848]Caring Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Caring Pts milestones will unlock [c][C74848]item rewards[-][/c].

-Each Move awards 10 Caring Pts. Each "Move Again" awards 5 Caring Pts.]]
  },
  [284] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39012",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Put out tempting bait and wait for his arrival.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Choose any character you wish to access his menu when first you access the event (each has 9 puzzle pieces).

2. Clearing Normal or Elite stages during the event nets you [c][C74848]Mustard Cones[-][/c] which you can use to [c][C74848]light up puzzle pieces[-][/c].

3. Collect enough pieces and tap twice to light it up.

4. Light up all of a character's 9 puzzle pieces, then tap [c][C74848]Open[-][/c] to check what sweet words he has written for you.

5. You can share their sweet words to social media (the first share per character nets you a [c][C74848]Prank Certificate[-][/c]). These certificates can be redeemed for [c][C74848]Tempting Heart R Karmas[-][/c] at the [c][C74848]Night Bazaar[-][/c].

6. You can switch between the characters to share more sweet words and earn rewards. Only the first share of each character grants rewards.

7. You can redeem Mustard Cones for tons of amazing rewards at the [c][C74848]Night Bazaar[-][/c].]]
  },
  [285] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92007",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A tranquil moment under the stars.\nA timeless memory never to be lost.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Tranquil Stars], and preparing a birthday cake and decorate the room for him, join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Throw him a surprise to get Karma.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to prepare for the surprise, receive the Kiro birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Star Yellow Vinyl] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Ornament).\n\n2. You will also gain a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or either [Encounter Wish, Gold, or Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Kiro's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Kiro's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Kiro: Tranquil Stars][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nDecorate or furnish for certain number of times to get personal progress rewards, including [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, or Deep Sky Points].\n\n*[c][C74848][Deep Sky Point][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Tranquil Stars], and preparing a birthday cake and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Sending Blessings] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to give him blessings, and you will also receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Deep Sky Points[-][/c]. \nBirthday cake and decoration materials can be obtained when [c][C74848]preparing the surprise[-][/c]."
  },
  [286] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92007_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "The whispers in my heart resonate with the voice that I hear.\nThe story climaxes as you entrust your futures to each other, becoming the light in each other's eyes.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n\n◆ Send Blessings to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to give blessings and get [c][C74848][Deep Sky Points][-][/c]. (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Ornament.)\n\n*Deep Sky Points will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n \n2. In addition to Deep Sky Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Gentle Whispers][-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including the Birthday Karma, Outfits, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Deep Sky Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n\n◆ Accumulate Blessings to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Send blessings[-][/c] for certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suits, Birthday-Exclusive Title Frames, and Avatar Frames][-][/c].\n\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\n*On his birthday, send him cakes in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal Ornaments[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*The Journal Ornaments cannot be modified after being obtained.\n\n*A default style cake journal ornament will be available for the Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing a cake."
  },
  [287] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92007_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.


2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848][Teddy Bear Kiss][-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event.]]
  },
  [288] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92007_4",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Decorate the room for him!\n\n◆ Tap and hold the decors of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the scene[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the decors in the room and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the changes after decoration!"
  },
  [289] = {
