  },
  [290] = {
    rule_type = "backflow_66003",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.累计21天未登录游戏，且通关主线4-1的制作人，可触发[c][C74848]琉光相依[-][/c]活动\n\n2.活动期间，前7天登录游戏，还可收获由他准备的额外的惊喜！\n\n3.活动倒计时[c][C74848]15[-][/c]天。在限定时间内达到任务要求，即可获得[c][C74848]日记本[-][/c]。制作人可进入[c][C74848]斜阳小铺[-][/c]用日记本兑换奖励\n\n4.所有任务的进度都从本活动解锁后才开始统计；累计登录任务每日5:00更新进度\n\n5.活动开放期间，制作人还可在[c][C74848]回归商城[-][/c]中购买回归制作人专属礼包"
  },
  [291] = {
    rule_type = "98002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "限定羁绊复刻票选限时开启。\n\n活动时间：5月9日 5:00-5月15日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，通过每日活跃度达指定档位\\n即可获得【拾光车票】，为喜欢的活动进行投票！\n\n2.每进行一次投票，即可获得一份随机道具奖励。\n\n3.活动结束后，获得票数最高的活动将在后续版本中进行复刻。\n\n4.5月16日0:00~5月17日23:59为票选展示期，期间不可进行投票，仅可查看各项票选结果。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的【拾光车票】将自动转换为金币，通过邮件发送至制作人的邮箱中。"
  },
  [292] = {
    rule_type = "extra_drop_45005",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. During the event, [c][C74848]buying Heart Flowers to make wishes[-][/c] has a chance to grant you [c][C74848][Gavin: Summer Fervor] Shards[-][/c]!

2. During the event, you may [c][C74848]log in daily[-][/c] to claim [c][C74848][Gavin: Summer Fervor] Shards[-][/c] and Galaxy Wish Coupons!
-The login bonus resets every day at 5:00. The unclaimed rewards of the day will not carry over to the next day, so be sure to collect them in time.

3. During the event, [c][C74848]clearing main story stages[-][/c] has a chance to grant you [c][C74848][Gavin: Summer Fervor] Shards[-][/c]. You can earn up to 15 shards in this way.
]]
  },
  [293] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86011",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 3/1 05:00 to 4/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]limited-time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the [c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once per week and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: R Karma VII, Crystal: R Karma III, free SR Giftbox, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n- Crystal: R Karma VII includes the Carefree Summer event R Karmas: [Victor: Summer Sweetness], [Lucien: Whisper of the Sea], [Kiro: Ice cream Wonder], [Gavin: Summer Breeze], [Shaw: Water Fight], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: R Karma III includes the Hallowed Mirror event R Karmas: [Victor: Tea Observer], [Lucien: Meet Cute], [Kiro: I'm Already Taken], [Gavin: For Your Hunger Only], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3.     \n\n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]instantly level up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
  },
  [294] = {
    rule_type = "62012",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]时清日长[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击系菖蒲并使用[c][C74848]菖蒲叶[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用菖蒲叶有概率随机获取时清日长R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用菖蒲叶未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n3.点击菖蒲叶数量右侧的加号可以查看菖蒲叶的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得菖蒲叶奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落食盒，每日最多可通过体力掉落20个；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费金币购买菖蒲叶，每日最多可购买10个。\n\n4.系菖蒲获得的[c][C74848]龙舟木雕[-][/c]可以在【端阳小店】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
  },
  [295] = {
    rule_type = "ChineseQixiFestivalQMainPanel",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Encounter Event[-][/c] Rules

1. During the event, each Extraction grants you [c][C74848]1 Sugar Cube[-][/c]. With every [c][C74848]10 Sugar Cubes[-][/c] consumed, 1 Encounter Event will be unlocked.
*After the event, Encounter Events can be reviewed on the event Karma screen.

2. With each Encounter Event completed, you can collect corresponding Journal Stickers.
*Journal Stickers will no longer be available after the event, so be sure to collect your rewards in time.

3. You may also tap to interact with him on the event screen. Give it a try!]]
