  [299] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92008",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "As the night thickens, your hearts beat in unison as two people slowly become one.\nThe midsummer downpour represents the love and adoration you hold for each other.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Blooming Youth], preparing a birthday cake, and decorating the scene for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Throw him a surprise to get Karma.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to prepare the surprise, you can claim your Bond Wish! (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Ornaments.)\n\n2. You will also gain a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or [Encounter Wish, Gold, or Stamina].\n\n3. Memory Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Shaw's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Shaw's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Blooming Youth][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nDecorate or furnish for a certain number of times to get personal progress rewards, including [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, Rainy Night Points], and more.\n\n*[c][C74848][Rainy Night Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprises to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Blooming Youth], preparing a birthday cake, and decorating the scene for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Send Blessings] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to give him blessings, and you will also receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Rainy Night Points[-][/c].\n\nBirthday cake and decoration materials can be obtained when [c][C74848]preparing the surprise[-][/c].\n\n\n\n"
  },
