  [308] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92009",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Walk over darkness and onto glory with determination.\nWhen the flowers bloom, he will be reunited with his lover.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [From Afar], preparing a birthday cake and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Throw him a surprise to get Karma.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to prepare the surprise to claim your Bond Wish! (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Ornament.)\n\n2. You will also gain a random [c][C74848][Memory Item][-][/c] or [Encounter Wish], [Gold], or [Stamina].\n\n3. Memories Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Gavin's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Gavin's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Gavin: From Afar][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nDecorate or furnish for a certain number of times to get personal progress rewards, including [Birthday R Karma, Stamina, Breeze Points], and more.\n\n*[c][C74848][Breeze Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprises to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [From Afar], preparing a birthday cake, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Send Blessings] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to give him blessings, and you will also receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Breeze Points[-][/c].\n\nBirthday cake and decoration materials can be obtained when [c][C74848]preparing the surprise[-][/c].\n\n\n\n"
  },
  [309] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92009_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Sincere kindness and blessings paint the most pleasant prospect for the future.\nAll the pride and jollification in this world are given to him which are also be covered with love.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n\n◆ Send Blessings to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][LED Mini Lights][-][/c] and [c][C74848][Ornaments][-][/c] to give blessings and get [c][C74848][Breeze Points][-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Ornament).\n\n*[Breeze Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Breeze Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Gentle Whispers][-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including the Birthday Karma, Outfits, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Breeze Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n\n◆ Accumulate Blessings to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Send blessings[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][birthday suits, birthday-exclusive Title Frames, and limited Avatar Frames][-][/c].\n\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\n*On his birthday, send him cakes in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal Ornaments[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*The Journal Ornaments cannot be modified after being obtained.\n\n*A default-style cake journal ornament will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing a cake.\n"
  },
  [310] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92009_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.


2. The top 100 Producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848][Sky Blue][-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Refer to follow-up announcements to stay updated as we produce these rewards.
]]
  },
  [311] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92009_4",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Decorate the room for him!\n\n◆ Tap and hold the decors of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the room[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the decors in the room and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the changes after decoration!"
  },
  [312] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92009_5",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Make a delicious birthday cake for him.\n\n◆ Tap and hold the ingredients of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the cake[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the ingredients on the cake and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the cake you just made!\n\n*The cake you give him will be turned into a journal ornament after his birthday as a souvenir and will not be available for modification."
  },
  [313] = {
    rule_type = "extra_drop_45006",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. During the event, there is a chance to receive extra [c][C74848]"Lucien Sheltered Heartbeats" Karma Shards[-][/c] when you [c][C74848]purchase Heart Flowers to make wishes[-][/c]!

2. During the event, [c][C74848]log in daily[-][/c] to claim [c][C74848]"Lucien Sheltered Heartbeats" Karma Shards[-][/c] and Galaxy Wish Coupons as rewards!
- The login rewards refresh daily at 5:00 AM. Unclaimed rewards from the previous day will expire, so make sure to claim them in time!

3. During the event, [c][C74848]complete main story stages[-][/c] for a chance to get [c][C74848]"Lucien: Sheltered Heartbeats" Karma Shards[-][/c]. You can receive a maximum of 15 shards throughout the event.]]
  },
  [314] = {
    rule_type = "PirateGame_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "1.所有解锁后的小游戏均会收纳在工作日志中，可以在此进行快速游玩。\n   ps:小游戏所消耗的行动力每日5:00会恢复~\n\n2.游戏三星通关后，可直接速刷该游戏~至少三星通关1个游戏后，还可同步解锁羁绊助力功能！\n\n3.在羁绊助力页面内，可上阵与他相关的羁绊。加成越高，游戏的掉落奖励则越多~\n   ps:上阵禁忌之海活动卡牌还可以获得额外的加成哦！"
  },
  [315] = {
    rule_type = "111001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]紫宸人间[-][/c]\n\n云卷云舒，丹阙千年，和他一起观天地浩荡，江山绵延。\n活动期间，点击【出发】，和他一起领略天坛的魅力吧！\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]\n\n1、每日登录游戏可获取1支[c][C74848]祈年殿雪糕[-][/c]，当日未使用的祈年殿雪糕可累计到下一日使用。活动期间，最多可获得6支祈年殿雪糕；\n\n2、点击【出发】，消耗1支[c][C74848]祈年殿雪糕[-][/c]，即可前往1处天坛景点游览；\n\n3、前5次游览将随机前往神乐署、斋宫、百花亭、皇穹宇、回音壁中的任一景点，游览完毕即可获得[c][C74848]他的朋友圈[-][/c]；\n\n4、第6次游览将前往祈年殿，游览完毕即可获得[c][C74848]限定背景【重檐祈年殿】[-][/c]和[c][C74848]钻石[-][/c]奖励。\n"
  },
  [316] = {
    rule_type = "113001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "大海的秘宝凝结成晶莹宝石，臻琢细雕成独一无二的存在。\n况味馨香被锁入其中，等待与你沉入梦幻境域。\n\n收集指定数量的[c][C74848]夜光宝石[-][/c]，即可[c][C74848]任选角色[-][/c]获取对应的[c][C74848]服装[-][/c]与[c][C74848]羁绊[-][/c]奖励。\n\n夜光宝石可通过[c][C74848]【沉没的宝藏】[-][/c]活动获取。"
  },
  [317] = {
    rule_type = "pirate2022",
    rule_title = "沉没的宝藏",
    rule_desc = "【基本操作】\n点击屏幕左右两侧，可以向对应方向行走。\n点击场景中的各种物品或人物，可以上前进行互动。\n\n【展开冒险】\n跟随右上角的【任务指引】，逐渐探索游戏世界吧。\n点击【航海图】可以移动到游戏世界的其他已解锁地点。\n点击【航海笔记】可以查看当前任务详细指引、已获得的游戏物品以及回忆经历过的冒险剧情。\n仔细留意游戏世界的人告诉你的各种信息！\n\n【航海任务】\n【重要任务】代表了你和他冒险中的关键旅途，【奇遇任务】完成后也许会有额外奖励。\n航海图中的【探索度】代表了对应区域相关的航海任务的完成情况。\n\n【工作日志】\n冒险中会解锁各类日程。航海笔记中的【工作日志】可以帮助你快速获得沉沙金币！不过，进行日程需要消耗行动力，行动力将在每日5点恢复至不超过上限。\n\n【商店与荣誉】\n冒险中还会遇到很多商人，可以购买各种各样的物品。如果已经获得他的交易契约，还可以在航海笔记【进货】中快速购买商品，无需再去找到这位商人。\n当完成了一些成就后，记得点击左上角的荣誉按钮领取荣誉奖励。"
  },
  [318] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39014",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "你捧起一缕月华，将他的心灯点亮。\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.首次开启活动时，可选择任意一名角色，进入他的活动界面；每个角色的界面中有9块拼图\n\n2.活动期间，通关任意普通或精英关卡，均可获得[c][C74848]糖糍粑[-][/c]；消耗糖糍粑即可[c][C74848]点亮拼图[-][/c]\n\n3.点亮方法：拼图数量足够时，点击2下拼图，即可点亮\n\n4.点亮同一角色的9块拼图后，点击[c][C74848]“拆开”[-][/c]，就能看到他给你的仲秋寄语\n\n5.仲秋寄语可分享到微博或微信朋友圈，首次分享这名角色的仲秋寄语，可领取一个[c][C74848]桂花糕[-][/c]；桂花糕可在[c][C74848]玉桂小铺[-][/c]中兑换[c][C74848]月夕恋话系列R羁绊[-][/c]\n\n6.活动期间，可以更换选择的角色；分享不同角色的寄语，可领取多次分享奖励；每位角色只能分享领取一次\n\n7.糖糍粑还可以在[c][C74848]玉桂小铺[-][/c]中兑换其他丰厚奖励"
  },
