  [336] = {
    rule_type = "69004",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "将春夏秋冬的美好收藏，为他放映一场珍贵的影片。\n\n[c][C74848]活动玩法：[-][/c]\n\n1.选择他后，点击[c][C74848]视频封面[-][/c]可以进入编辑器进行视频制作。在活动期间内可以随时修改视频内容。\n\n2.完成编辑后，点击[c][C74848]渲染成片[-][/c]来导出制作的视频并准备好送给他吧！在送给他之前可以随时[c][C74848]重制[-][/c]修改已渲染完成的视频，修改后需要重新进行[c][C74848]渲染成片[-][/c]导出。\n\n3.在到达[c][C74848]2022年12月20日05:00以后[-][/c]，可以将已完成的视频[c][C74848]送给他[-][/c]，和他一起观看这个由你亲手制作，充满二人回忆的特别节目。送给他之后，视频就无法再次修改了，请慎重选择。\n\n4.完成视频制作并在规定时间内送给他，和他一起观看视频，可以获得一条他的[c][C74848]朋友圈[-][/c]。\n\n[c][C74848]分享回忆：[-][/c]\n\n1.完成视频渲染后，可以对你们的回忆进行分享，首次分享可以获得[c][C74848]一枚星河许愿券[-][/c]。\n\n2.分享内容由视频制作中所涉及的内容生成，根据你和他共度的回忆可能会有所不同。\n\n3.完成视频渲染进入分享页面时，会获得称号奖励！同一称号仅能获取一次，无法重复获得。\n\n[c][C74848]注意事项：[-][/c]\n\n为保证视频录制和播放顺利，请注意保持游戏资源完整。\n\n视频中的回忆数据统计至2022年12月9日5:00。"
  },
  [339] = {
    rule_type = "MainlinePresaleRule_40011",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Shimmering candlelight of memories, slicing through the endless night. Let the light from afar guide the direction of your journey.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. The [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] event will begin on 2024/3/12 after the update. All-new Season 2 Main Story SSR Karmas [c][C74848]Victor: Smoldering Fire, Lucien: Cool Flame Fulcrum, Kiro: Obsessive Fantasy, Gavin: Traveler's Return, and Shaw: Unceasing Thunder[-][/c] will become available to obtain.

2. Starting from 2024/3/9, the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor Pre-sale[-][/c] event will begin. Purchase the Pre-sale Pack during the event to receive [c][C74848]Trailing Light x10, Gems x320[-][/c]. The Pre-sale Pack can only be purchased once.
*[c][C74848]Trailing Lights[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Star Candles[-][/c] can be used inside the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] to obtain all-new Season 2 Main Story SSR Karmas.
*[c][C74848]Star Candles[-][/c] can be obtained by clearing [c][C74848]Main Story stages[-][/c] during the event, or obtained from the [c][C74848]Anniversary Event[-][/c].

3. Special [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] events will be unlocked depending on the amount of Pre-sale Packs sold server-wide, granting a [c][C74848]server-wide[-][/c] discount to each percentage milestone:
25% - 5% off,
50% - 10% off,
75% - 15% off,
100% - 20% off.]]
  },
  [340] = {
    rule_type = "yearCard2022",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明：[-][/c]\n1. 2022年12月9日更新后~2022年12月25日23:59，两款周年馈礼商品限时发售，可同时购买。\n\n2.花费[c][C74848]钻石*500[-][/c]购买钻石档位周年馈礼后，可立即存储[c][C74848]钻石*500[-][/c]。2022年12月26日5:00起，每周可固定领取[c][C74848]钻石*50[-][/c]的奖励，同时可随机抽取[c][C74848]10-100钻石[-][/c]进行存储。\n\n3.花费[c][C74848]98元[-][/c]购买98元档位周年馈礼后，可立即存储[c][C74848]钻石*980[-][/c]。2022年12月26日5:00起，每周可固定领取[c][C74848]钻石*100[-][/c]的奖励，同时可随机抽取[c][C74848]20-200钻石[-][/c]进行存储。\n\n4.每周固定和随机钻石的领取时间持续至2023年12月20日23:59，共计52周。\n\n5.累计存储的钻石奖励将于2023年12月21日0:00开放领取。"
  },
  [341] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_68020",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c]

Shimmering candlelight of memories, slicing through the endless night. Let the light from afar guide the direction of your journey.

[c][C74848]Rules[-][/c]

1. Tap [light up] to consume  [c][C74848]Dream Handbell[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Lingering Echo[-][/c], and in return you get 9-12 [c][C74848]Light-up Progress[-][/c] and other random rewards.

2. Reach certain progress tiers to get Season 2 main story limited [c][C74848]SSR Giftboxes[-][/c] and their related [c][C74848]Outfit Giftboxes[-][/c].

3. [c][C74848]Dream Handbells[-][/c] can be obtained from [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c] or [c][C74848]purchased with Gems[-][/c]; Lingering Echoes can be obtained by [c][C74848]clearing main story stages[-][/c].]]
  },
  [342] = {
    rule_type = "ZQLVlog33018",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Every step you take, he is right there beside you, walking along in the radiant sun.
Event period: 2025/10/7 5:00 -2025/10/26 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Spend the time away from Kiro's company by completing each other's small tasks!

-After completing an event, you will unlock that event's [c][C74848]Diary[-][/c]. Keeping track of the happenings while you are apart.

-Completing the event will award [c][C74848]progress[-][/c]. After obtaining 9 progresses, you'll be eligible to receive the [c][C74848]SR Karma [Kiro: Toss of Fate][-][/c]!

-During the event, other than his own work, he's also completing all the little tasks you have left him.

2. Tap on the [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] button to begin completing a new event to be recorded in the Diary.

-You get 1 [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] every day, resetting at 5 AM of the next day. Moves don't accumulate. You will not get any more moves once all events are complete.

3. Tapping on [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] will let you complete an event you have already completed.
-You get 6 free [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] chances per day that refresh each day at 5 AM and do not accumulate to the next day. These can also be purchased with Gems without limit.

4. You can use the [c][C74848]Quick Move[-][/c] feature to quickly use all the Move Again chances and gain points.

5. Using Moves will award [c][C74848]Caring Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Caring Pts milestones will unlock [c][C74848]item rewards[-][/c].

-Each Move awards 10 Caring Pts. Each Move Again awards 5 Caring Pts.]]
  },
  [343] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86015",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 11/1 05:00 to 12/30 23:59\n\n[c][C74848]◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]Basic Reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]Privilege Reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]limited-time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the[c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Holly & Jolly, Crystal: Sugary Scent, Crystal: Carefree Summer, Crystal: Hallowed Mirror, free SR Custom Giftbox, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n6. Players will also be able to obtain a[c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftbox[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. A [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Key[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Key[-][/c] can be used to open the giftbox to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Exclusive Avatar Frame[-][/c]. The two keys can be purchased from Evol Supply.\n\n-Crystal: Holly & Jolly includes the Holly & Jolly event R Karmas: [Victor: Warm Light], [Lucien: Mail Dream], [Kiro: Cute Chef], [Gavin: Star Wish Delivery], [Shaw: Tailor-made], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Sugary Scent includes the Sugary Scent event R Karmas: [Victor: True to Words], [Lucien: You Are Mine], [Kiro: Falling Flowers], [Gavin: Connected Hearts], [Shaw: Dessert Night], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Carefree Summer includes the Carefree Summer event R Karmas: [Victor: Summer Sweetness], [Lucien: Whisper of the Sea], [Kiro: Icecream Wonder], [Gavin: Summer Breeze], [Shaw: Water Fight], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Hallowed Mirror includes the Hallowed Mirror event R Karmas: [Victor: Tea Observor], [Lucien: Meet Cute], [Kiro: I'm Already Taken], [Gavin: For Your Hunger Only], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n7. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]Instant Lv. Up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
  },
  [344] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86015_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
