  [362] = {
    rule_type = "98003",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "限定羁绊复刻票选限时开启。\n\n活动时间：2月9日更新后-2月15日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，通过每日活跃度达指定档位\\n即可获得【拾光车票】，为喜欢的活动进行投票！\n\n2.每进行一次投票，即可获得一份随机道具奖励。\n\n3.活动结束后，获得票数最高的活动将在后续版本中进行复刻。\n\n4.2月16日0:00~2月17日23:59为票选展示期，期间不可进行投票，仅可查看各项票选结果。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的【拾光车票】将自动转换为金币，通过邮件发送至制作人的邮箱中。"
  },
  [363] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39015",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "喜时佳年到，祥兔闹春宵。\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.首次开启活动时，可选择任意一名角色，进入他的活动界面；每个角色的界面中有9块拼图\n\n2.活动期间，通关任意普通或精英关卡，均可获得[c][C74848]岁糖[-][/c]；消耗岁糖即可[c][C74848]点亮拼图[-][/c]\n\n3.点亮方法：拼图数量足够时，点击2下拼图，即可点亮\n\n4.点亮同一角色的9块拼图后，点击[c][C74848]“拆开”[-][/c]，就能看到他给你的卯岁寄语\n\n5.卯岁寄语可分享到微博或微信朋友圈，首次分享这名角色的卯岁寄语，可领取一个[c][C74848]春意福包[-][/c]；春意福包可在[c][C74848]福兔小铺[-][/c]中兑换[c][C74848]祥兔闹春系列R羁绊[-][/c]\n\n6.活动期间，可以更换选择的角色；分享不同角色的寄语，可领取多次分享奖励；每位角色只能分享领取一次\n\n7.岁糖还可以在[c][C74848]祥兔闹春[-][/c]中兑换其他丰厚奖励"
  },
  [364] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86016",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 1/1 5:00 - 3/1 23:59\n\n[c][C74848]◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]Ltd-Time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the[c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Fun at Zoo, Crystal: Bubble Cloud, Crystal: Candy Comedies, Crystal: Holly & Jolly, free SR Custom Giftbox, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n6. Players will also be able to obtain [c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftboxes[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Keys[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Keys[-][/c] can be used to open the giftboxes to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Exclusive Avatar Frame[-][/c]. The two keys can be purchased from Evol Supply.\n\n-Crystal: Fun at Zoo includes the Fun at Zoo event R Karmas: [Victor: Striped Style], [Lucien: Woolly Warmth], [Kiro: Colorful Image], [Gavin: Spotted Delight], [Shaw: Grey Rhapsody], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Bubble Cloud includes the Bubble Cloud event R Karmas: [Victor: Flustered], [Lucien: Perfect Reenactment], [Kiro: Battle of Hearts], [Gavin: Urgent Training], [Shaw: Like a Pro], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Colorful Comedies includes the C, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Holly & Jolly includes the Holly & Jolly event R Karmas: [Victor: Warm Light], [Lucien: Mail Dream], [Kiro: Cute Chef], [Gavin: Star Wish Delivery], [Shaw: Tailor-made], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n     \n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter],olorful Comedies event R Karmas: [Victor: No Escaping], [Lucien: Cute Flowers], [Kiro: Cute Bear], [Gavin: Sound of Wonder], [Shaw: Pixel Style], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150 [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n7. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]Instant Lv. Up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
  },
  [365] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86016_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848][Company Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event-limited Company Quests to gain extra Sunlight Points that are unaffected by your weekly limit.

2. Company Quest can only be completed once per week, resetting every Monday at 5 AM.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive to the players with Sunshine Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant you bonus weekly Sunlight Points.]],
    rule_icon = "4"
