  [366] = {
    rule_type = "123001",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. During the event, you'll be able to select any rerun event to participate in. Once your cumulative top-up reaches the required amount, you can claim the corresponding limited Karmas, items for Right Beside You, and Avatar Frames as a reward.

2. You can freely switch to each rerun event and view its corresponding rewards any time before you claim the top-up reward. However, once you have claimed the reward, you will no longer be able to change to other rerun events. Please make your selection carefully.

3. If you've chosen an event and reached the top-up milestone, but haven't claimed the reward to lock in your selection, you will be awarded according to your last choice when the event concludes.]]
  },
  [367] = {
    rule_type = "LZYVlog33019",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through a journey to the past, memories bloom anew, and spring lingers gently over the verdant hills.
Event Period: 2026/2/28 5:00 - 2026/3/26 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Spend the time away from Victor's company by completing each other's small tasks!

-After completing an event, you will unlock that event's [c][C74848]Diary[-][/c] to keep track of the happenings while you are apart.

-Completing the event will award [c][C74848]Progress[-][/c]. Reach 12 Progress to claim the [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Victor: A Heart in Bloom][-][/c]!

-During the event, in addition to his own work, he'll also take care of the little tasks you've left for him.

2. Tap on the [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] button to begin completing a new event to be recorded in the Diary.

-You get 1 [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] every day, resetting at 5 AM of the next day. Moves don't accumulate. You will not get any more moves once all events are complete.

3. Tapping on [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] will let you complete an event you have already completed.
-You get 6 free [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] chances per day that refresh each day at 5 AM and do not accumulate to the next day. These can also be purchased with Gems without limit.

4. You can use the [c][C74848]Quick Move[-][/c] feature to quickly use all the Move Again chances and gain points.

5. Using Moves will award [c][C74848]Caring Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Caring Pts milestones will unlock [c][C74848]item rewards[-][/c].

-Each Move awards 10 Caring Pts. Each Move Again awards 5 Caring Pts.]]
  },
  [368] = {
    rule_type = "62013",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]聆心夜语[-][/c]规则说明\n\n1.活动期间，点击收获情语并使用[c][C74848]心意币[-][/c]，即可获取丰富奖励，点击【奖励一览】可查看。\n\n2.使用心意币有概率随机获取聆心夜语R品质羁绊。\n\n[c][C74848]连续35次[-][/c]使用心意币未获得羁绊时，[c][C74848]第36次[-][/c]使用[c][C74848]必定[-][/c]获取一张[c][C74848]未获取[-][/c]羁绊；\n\n如果在此期间获得了羁绊，次数会[c][C74848]重置[-][/c]。\n\n3.点击心意币数量右侧的加号可以查看心意币的获取途径：\n\n- [c][C74848]每日任务[-][/c]：在完成每日任务领取活跃奖励时，会同时获得心意币奖励；\n\n- [c][C74848]关卡掉落[-][/c]：通关和扫荡普通或精英关卡，有概率掉落心意币，每日最多可通过体力掉落20个；\n\n- [c][C74848]Evol供给站[-][/c]：恋爱供给中可以花费金币购买心意币，每日最多可购买10个。\n\n4.使用心意币获得的[c][C74848]酒心巧克力[-][/c]可以在【盈夜小铺】中换取游戏的指定道具。"
  },
  [369] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_68021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A tomorrow that has yet to pass lies in the future.\n\nRules of [c][C74848]Star Wish Echo[-][/c]\n\n1. During the Star Wish Echo event, consuming [c][C74848]Reminiscence Obelisks[-][/c] to Trace Echo grants a certain number of Reminiscence Chips and a random Main Story SSR Karma or Gem Wish Tree Karma.\n\nEach time you Trace Echo, you'll gain 16–20 Reminiscence Chips.\n\n2. During the event, the overall drop rate of SSR/SP Karmas (guarantee included) is 1.93%; the overall drop rate of the new Main Story SSR Karmas (guarantee included) is 1.4%.\n\nAn SR or better Karma is guaranteed for every [Trace Echo 10X],\n\nTracing Echo 72X guarantees SSR/SP Karmas. The obtainment guarantee resets upon the obtainment of SSR/SP Karmas,\n\nEach time you acquire an SSR/SP Karma, it has a 50% chance to be an event exclusive Karma.\n\n3. This event boasts a Telepathy feature. Before Tracing Echo, you may select 1 unobtained Karma as a Telepathy target. It guarantees that the first 2 SSR/SP Karmas you acquire after the said action will include a Telepathy Karma. The obtainment guarantee resets upon the obtainment of a Telepathy Karma.\n\nYou can change your Telepathy target at will until the obtainment of a Telepathy Karma, and changing it does not reset the obtainment guarantee.\n\nAfter acquiring the Telepathy Karma, you may select another unobtained Karma as a new Telepathy target. When you've gained all Karmas earnable from the current event, the Telepathy feature will become unavailable.\n\n4. After the obtainment of the Telepathy Karma, draws done without selecting a new Telepathy target will count toward the Telepathy obtainment guarantee of the next round. If the obtainment guarantee is triggered before a new Telepathy target is selected, you'll gain one of the Karmas earnable from the current event at random. If you acquire a Main Story Karma without selecting a new Telepathy target, the Telepathy obtainment guarantee will be reset.\n\n5. Reminiscence Obelisks are earnable from [c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Gem Purchases[-][/c].\n\n6. Reminiscence Chips are also redeemable in Heartfelt Resupply for in-game items.\n\nWhen the event ends, unused Reminiscence Chips will be converted into Gold and mailed to you."
  },
  [370] = {
    rule_type = "BqSingle4002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
