  [372] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92012_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "When the sun rose and the moon set, two snuggling figures were silhouetted against the light. \nThe trivialities of life are never mundane. They're always as charming as iridescent flowers.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Unfading Vow], preparing the Longevity Noodles and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Follow your Heart's Trail and receive Karmas.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][Blossoming Bouquets]{#i=400112}[-][/c] and [c][C74848][Floating Balloons]{#i=400113}[-][/c] to decorate and garnish in the Heart's Trail, you'll receive Kiro's birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Lamp to Lamp]{#i=300209} and [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing balloon).\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848]Memory Items[-][/c], Encounter Wish{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Memories Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Kiro's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Kiro's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Kiro: Unfading Vow][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday R Karma[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, Perfection Points{#i=400111}, and more.\n\n*[c][C74848]Perfection Points[-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare a Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Unfading Vow], preparing the birthday Longevity Noodles, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Show Affection] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Perfection Points{#i=400111}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400115}[-][/c].\n\nBirthday Longevity Noodles and decoration materials can be obtained in [c][C74848]Heart's Trail[-][/c].\n\n\n"
  },
  [373] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92012_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "In a sea of flowers bathed in starlight, he gently pulls you into his embrace.\nThis little space holds your and his everything.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n\n◆ Show him your affection to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848]Floating Balloons{#i=400113}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Blossoming Bouquets{#i=400112}[-][/c] to show your affection and get [c][C74848]Perfection Points{#i=400111}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400115}[-][/c]. (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Balloon).\n\n*[Perfection Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Perfection Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Thoughtful Giftbox]{#i=400110}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including the Birthday Karma, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Perfection Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n\n◆ Continue to Show Affection to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Show affection[-][/c] for a specific number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\nOn his birthday, send him Longevity Noodles in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92012001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]special commemorative Journal pages{#i=400116}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*You'll be able to make edits to your journal upon obtaining the commemorative journal page. The contents of the page cannot be edited.\n\n*A default-style commemorative Journal page will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing the Longevity Noodles."
  },
  [374] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92012_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.


2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848]Stars Know My Heart{#i=92012002}[-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2{#i=119763}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788{#i=119763}[-][/c].
*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Refer to follow-up announcements to stay updated.
]]
  },
  [375] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92012_4",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Decorate the room for him!\n\n◆ Tap and hold the decors of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the scene[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the decors in the room and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the changes after decoration!"
  },
  [376] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92012_5",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Make a delicious Longevity Noodle for him.\n\n◆ Tap and hold the ingredients of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the Longevity Noodle[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the ingredients on the Longevity Noodle and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the Longevity Noodle you just made!\n\n*The Longevity Noodle you give him will be turned into a commemorative Journal page after his birthday as a souvenir and will not be available for modification."
  },
  [377] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86017",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 5/1 05:00 to 6/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848]◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]Ltd-Time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the[c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-limited [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Blooming Affection, Crystal: Summer Waterpark, Crystal: Moonrise Event, Crystal: Boxed Sweetness, Crystal Summer Fireworks, two free SR Custom Giftboxes, five Outfit Giftboxes, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n6. Players will also be able to obtain [c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftboxes[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Keys[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Keys[-][/c] can be used to open the giftboxes to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Exclusive Avatar Frame[-][/c]. The two keys can be purchased from Evol Supply.\n\n-Crystal: Blooming Affection includes the Blooming Affection event R Karmas: [Victor: Fragrant Feelings], [Lucien: Sweet Melody], [Kiro: Song of the Heart], [Gavin: Night Blossom], [Shaw: Scorching Passion], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Summer Waterpark includes the Summer Waterpark event R Karmas: [Victor: Cooling Whispers], [Lucien: Summer Refreshing], [Kiro: Peach Reverie], [Gavin: Double Sweetness], [Shaw: Summer Style], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Moonrise Event includes the Moonrise event R Karmas: [Victor: Sweet Emotions], [Lucien: Pale Moonbeams], [Kiro: Autumn Mysteries], [Gavin: Fragrant Candles], [Shaw: Moonwatch], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Boxed Sweetness includes the Boxed Sweetness event R Karmas: [Victor: 70% Sweetness], [Lucien: Memory Between Pages], [Kiro: Love Confession], [Gavin: Breeze in Hands], [Shaw: Magic Heart], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Summer Fireworks includes the Summer Fireworks event R Karmas: [Victor: Takoyaki], [Lucien: Red Butterfly], [Kiro: Apple Candy], [Gavin: Smashed Ice], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.     \n\n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n     \n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n-Lucien Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Lucien: Autumn Dark Blue Sweater], [Lucien: Khaki Men's Two-Piece Set], or [Lucien: Black Silk Blend Shirt]. \n\n-Victor Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Victor: Navy Casual Jacket], [Victor: Silver Striped Suit], or [Victor: Plaid Snooker Vest Set]. \n\n-Gavin Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Gavin: Light Gray Casual Suit], [Gavin: Under the Blue Sky Short Set], or [Gavin: Beige Long Trench Coat Set]. \n\n-Kiro Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Kiro: Green Trail Casual Wear], [Kiro: Heartbeat Pink and White Set], or [Kiro: Spring School Uniform].\n\n-Shaw Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Shaw: Night Journey Jacket], [Shaw: Black and White Hooded Set], or [Shaw: Fine Striped Shirt Jacket].\n\n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]Instant Lv. Up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
