  [379] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_68022",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
They've always believed war is what defines us.

[c][C74848][Astral Mystery][-][/c] Rules

1. During the [c][C74848][Astral Mystery][-][/c] event, select the man of your choice and enter the corresponding event page. You can switch to other characters at any given time.

2. Go to the [c][C74848]Astral Vault[-][/c] and spend a certain amount of [c][C74848]Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400147} to fuse into [c][C74848]any one[-][/c] or [c][C74848]all remaining[-][/c] [c][C74848]Luminous Stones[-][/c]{#i=68022} to exchange for the selected character's [c][C74848]event-exclusive Karma Shard[-][/c] or other items.

3. There are a total of 10 fusible [c][C74848]Luminous Stones[-][/c]{#i=68022} in each Astral Vault. Fusing into a [c][C74848]Luminous Stone[-][/c]{#i=68022} will award you with any of the unobtained rewards, each with [c][C74848]equal probability[-][/c].

4. Upon gaining all the [c][C74848]event-exclusive Karma Shards[-][/c] in the current Astral Vault, you can proceed to the next Vault with all rewards reset. There is no limit to the number of Vaults you can explore during the event.

5. Tapping on [c][C74848]Fuse All[-][/c] will attempt to fuse into all the remaining [c][C74848]Luminous Stones[-][/c]{#i=68022} in that Astral Vault. Please note this will not stop when you get all the event-exclusive Karma Shards in that vault.

6. During the event, [c][C74848]Limited-Time Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400148} can be used in place of regular [c][C74848]Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400147}. When fusing into [c][C74848]Luminous Stones[-][/c]{#i=68022}, [c][C74848]Limited-Time Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400148} will be consumed first.

7. [c][C74848]Limited-Time Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400148} can be obtained from [c][C74848]Limited-Time Packs[-][/c], while regular [c][C74848]Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400147} can be acquired through [c][C74848]Limited-Time Packs[-][/c], [c][C74848]purchased with Gems[-][/c], or exchanged from [c][C74848]Redeem with Dream Handbells[-][/c].

8. When the event ends, unspent [c][C74848]Limited-Time Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400148} will be converted into Gold and mailed to you. Regular [c][C74848]Luminous Shards[-][/c]{#i=400147} will be kept for the next event.]]
  },
  [380] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39016",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Your hearts beat in sync, and your hands move as one. You are truly made for each other.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Choose any character you wish to access his menu when first you access the event. Each character has an exclusive holiday souvenir of 9 color-in areas.

2. Clearing Normal or Elite stages during the event nets you [c][C74848]Vibrant Paints{#i=400138}[-][/c] which you can use to [c][C74848]color-in the blank areas[-][/c].

3. When you have enough [c][C74848]Vibrant Paints{#i=400138}[-][/c], tap on an area to fill it with your desired color.

4. During the event, areas that have already been colored in can be replaced with another color without spending [c][C74848]Vibrant Paints{#i=400138}[-][/c] again.

5. Once you have colored-in all the areas for a character, you can tap on [c][C74848]Share[-][/c] to unlock his sweet words.

6. You can share their sweet words on social media. The first share of each character nets you his [c][C74848]Entwined Hearts R Karma[-][/c].

7. You can switch between the characters to share other sweet words and earn rewards. Only the first share of each character grants rewards.

8. You can redeem Vibrant Paints for tons of amazing rewards at the [c][C74848]Imagination Shop[-][/c].\n]]
  },
  [381] = {
    rule_type = "107002",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
