  },
  [382] = {
    rule_type = "68023",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]轮转不休[-][/c]\n\n扑通、扑通……\n心跳淹没无声的倒数，\n翻转的沙漏再次计时，\n急促的呼吸逐渐合一。\n\n[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]\n\n1.点击[c][C74848]记录按钮[-][/c]，消耗[c][C74848]光阴之刻{#i=400171}[-][/c]和[c][C74848]流年之晷{#i=400170}[-][/c]，即可获得[c][C74848]岁月之时{#i=400172}[-][/c]，同时有概率获取随机道具奖励。\n\n2.获得岁月之时{#i=400172}数量至特定档位后，可获得指定[c][C74848]ER自选礼盒[-][/c]以及回忆星锁道具。\n\n3.[c][C74848]光阴之刻{#i=400171}[-][/c]可通过[c][C74848]Evol商城购买[-][/c]获取；[c][C74848]流年之晷{#i=400170}[-][/c]可通过[c][C74848]通关主线关卡[-][/c]获取。"
  },
  [383] = {
    rule_type = "98004",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "限定羁绊复刻票选限时开启。\n\n活动时间：6月5日5:00-6月11日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，通过每日活跃度达指定档位\\n即可获得【拾光车票】，为喜欢的活动进行投票！\n\n2.每进行一次投票，即可获得一份随机道具奖励。\n\n3.活动结束后，获得票数最高的活动将在后续版本中进行复刻。\n\n4.6月12日0:00~6月13日23:59为票选展示期，期间不可进行投票，仅可查看各项票选结果。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的【拾光车票】将自动转换为金币，通过邮件发送至制作人的邮箱中。"
  },
  [384] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92013_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Interlocked pleasant surprises imbue the trivial things of life with joy.\nThat's the trick to make every shared moment extraordinary and unique.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Feeling Seen], preparing the Longevity Noodles and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Follow your Heart's Trail and receive Karmas.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][Blossoming Bouquets]{#i=400192}[-][/c] and [c][C74848][Floating Balloons]{#i=400193}[-][/c] to decorate and garnish in the Heart's Trail, you'll gain [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing balloon).\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848]Memory Items[-][/c], Encounter Wish{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Memories Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Shaw's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Shaw's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Shaw: Feeling Seen][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, Midsummer Points{#i=400191}, and more.\n\n*[c][C74848][Midsummer Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare a Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Feeling Seen], preparing the birthday Longevity Noodles, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Show Affection] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Midsummer Points{#i=400191}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400195}[-][/c].\n\nBirthday Longevity Noodles and decoration materials can be obtained in [c][C74848]Heart's Trail[-][/c].\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n"
  },
  [385] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92013_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "A cocoon of candlelight keeps out the din of the world, leaving only the tender exchange of your gazes.\nEach word is imbued with romance and joy.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Show him your affection to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848]Floating Balloons{#i=400193}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Blossoming Bouquets{#i=400192}[-][/c] to show your Affection and get [c][C74848]Midsummer Points{#i=400191}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400195}[-][/c]. (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Balloon).\n\n*[Midsummer Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Midsummer Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Thoughtful Giftbox]{#i=400190}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including the Birthday Karma, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Midsummer Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue to Show Affection to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Show affection[-][/c] for a specific number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Outfit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\nOn his birthday, send him Longevity Noodles in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92013001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]special commemorative Journal pages{#i=400196}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*You'll be able to make edits to your journal upon obtaining the commemorative journal page. The contents of the page cannot be edited.\n\n*A default-style commemorative Journal page will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing the Longevity Noodles."
  },
  [386] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92013_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.

2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848]A Mint{#i=92013002}[-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2{#i=119763}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788{#i=119763}[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Refer to follow-up announcements to stay updated.]]
  },
  [387] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92013_4",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Decorate the room for him!\n\n◆ Tap and hold the decors of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the scene[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the decors in the room and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the changes after decoration!"
  },
  [388] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92013_5",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Make a delicious Longevity Noodles for him.\n\n◆ Tap and hold the ingredients of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the Longevity Noodles[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the ingredients on the Longevity Noodle and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the Longevity Noodle you just made!\n\n*The Longevity Noodle you give him will be turned into a commemorative Journal page after his birthday as a souvenir and will not be available for modification."
  },
  [389] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86018",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 3/2 05:00 to 4/30 23:59\n\n[c][C74848]◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]Ltd-Time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the[c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-exclusive [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Colorful Comedies, Crystal: Fun at Zoo, Crystal: Between the Lines, Crystal: Heart Whispers, two free SR Custom Giftboxes, five Outfit Giftboxes, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n6. Players will also be able to obtain [c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftboxes[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Keys[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Keys[-][/c] can be used to open the giftboxes to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Exclusive Avatar Frame[-][/c]. The two keys can be purchased from Evol Supply.\n\n-Crystal: Colorful Comedies includes the Colorful Comedies event R Karmas: [Victor: No Escaping], [Lucien: Cute Flowers], [Kiro: Cute Bear], [Gavin: Sound of Wonder], [Shaw: Pixel Style], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Fun at Zoo includes the Fun at Zoo event R Karmas: [Victor: Striped Style], [Lucien: Woolly Warmth], [Kiro: Colorful Image], [Gavin: Spotted Delight], [Shaw: Grey Rhapsody], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Between the Lines includes the Between the Lines event R Karmas: [Victor: Hearts & Tastes], [Lucien: Heart's Promise], [Kiro: Sweet Thoughts], [Gavin: Falling for You], [Shaw: Heart Games], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Heart Whispers includes the Heart Whispers event R Karmas: [Victor: Ameowsing], [Lucien: Meowvelous], [Kiro: Woofderland], [Gavin: Woofulous], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.     \n\n-Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n\n-Each Crystal awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n-Lucien Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Lucien: Autumn Dark Blue Sweater], [Lucien: Khaki Men's Two-Piece Set], or [Lucien: Black Silk Blend Shirt]. \n\n-Victor Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Victor: Navy Casual Jacket], [Victor: Silver Striped Suit], or [Victor: Plaid Snooker Vest Set].\n\n-Gavin Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Gavin: Light Gray Casual Suit], [Gavin: Blue Sky Short Set], or [Gavin: Beige Long Trench Coat Set].\n\n-Kiro Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Kiro: Green Trail Casual Wear], [Kiro: Heartbeat Pink and White Set], or [Kiro: Spring School Uniform].\n\n-Shaw Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Shaw: Night Journey Jacket], [Shaw: Black and White Hooded Set], or [Shaw: Fine Striped Shirt Jacket].\n     \n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]Instant Lv. Up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n  *The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
  },
  [390] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86018_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848][Company Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event-exclusive Company Quests to gain extra Sunlight Points that are unaffected by your weekly limit.

2. Company Quest can only be completed once per week, resetting every Monday at 5 AM.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive to the players with Sunshine Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant you bonus weekly Sunlight Points.]],
    rule_icon = "4"
