1. During the event, head to the Wish Tree and upgrade the specified Karma to complete Sweltering Whisper missions for hefty rewards!

2. You can check the rewards corresponding to each mission on the event page.]]
  },
  [393] = {
    rule_type = "urcard",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]I. About developing UR Karmas[-][/c]\n1. UR Karmas can be Evolved and Advanced. [c][C74848]Evolving[-][/c] will let you gain access to a wide variety of [c][C74848]Karma interactions[-][/c], [c][C74848]Karma card images[-][/c], and [c][C74848]higher Karma bonus[-][/c]. Continuing to [c][C74848]Advance[-][/c] the Karmas will grant you even higher Karma bonus.\n\n2. [c][C74848]Refined Shards[-][/c] can be used to Evolve and Advance UR and SP Karmas in place of the corresponding UR and SP Karma Shards.\n\n[c][C74848]II. Heartfelt Reverie{#i=91} and Lingering Whisper{#i=92}[-][/c]\nEvolving the Karma to tier IV will unlock its corresponding [c][C74848]Heartfelt Reverie{#i=91}[-][/c].\nEvolving the Karma to tier VI will unlock its corresponding [c][C74848]Lingering Whisper{#i=92}[-][/c].\nThe above rewards can be accessed from the Check Rewards menu, or respectively from Mind's Quest and Right Beside You.\n\n[c][C74848]III. UR Card Images and Interactions[-][/c]\nUR Karmas features a Solo Image as well as two Couple Images.\n\n[c][C74848]UR Solo Image Stirring Heartbeat:[-][/c]\n(1) Evolving the Karma to tiers I, II, III, VII, and VIII will each unlock a respective interaction{#i=93}:\n① Tier I unlocks the [Approach] interaction{#i=94}.\n② Tiers II and II both unlock new interaction responses.\n③ Tier VII unlocks a new interaction type.\n④ Tier VIII unlocks another new interaction type.\n(2) Tap the Karma to begin interacting with him.\n\n[c][C74848]Couple Image:[-][/c]\n(1) Upon Evolving the Karma to tier V, you'll unlock the [c][C74848]Live2D Couple Image Ripples of Heart[-][/c] and the special [c][C74848]Swaying Hearts[-][/c] mode.\nWhen unlocked, the image background will shift when you tilt your phone (this requires enabling gyroscope permissions on your device).\n(2) Upon Evolving it to tier VI, you'll unlock the [c][C74848]Live2D Couple Image Lost in Love[-][/c]."
  },
  [394] = {
    rule_type = "113002",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "弹火划破黑夜，侵彻直入长驱。\n\n活动时间：2023/7/4 更新后 - 2023/7/15 23:59\n\n收集[c][C74848]空投补给{#i=400218}[-][/c]与[c][C74848]疾速子弹{#i=400217}[-][/c]，即可[c][C74848]任选角色[-][/c]获取对应的[c][C74848]服装[-][/c]与[c][C74848]羁绊[-][/c]奖励。\n\n空投补给{#i=400218}与疾速子弹{#i=400217}可通过参与[c][C74848]【晴夏之滨】[-][/c]活动，在[c][C74848]环岛集市[-][/c]消耗指定数量的[c][C74848]海屿珍珠[-][/c]兑换获取。\n\n活动结束后 - 2023/7/17 23:59前，依然可以在此页面兑换奖励。\n\n"
  },
  [395] = {
    rule_type = "12400103",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，环岛集市活动商店限时开启，可使用[c][C74848]浅海拾贝[-][/c]兑换活动纪念摆件、贴纸及超值折扣道具。\n\n2.[c][C74848]浅海拾贝[-][/c]可以通过完成小岛蓝图中的任务获得，或由店铺经营获得的[c][C74848]海屿珍珠[-][/c]以10：1比例兑换获得，兑换将在角色海岛升至5级后开放。\n\n3.海岛升至5级后，[c][C74848]海屿珍珠[-][/c]还将开放兑换【Mr. Killer】系列ER兑换道具[c][C74848]疾速子弹*1[-][/c]与服装兑换道具[c][C74848]空投补给*1[-][/c]。以上每种道具限购1次，切换角色无法重复购买。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的浅海拾贝将转化为金币，通过邮件补发。"
  },
  [396] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92014_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "The deepest and most secret wish was finally revealed after a long wait.\nLet love grow wildly with the rising wind.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Beneath Your Wings], preparing the Longevity Noodles and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Follow your Heart's Trail and receive a Karma reward.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848][Blossoming Bouquets]{#i=400284}[-][/c] and [c][C74848][Floating Balloons]{#i=400285}[-][/c] to decorate and garnish in the Heart's Trail, you'll receive Gavin's birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Recorded Memory]{#i=300218} and [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing balloon).\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848]Memory Items[-][/c], Encounter Wish{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Memories Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Gavin's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Gavin's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Beneath Your Wings][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday Commemorative R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, Flight Points{#i=400283}, and more.\n\n*[c][C74848][Flight Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Beneath Your Wings], preparing the birthday Longevity Noodles, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Show Affection] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Flight Points{#i=400283}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400287}[-][/c].\n\nBirthday Longevity Noodles and decoration materials can be obtained in [c][C74848]Heart's Trail[-][/c]."
  },
  [397] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92014_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Every breath and heartbeat will be held close to his heart, along with your smiles and frowns.\nYou're his one-and-only bright moon that shines more brilliantly than any stars in the galaxy.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Show him your affection to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848]Floating Balloons{#i=400285}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Blossoming Bouquets{#i=400284}[-][/c] to show your Affection and get [c][C74848]Flight Points{#i=400283}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Points{#i=400287}[-][/c]. (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Balloon).\n\n*[Flight Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Flight Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Thoughtful Giftboxes]{#i=400282}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including the Birthday Karma, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Flight Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue to Show Affection to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Show affection[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-Limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-Limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\nOn his birthday, send him Longevity Noodle in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92014001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]special commemorative Journal Page{#i=400288}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*You'll be able to make edits to your journal upon obtaining the commemorative journal page. The contents of the page cannot be edited.\n\n*A default-style commemorative Journal page will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing the Longevity Noodles."
  },
  [398] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92014_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.

2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848]Aligned Bodies{#i=92014002}[-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2{#i=119763}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788{#i=119763}[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Refer to follow-up announcements to stay updated.]]
  },
  [399] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92014_4",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Decorate the room for him!\n\n◆ Tap and hold the decors of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the scene[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the decors in the room and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the changes after decoration!"
  },
  [400] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92014_5",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Make a delicious Longevity Noodle for him.\n\n◆ Tap and hold the ingredients of your choice and [c][C74848]drag them onto the Longevity Noodle[-][/c].\n\n◆ Tap on the ingredients on the Longevity Noodle and drag them [c][C74848]to a blank space to remove them[-][/c].\n\n◆ Remember to save the Longevity Noodle you just made!\n\n*The Longevity Noodle you give him will be turned into a commemorative Journal page after his birthday as a souvenir and will not be available for modification."
  },
  [401] = {
    rule_type = "ZQLVlog33021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
A promised reunion. He remembers each one of your words to heart.
Event Period: 2026/01/28 05:00 - 2026/02/23 23:59

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Spend the time away from Kiro's company by completing each other's small tasks!

-After completing an event, you will unlock that event's [c][C74848]Diary[-][/c] to keep track of the happenings while you are apart.

-Completing the event will award [c][C74848]Progress[-][/c]. Reach 12 Progress to claim the [c][C74848]SSR Karma [Kiro: Closer Than Close][-][/c]!

-During the event, in addition to his own work, he'll also take care of the little tasks you've left for him.

2. Tap on the [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] button to begin completing a new event to be recorded in the Diary.

-You get 1 [c][C74848]Move[-][/c] every day, resetting at 5 AM of the next day. Moves don't accumulate. You will not get any more moves once all events are complete.

3. Tapping on [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] will let you complete an event you have already completed.
-You get 6 free [c][C74848]Move Again[-][/c] chances per day that refresh each day at 5 AM and do not accumulate to the next day. These can also be purchased with Gems without limit.

4. You can use the [c][C74848]Quick Move[-][/c] feature to quickly use all the Move Again chances and gain points.

5. Using Moves will award [c][C74848]Caring Pts[-][/c]. Reaching Caring Pts milestones will unlock [c][C74848]item rewards[-][/c].

-Each [Move] awards 10 Caring Pts. Each [Move Again] awards 5 Caring Pts.]]
  },
  [402] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86019",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent period: 7/1 05:00 to 8/29 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules:[-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, after completing the Daily Quests, you get 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every 1 Activeness you receive. You can receive up to [c][C74848]1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c] from Daily Quests, resetting each Monday at 5 AM. 1 level is gained for every 100 Sunlight Points.\n\n2. Leveling up will award you a corresponding [c][C74848]basic reward[-][/c]. After purchasing the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you will also be awarded an extra [c][C74848]privilege reward[-][/c] for that level.\n\n3. Sunshine Privilege has two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. Purchasing one will lock you out of the other, whose rewards cannot be obtained even by purchasing. To ensure all Producers receive the same reward in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege will not be counted toward any [c][C74848]Ltd-Time cumulative top-up[-][/c] events. Any top-up in the[c][C74848]long-term cumulative top-up events[-][/c] will be counted as usual.\n\n4. Players will also be able to obtain extra Sunlight Points by completing the [c][C74848]event-exclusive [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete these limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. Some level rewards will contain [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Sunlight Tokens can be redeemed at the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] for [c][C74848]Crystal: Sugary Scent, Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Holly & Jolly, Crystal: Carefree Summer, Crystal: Hallowed Mirror, two free SR Custom Giftboxes, five Outfit Custom Giftboxes, progression materials,[-][/c] and other fabulous rewards.\n\n6. Players will also be able to obtain [c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftboxes[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Keys[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Keys[-][/c] can be used to open the giftboxes to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Exclusive Avatar Frame[-][/c]. The two keys can be purchased from Evol Supply.\n\n- Crystal: Sugary Scent includes the Sugary Scent event R Karmas: [Victor: True to Words], [Lucien: You Are Mine], [Kiro: Falling Flowers], [Gavin: Connected Hearts], [Shaw: Dessert Night], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Holly & Jolly includes the Holly & Jolly event R Karmas: [Victor: Warm Light], [Lucien: Mail Dream], [Kiro: Cute Chef], [Gavin: Star Wish Delivery], [Shaw: Tailor-made], Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Carefree Summer includes the Carefree Summer event R Karmas: [Victor: Summer Sweetness], [Lucien: Whisper of the Sea], [Kiro: Icecream Wonder], [Gavin: Summer Breeze], [Shaw: Water Fight], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n- Crystal: Hallowed Mirror includes the Hallowed Mirror event R Karmas: [Victor: Tea Observor], [Lucien: Meet Cute], [Kiro: I'm Already Taken], [Gavin: For Your Hunger Only], Gold x20000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.     \n\n- Crystal: Avatar Frame includes 7 rerunning avatar frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n\n- Each Crystal Awakening will drop one Star Shard and one of the above-mentioned rewards at random. Players will not receive duplicate avatar frames/Karmas, but the overall drop rate will not change until all the avatar frames/Karmas are acquired.\n\n- Lucien Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Lucien: Autumn Dark Blue Sweater], [Lucien: Khaki Men's Two-Piece Set], or [Lucien: Black Silk Blend Shirt]. \n\n- Victor Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Victor: Navy Casual Jacket], [Victor: Silver Striped Suit], or [Victor: Plaid Snooker Vest Set]. \n\n- Gavin Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Gavin: Light Gray Casual Suit], [Gavin: Under the Blue Sky Short Set], or [Gavin: Beige Long Trench Coat Set]. \n\n- Kiro Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Kiro: Green Trail Casual Wear], [Kiro: Heartbeat Pink and White Set], or [Kiro: Spring School Uniform].\n\n- Shaw Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following: [Shaw: Night Journey Jacket], [Shaw: Black and White Hooded Set], or [Shaw: Fine Striped Shirt Jacket].\n     \n*Sunlight Tokens will be removed after the event ends and cannot be used in subsequent events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. 30 days after the event begins, you'll gain the ability to [c][C74848]Instantly Lv. Up[-][/c], through which you'll be able to spend Gems to quickly level up.\n*The Gems cost will be directly proportionate to the amount of required Sunlight Points. Gems will be spent based on the least number of Sunlight Points required to level up."
  },
  [403] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86019_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848][Company Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event-exclusive Company Quests to gain extra Sunlight Points that are unaffected by your weekly limit.

2. Company Quest can only be completed once per week, resetting every Monday at 5 AM.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive to the players with Sunshine Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant you bonus weekly Sunlight Points.]]
  },
  [404] = {
    rule_type = "98005",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "限定羁绊复刻票选限时开启。\n\n活动时间：9月7日5:00-9月13日23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1. 活动期间，通过每日活跃度达指定档位\\n即可获得【拾光车票】，为喜欢的活动进行投票！\n\n2.每进行一次投票，即可获得一份随机道具奖励。\n\n3.活动结束后，获得票数最高的活动将在后续版本中进行复刻。\n\n4.9月14日0:00~9月15日23:59为票选展示期，期间不可进行投票，仅可查看各项票选结果。\n\n*活动结束后，未使用的【拾光车票】将自动转换为金币，通过邮件发送至制作人的邮箱中。"
  },
  [405] = {
    rule_type = "MainlineCards_82003",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
