  [408] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92015_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Fireworks blaze across the sky, casting a radiant glow on your entwined steps.\nFrom yesterday to tomorrow, though seasons shift and skies may weep, our clasped hands hold a bond so deep.\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Pristine World], preparing the Longevity Noodles, and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Follow your Heart's Trail and receive a Karma reward.\n1. After using the [c][C74848][Blossoming Bouquets]{#i=400359}[-][/c] and [c][C74848][Floating Balloons]{#i=400360}[-][/c] to decorate and garnish in the Heart's Trail, you'll receive Lucien's birthday exclusive Mini House Gift [Einstein Ornament]{#i=300219} and [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing balloon).\n\n2. You will also randomly get [c][C74848]Memory Items[-][/c], Encounter Wish{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Memories Items can be used to unlock [c][C74848]Memories for Lucien's previous birthdays[-][/c].\n\n4. Unlocking 6 Memories will grant you Lucien's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Pristine World][-][/c].\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Preparation Progress[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday Commemorative R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, Joy Points{#i=400358}, and more.\n\n*[c][C74848][Joy Points][-][/c] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare a surprise to celebrate his birthday.\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Pristine World], preparing the birthday Longevity Noodles, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Show Affection] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Joy Points{#i=400358}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Pts{#i=400362}[-][/c].\n\nBirthday Longevity Noodles and decoration materials can be obtained in [c][C74848]Heart's Trail[-][/c].\n\n\n\n"
  },
  [409] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92015_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "In every pause, in every glance back, he knows—there is no need to hurry, for his journey with you will always be timeless.\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Show him your affection to unlock multiple rewards.\n1. Use [c][C74848]Floating Balloons{#i=400360}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Blossoming Bouquets{#i=400359}[-][/c] to show your Affection and get [c][C74848]Joy Points{#i=400358}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Loving Points{#i=400362}[-][/c]. (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Balloon).\n\n*[Joy Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Joy Points, you will also receive [c][C74848][Thoughtful Giftbox]{#i=400357}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including previous Birthday Karmas, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Joy Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue to Show Affection to obtain personal rewards.\n[c][C74848]Show affection[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\nOn his birthday, send him Longevity Noodles in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92015001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]special commemorative Journal pages{#i=400363}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*You'll be able to make edits to your journal upon obtaining the commemorative journal page. The special content cannot be edited.\n\n*A default-style commemorative Journal page will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing the Longevity Noodles.\n"
  },
  [410] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92015_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.

2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848]Beautiful Life{#i=92015002}[-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][C74848]Memory Starburst*2[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][C74848]Time Coupon*788[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Refer to follow-up announcements to stay updated.
]]
  },
