  [413] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39018",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Within the mist-kissed warmth, savor the intimate moments shared only between you and him.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Choose any character you wish to access his menu when you first access the event. Each character has 9 color-in areas that together form his exclusive hot spring accessory.

2. Clearing Normal or Elite stages during the event nets you [c][C74848]Water-Based Paints{#i=400338}[-][/c] which you can use to [c][C74848]color-in the blank areas[-][/c].

3. When you have enough [c][C74848]Water-Based Paints{#i=400338}[-][/c], tap on an area to fill it with your desired color.

4. During the event, areas that have already been colored in can be replaced with another color without spending [c][C74848]Water-Based Paints{#i=400338}[-][/c].

5. Once you have colored-in all the areas for a character, you can tap on [c][C74848]Share[-][/c] to unlock his Secret Sweet Words.

6. You can share their sweet words to social media (the first share per character nets you an [c][C74848]R Karma from the Bubbling Passion series[-][/c].

7. You can switch between the characters to share more sweet words and earn rewards. Secret Sweet Words and their associated rewards can be individually shared/claimed once.

8. You can redeem Water-Based Paint for tons of amazing rewards at the [c][C74848]Hot Spring Shop[-][/c].\n

]]
  },
  [414] = {
    rule_type = "MainlinePresaleRule_40012",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
