  *[c][C74848]Unfurled Tomorrow[-][/c] can be used together with [c][C74848]Destiny's Threads[-][/c] inside the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] to obtain all-new Season 2 main story SSR Karmas.
  *[c][C74848]Destiny's Threads[-][/c] can be obtained by clearing [c][C74848]main story stages[-][/c] during the event, or obtained from the [c][C74848]Anniversary Events[-][/c].

3. When the total number of Pre-purchase Packs bought reaches the specified milestone (48,000), a [c][C74848]server-wide discount[-][/c] will be unlocked for the [c][C74848]Memory Corridor[-][/c] event:
  Reach 25% - Server-wide 5% discount;
