  [416] = {
    rule_type = "69006",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "将春夏秋冬的美好收藏，为他放映一场珍贵的影片。\n\n[c][C74848]活动玩法：[-][/c]\n\n1.选择他后，点击[c][C74848]视频封面[-][/c]可以进入编辑器进行视频制作。在活动期间内可以随时修改视频内容。\n\n2.完成编辑后，点击[c][C74848]渲染成片[-][/c]来导出制作的视频。\n\n\n[c][C74848]分享回忆：[-][/c]\n\n1.完成视频渲染后，可以对你们的回忆进行分享。\n\n2.分享内容由视频制作中所涉及的内容生成，根据你和他共度的回忆可能会有所不同。\n\n\n[c][C74848]注意事项：[-][/c]\n\n为保证视频录制和播放顺利，请注意保持游戏资源完整。\n\n视频中的回忆数据统计至2023年12月5日5:00。"
  },
  [417] = {
    rule_type = "110003",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "旅行前夕，也别忘了准备好必备用品哦~\n\n活动时间：\n2023/12/5 更新后 - 2023/12/24 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.出行准备\n在出发前和他一起准备这次旅行需要的物品吧！12月5日活动开始后，每天将解锁两个新的必需品，完成准备后可以获得相应的材料奖励。\n需要的物品可以在主线关卡中获得，完成准备不会消耗背包中的道具。\n\n2.出发有礼\n完成所有的必需品准备后，即可获得5个贴贴玩偶。可爱的贴贴玩偶陪伴你每一天，不止是旅途。\n\n3.完成所有道具准备并领取贴贴玩偶，即可在后续活动开启后前往和他周年旅行~"
  },
  [418] = {
    rule_type = "YearCard2023",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "[c][C74848]规则说明：[-][/c]\n1. 2023年12月8日更新后~2023年12月24日23:59，三款周年馈礼商品限时发售，可同时购买。\n\n2.花费[c][C74848]钻石*500[-][/c]购买钻石档位周年馈礼后，可立即获得[c][C74848]钻石*500[-][/c]。\n\n2023年12月25日5:00起，每周可随机抽取[c][C74848]50-150钻石[-][/c]，每个周期为28天，周期内领取满四次周随机奖励，还可额外获得[c][C74848]钻石*50[-][/c]的周期奖励一份。\n\n*年卡生效后，玩家可点击奖励预览icon查看周期奖励领取情况。\n\n3.花费[c][C74848]98元[-][/c]购买98元档位周年馈礼后，可立即获得[c][C74848]钻石*980[-][/c]。\n\n2023年12月25日5:00起，每周可随机抽取[c][C74848]150-300钻石[-][/c]，每个周期为28天，周期内领取满四次周随机奖励，还可额外获得[c][C74848]限定背景及凝光碎片*5[-][/c]的周期奖励一份。\n\n*当年卡处于购买期时，玩家可以点击周期奖励处的放大镜icon查看周期奖励；年卡生效后，玩家可点击奖励预览icon查看周期奖励领取情况。\n\n4.花费[c][C74848]128元[-][/c]购买128元档位周年馈礼后，可立即获得[c][C74848]钻石*1280[-][/c]。\n\n[c][C74848]该档位年卡有效期为180天，玩家在购买期间限购两次，时长可叠加[-][/c]。\n\n2023年12月25日5:00起，每天可领取并开启一次随机礼盒，该礼盒每[c][C74848]7[-][/c]天内至少会开出一次星河许愿券。\n\n*累计开启[c][C74848]30[-][/c]次随机礼盒可额外获得[c][C74848]星河许愿券*2[-][/c]。\n\n5.128档位的周年馈礼内可开出的随机奖励有：\n    [c][C74848]体力*30[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]城市暴走卡*25[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]羁绊诺言*1[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]溯时沙漏*1[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]精英关卡重置券*3[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]钻石*30[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]心绪之花*1[-][/c]；\n    [c][C74848]星河许愿券*1[-][/c]。\n\n6.钻石档位和98档位的周年馈礼每周随机钻石的领取时间持续至2024年12月22日23:59，共计52周、13个周期；每个周期结束后，未领取的周期奖励将会通过邮件发放。\n\n7.128档位的周年馈礼生效时间结束后，未领取的额外奖励将通过邮件发放，多次未领取的额外奖励可累积。"
  },
  [419] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "※Each ray of the sun carries the mesmerizing scent of him.※\n\nEvent Duration: 01/01 05:00 - 03/01 23:59\n\n[c][C74848] ◆Rules: [-][/c]\n\n1. During the event, you'll earn 1 [c][C74848]Sunlight Point[-][/c] for every point of Activeness you gain by completing daily quests. You can earn [c][C74848]a maximum of 1,000 Sunlight Points per week[-][/c], which resets every Monday at 05:00. For every 100 Sunlight Points you collect, you'll level up by 1.\n\n2. When you level up, you can claim the [c][C74848]Basic Rewards[-][/c] for that level. If you purchase the [c][C74848]Sunshine Privilege[-][/c], you'll also be eligible for exclusive [c][C74848]Privilege Rewards[-][/c] at each level.\n\n3. The Sunshine Privilege is available in two tiers: $6.99 and $12.99. You can only purchase one tier at a time, and once you buy one, the other tier and its rewards will no longer be available. To ensure consistent benefits for all producers participating in the Fragrant Sunshine event, Sunshine Privilege purchases will not count toward any [c][C74848]Limited-Time Cumulative Top-up[-][/c] events. However, they will still contribute to [c][C74848]Long-term Top-up events[-][/c] as usual.\n\n4. You can earn additional Sunlight Points each week by completing the [c][C74848]Event-exclusive [Company Quests][-][/c]. Each Company Quest can only be completed once and resets every Monday at 5 AM. Players with Sunshine Privilege can complete limited quests for extra Sunlight Points.\n\n5. At certain levels, you'll earn [c][C74848]Sunlight Tokens[-][/c]. Spend these tokens in the [c][C74848]Sunshine Shop[-][/c] to redeem fantastic prizes, including: [c][C74848]Crystal: Avatar Frame, Crystal: Summer Waterpark, Crystal: Morning Dream, Crystal: Blooming Affection, Crystal: Moonrise Event, Crystal: Boxed Sweetness, Crystal: Summer Fireworks, two free SR Custom Giftboxes, five Outfit Giftboxes, and development materials[-][/c].\n\n6. You will also be able to obtain [c][C74848]Seasonal Memorial Giftboxes[-][/c] upon reaching Lv. 62. [c][C74848]Silvery Wing Keys[-][/c] or [c][C74848]Golden Glass Keys[-][/c] can be used to open the giftboxes to obtain corresponding rewards, including the rerunning [c][C74848]Fragrant Sunshine ER Karma, Go See Him Background and Limited Avatar Frame[-][/c]. Both keys are available for purchase in the Evol Supply.\n\n-Crystal: Summer Waterpark: Contains R Karma from the Summer Waterpark event: [Victor: Cooling Whispers], [Lucien: Summer Refreshing], [Kiro: Peach Reverie], [Gavin: Sweet Duet], [Shaw: Summer Style], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Morning Dream: Contains R Karma from the Morning Dream event: [Victor: Nightly Affection], [Lucien: Ltd-Ed Fairy Tale], [Kiro: Perfect Dream], [Gavin: Lingering Aroma], [Shaw: Sleepless Night], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Blooming Affection: Contains R Karma from the Blooming Affection event: [Victor: Fragrant Feelings], [Lucien: Sweet Melody], [Kiro: Song of the Heart], [Gavin: Night Blossom], [Shaw: Scorching Passion], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Moonrise Event: Contains R Karma from the Moonrise Event: [Victor: Sweet Emotions], [Lucien: Pale Moonbeams], [Kiro: Autumn Mysteries], [Gavin: Fragrant Candles], [Shaw: Moonwatch], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.\n\n-Crystal: Boxed Sweetness: Contains R Karma from the Boxed Sweetness event: [Victor: 70% Sweetness], [Lucien: Memory Between Pages], [Kiro: Love Confession], [Gavin: Breeze in Hands], [Shaw: Magic Heart], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.     \n\n-Crystal: Summer Fireworks: Contains R Karma from the Summer Fireworks event: [Victor: Takoyaki], [Lucien: Red Butterfly], [Kiro: Apple Candy], [Gavin: Smashed Ice], plus Gold x20,000, Stamina x150, and Confess Wish x5.         \n\n-Crystal: Avatar Frame: Contains a collection of seven rerun Avatar Frames: [Loveland in Winter], [Azure Dream], [Wondrous Moment], [Voice of Spring], [Midsummer Star], [Getting Lucky], [Light of Dawn], plus Gold x10,000, Stamina x100, and Confess Wish x3. \n\n-Every time you activate an event Crystal, you're guaranteed to receive one Star Shard and will randomly receive an item from the corresponding reward pool listed above. You won't receive duplicate Avatar Frames or Karma that you already own. However, the overall probability of obtaining any Avatar Frame or Karma remains unchanged until you have collected the entire set.\n\n-Lucien's Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following outfits: [Lucien: Autumn Dark Blue Sweater], [Lucien: Khaki Men's Two-Piece Set], [Lucien: Black Silk Blend Shirt]. \n\n-Victor's Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following outfits: [Victor: Navy Casual Jacket], [Victor: Silver Striped Suit], [Victor: Plaid Snooker Vest Set]. \n\n-Gavin's Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following outfits: [Gavin: Light Gray Casual Suit], [Gavin: Blue Sky Short Set], [Gavin: Beige Long Trench Coat Set]. \n\n-Kiro's Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following outfits: [Kiro: Green Trail Casual Wear], [Kiro: Heartbeat Pink and White Set], [Kiro: Spring School Uniform].\n\n-Shaw's Outfit Giftbox: Choose one of the following outfits: [Shaw: Night Journey Jacket], [Shaw: Black and White Hooded Set], [Shaw: Fine Striped Shirt Jacket].\n     \nPlease note: Sunlight Tokens will expire at the end of this event and cannot be carried over to future events. Please use them in a timely manner.\n\n6. The [c][C74848]Instant Lv. Up[-][/c] feature will be available 30 days after the event starts. Once it's unlocked, players can level up instantly by spending gems.\nPlease note: The gem cost for this upgrade is based on the standard rate for Sunlight Points. Players will only pay the exact amount of gems needed to reach their desired level."
  },
  [420] = {
    rule_type = "newBattlepass_86021_rule",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848][Company Quest] Rules:[-][/c]

1. Complete the event-exclusive [Company Quests] to earn extra Sunlight Points that are unaffected by your weekly limit.

2. Company Quest can only be completed once per week, resetting every Monday at 5 AM.

3. [Weekly Login Gift] is exclusive to players with Sunshine Privilege. Buying the Privilege will grant you bonus weekly Sunlight Points.]]
  },
  [421] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39019",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "瑞龙迎新春，佳景共年年。\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.首次开启活动时，可选择任意一名角色，进入他的活动界面；每个角色的界面中有9个食盒\n\n2.活动期间，通关任意普通或精英关卡，均可获得[c][C74848]龙饽饽[-][/c]{#i=400444}\n\n3.点击尚未打开过的食盒或者[c][C74848]一键打开食盒[-][/c]，即可消耗一定数量的龙饽饽{#i=400444}打开食盒\n\n4.打开同一角色的9个食盒后，点击[c][C74848]“拆开”[-][/c]，就能看到他给你的新年寄语\n\n5.新年寄语可分享到社交平台，首次分享这名角色的新年寄语，可领取一个[c][C74848]山楂酥[-][/c]{#i=400445}；山楂酥{#i=400445}可在[c][C74848]福龙年货[-][/c]中兑换[c][C74848]瑞龙迎春系列R羁绊[-][/c]\n\n6.活动期间，可以更换选择的角色；分享不同角色的寄语，可领取多次分享奖励；每位角色只能分享领取一次\n\n7.龙饽饽{#i=400444}还可以在[c][C74848]福龙年货[-][/c]中兑换其他丰厚奖励\\n\\n\\n"
  },
  [422] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92016_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Between our breaths, our gazes intertwine; beneath the soft glow of the lights, love reflects in the depths of our eyes.\nWhat makes today truly special is the tapestry of memories we share.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Time for Love], preparing the gifts, and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Obtain Karma in each other's loving whispers.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848]Party Hats{#i=400452}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Wish Decoration{#i=400453}[-][/c] to Assemble or Bond in Loving Whisper, you'll receive Victor's birthday exclusive Mini House Gift, [c][C74848]Kissing Bell{#i=300228}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n2. After Assembling or Bonding in Loving Whisper, you'll also randomly receive one of the following rewards: [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c], [c][C74848]background decor[-][/c] or Encounter Wishes{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Radiant Props can be used to unlock Victor's [c][C74848]Childhood Dream Theater[-][/c].\n\n4. Obtaining all [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] will grant you Victor's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Victor: Time for Love][-][/c].\n\n◆ Combine Props and enjoy the mini plays.\n\nHead to the Dream Theater and use the obtained [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] to combine. Some specific combinations will unlock plays in his Childhood Dream Theater.\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday Commemorative R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, and [c][C74848]Confession Points{#i=400451}[-][/c].\n\n*[c][C74848][Confession Points][-][/c] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprises to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Time for Love], preparing the birthday standee, and decorating the room for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Joining Hearts] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Confession Points{#i=400451}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400455}[-][/c] from Joining Hearts with him.\n\n"
  },
  [423] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92016_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "On this day, your heart holds but one desire: all his dreams will take flight.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Join your hearts to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Wish Decoration]{#i=400453}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Party Hats{#i=400452}[-][/c] to join your hearts and get [c][C74848]Confession Points{#i=400451}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400455}[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n*[Confession Points] will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Confession Points, you will also receive [c][C74848]Lover's Glow Fireworks{#i=400450}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including previous Birthday Karmas, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Confession Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue joining your hearts together to obtain cumulative personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Join Hearts[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\n*On his birthday, send him a handmade standee in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92016001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal Ornament: Birthday Standee{#i=400459}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*A default-style commemorative standee ornament will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing a standee when rewatching the birthday celebration plot after the event concludes.\n"
  },
  [424] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92016_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.

