    rule_desc = [[
There's no prank you can pull that can hide your feelings for him.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Choose any character you wish to access his menu when you first access the event. Each character has 9 color-in areas that together form a Whimsical Intentions pattern.

2. Clearing Normal or Elite stages during the event nets you [c][C74848]Cheering Clappers{#i=400485}[-][/c], which you can use to [c][C74848]color-in the blank areas[-][/c].

3. When you have enough [c][C74848]Cheering Clappers{#i=400485}[-][/c], tap on an area to fill it with your desired color.

4. During the event, areas that have already been colored in can be replaced with another color without spending [c][C74848]Cheering Clappers{#i=400485}[-][/c].

5. Once you have colored-in all the areas for a character, you can tap on [c][C74848]Share[-][/c] to unlock his sweet words.

6. You can share his sweet words to social media (the first share per character nets you a [c][C74848]Whimsical Intentions R Karma[-][/c].

7. You can switch between the characters to share and earn rewards. Secret Sweet Words and their associated rewards can be individually shared/claimed once.

8. You can redeem Cheering Clappers for tons of amazing rewards at the [c][C74848]Jovial Variety Store[-][/c].\n

]]
