  [445] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92017_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "The sunset spills its golden glow, letting your love quietly bloom. Fingers entwined, their warmth whispering unspoken feelings between two hearts.\nThe world seems to pause as you hold each other close, distilling all that is beautiful into this fleeting, perfect moment.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Hero's Song], preparing the gifts, and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Obtain Karma in each other's loving whispers.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848]Party Hat{#i=400494}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Wish Decoration{#i=400495}[-][/c] to Assemble or Bond in Loving Whisper, you'll receive Kiro's birthday exclusive Mini House Gifts, [c][C74848]Sunlight Stereo{#i=300229}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n2. After Assembling or Bonding in Loving Whisper, you'll also randomly receive one of the following rewards: [c][C74848]Radiant Prop[-][/c], [c][C74848]background decor[-][/c], Encounter Wishes{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Radiant Props can be used to unlock Kiro's [c][C74848]Childhood Dream Theater[-][/c].\n\n4. Obtaining all [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] will grant you Kiro's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Kiro: Hero's Song][-][/c].\n\n◆ Combine props and enjoy the show.\n\nHead to the Dream Theater and use the obtained [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] to combine and match. Some specific combinations will unlock plays in his Childhood Dream Theater.\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday Commemorative R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, and [c][C74848]Deep Sky Points{#i=400493}[-][/c].\n\n*[c][C74848][Deep Sky Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Hero's Song], preparing the birthday standee, and decorating the stage for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Joining Hearts] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards including [c][C74848]Deep Sky Points{#i=400493}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400497}[-][/c].\n\n"
  },
  [446] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92017_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "On this special day, only you can transform every cherished instant into something profoundly meaningful.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Join your hearts to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Wish Decoration]{#i=400495}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Party Hats{#i=400494}[-][/c] to join your hearts and get [c][C74848]Deep Sky Points{#i=400493}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400497}[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n*Deep Sky Points will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Deep Sky Points, you will also receive [c][C74848]Lover's Glow Fireworks{#i=400492}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including previous Birthday Karmas, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Deep Sky Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue joining your hearts together to obtain cumulative personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Join Hearts[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\n*On his birthday, send him a handmade standee in your carefully-arranged room to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92017001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal Ornament: Birthday Standee{#i=400499}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*A default-style commemorative standee ornament will be available for Producers who have obtained the Karma without preparing a standee when rewatching the birthday celebration plot after the event concludes.\n"
  },
  [447] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92017_3",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Ranking Rules:[-][/c]

1. Ranking rewards will be awarded based on players' Personal Scores.

*Rewards will be sent by mail within 1-2 working days after the event.

2. The top 100 producers will also receive a limited title [c][C74848]Heroic Ode{#i=92017002}[-][/c]. If the Server Score goal is reached after the event, the top 3 Producers will also receive [c][CE9198]Memory Starburst*2[-][/c] and [c][CE9198]Time Coupon*788[-][/c]. The top 4-50 Producers will receive [c][CE9198]Time Coupon*788[-][/c].

*The limited title will be sent by mail within 3 working days after the event. Don't miss out.]]
  },
