  [453] = {
    rule_type = "62015",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
[c][C74848]Romantic Exclusivity[-][/c] Rules

1. During the event, tap on Scrape to use [c][C74848]Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054}[-][/c] and receive rewards. Tap [Check Rewards] to view all possible rewards.

2. Using Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054} has a chance to award a random R-quality Loving Imagination Karma.

After using [c][C74848]35[-][/c] Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054} without receiving a Karma, the [c][C74848]next one[-][/c] used is [c][C74848]guaranteed[-][/c] to award an [c][C74848]unowned[-][/c] Karma.

If you've obtained a Karma before the 36th attempt, the count will be [c][C74848]reset[-][/c].

3. Tap on the plus icon beside the Mini Palette Knife{#i=200054} to learn more about ways of obtaining:

-[c][C74848]Daily Quests[-][/c]: Completing daily quests will award you with Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054} when claiming the Active Reward.

-[c][C74848]Stage Drops[-][/c]: Clearing or Sweeping Normal or Elite stages has a chance to drop Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054}, up to 20 times through Stamina per day.

-[c][C74848]Evol Supply[-][/c]: You can purchase up to 10 Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054} per day with Gold.

4. [c][C74848]Colored Balls{#i=111189}[-][/c] obtained by using Mini Palette Knives{#i=200054} can be used to trade for items inside the [Prize Exchange].]]
  },
  [454] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39021",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
The best playmate, the love of a lifetime.

[c][C74848]Rules:[-][/c]

1. Choose any character you wish to access his menu when you first access the event. Each character has 9 color-in areas that together form his exclusive play time must-have.

2. Clearing Normal or Elite stages during the event nets you [c][C74848]Dream Blocks{#i=400549}[-][/c], which you can use to [c][C74848]color-in the blank areas[-][/c].

3. When you have enough [c][C74848]Dream Blocks{#i=400549}[-][/c], tap on an area to fill it with your desired color.

4. During the event, areas that have already been colored in can be replaced with another color without spending [c][C74848]Dream Blocks{#i=400549}[-][/c].

5. Once you have colored-in all the areas for a character, you can tap on [c][C74848]Share[-][/c] to unlock his Innocent Whisper.

6. You can share Innocent Whisper to social media (the first share per character nets you an [c][C74848]R Karma from the Play Time for Two series[-][/c]).

7. You can switch between the characters to share more Innocent Whispers and earn rewards. The sharing reward for each character can only be claimed once.

8. You can redeem [c][C74848]Dream Blocks{#i=400549}[-][/c] for tons of amazing rewards at the [c][C74848]Lil' Corner Shop[-][/c].\n

]]
  },
  [455] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92018_1",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "Gazes intertwine, heartbeats run wild; love ignites like lightning from the skies.\nNo matter how treacherous this road is, he will always be there for you.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Hero in the Making], preparing the gifts, and decorating the room for him, you may join the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Obtain Karma in each other's loving whispers.\n\n1. After using the [c][C74848]Party Hats{#i=400531}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Wish Decoration{#i=400532}[-][/c] to combine or connect in Loving Whisper, you'll receive [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n2. After combining or connecting in Loving Whisper, you'll also randomly receive one of the following rewards: [c][C74848]Radiant Prop[-][/c], [c][C74848]background decor[-][/c], Encounter Wishes{#i=120001}, Gold{#i=1}, or Stamina{#i=41}.\n\n3. Radiant Props can be used to unlock Shaw's [c][C74848]Childhood Dream Theater[-][/c].\n\n4. Obtaining all [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] will grant you Shaw's [c][C74848]special birthday Karma [Shaw: Hero in the Making][-][/c].\n\n◆ Combine props and enjoy the show.\n\nHead to the Dream Theater and use the obtained [c][C74848]Radiant Props[-][/c] to combine and match. Some specific combinations will unlock plays in his Childhood Dream Theater.\n\n◆ Accumulate preparations to unlock multiple rewards.\n\nAccumulate [c][C74848]Surprise Preparation[-][/c] for a certain amount to get personal progress rewards, including [c][C74848]birthday Commemorative R Karmas[-][/c], Stamina{#i=41}, and [c][C74848]Unbridled Points{#i=400530}[-][/c].\n\n*[c][C74848][Unbridled Points][-][/c] will be counted towards Personal Ranking Scores and will be automatically converted into the corresponding number of Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Prepare Surprise to celebrate his birthday.\n\nAfter getting the Birthday Karma [Hero in the Making], preparing the birthday standee, and decorating the stage for him, you will enter the [c][C74848][Joining Hearts] stage[-][/c]. Tap the arrow on the right side of the screen to face him and let him know your affection. You will receive multiple rewards, including [c][C74848]Unbridled Points{#i=400530}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400534}[-][/c].\n\n"
  },
  [456] = {
    rule_type = "Birth92018_2",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = "On this very special day, weave a dream of splendor that takes him to the heavens above.\n\nJoin the event [c][C74848]on his birthday[-][/c] to unlock exclusive birthday wishes. He chooses you to spend this special day with.\n\n◆ Join your hearts to unlock multiple rewards.\n\n1. Use [c][C74848][Wish Decoration]{#i=400532}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Party Hats{#i=400531}[-][/c] to join your hearts and get [c][C74848]Unbridled Points{#i=400530}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Adoration Points{#i=400534}[-][/c] (20 Gems can be used in place of each missing Wish Decoration).\n\n*Unbridled Points will be counted toward Personal Ranking Scores.\n\n2. In addition to Unbridled Points, you will also receive [c][C74848]Lover's Glow Fireworks{#i=400529}[-][/c], which can be redeemed in the shop for various rewards, including previous Birthday Karmas, Outfits, Right Beside You, and various reward items.\n\n*[c][C74848][Unbridled Points][-][/c] will be automatically converted into the corresponding Server Scores when obtained.\n\n◆ Continue joining your hearts together to obtain personal rewards.\n\n[c][C74848]Join Hearts[-][/c] for a certain number of times to earn rewards, including [c][C74848][Birthday Suit], [Birthday-limited Title Frame], and [Birthday-limited Avatar Frame][-][/c].\n\n◆ Celebrate his birthday and get limited items.\n\nOn his birthday, send him a handmade standee in your carefully-arranged scene to get [c][C74848]Birthday-Limited Live2D Background{#i=92018001}[-][/c] and [c][C74848]Journal Ornament: Birthday Standee{#i=400536}[-][/c] to preserve this moment forever.\n\n*For Producers who have obtained the Karma without making a standee, a default-style standee ornament will be granted when rewatching the birthday celebration plot after the event concludes.\n"
  },
