  [524] = {
    rule_type = "AP_Spring&SpringBingoSelectPanel39023",
    rule_title = "规则",
    rule_desc = "礼物跳出来的时候，心也在鼓动。\n\n[c][C74848] 规则说明：[-][/c]\n\n1.首次开启活动时，可选择任意一名角色，进入他的活动界面；每个角色的界面中有9个填色区域，共同组成惊喜盒子图案。\n\n2.活动期间，通关任意普通或精英关卡，均可获得[c][C74848]okk钥匙[-][/c]{#i=400765}；消耗[c][C74848]okk钥匙[-][/c]{#i=400765}即可[c][C74848]为图案填色[-][/c]。\n\n3.填色方法：[c][C74848]okk钥匙[-][/c]{#i=400765}数量足够时，点击填色区域即可选择喜欢的颜色进行填色。\n\n4.活动期间，已填色区域可随时更换颜色；换色不会再次消耗[c][C74848]okk钥匙[-][/c]{#i=400765}。\n\n5.完成同一角色的全部填色后，点击[c][C74848]分享[-][/c]，即可解锁他的惊喜寄语。\n\n6.惊喜寄语可分享到微博、小红书或微信朋友圈，首次分享这名角色的惊喜寄语，可领取对应角色的[c][C74848]万万没想到系列R羁绊[-][/c]。\n\n7.活动期间，可以更换选择的角色；每位角色的惊喜寄语可分别分享并领取奖励一次。\n\n8.okk钥匙还可以在[c][C74848]拾乐奇妙屋[-][/c]中兑换其他丰厚奖励哦~\\n\n\n"
  },
  [900] = {
    rule_type = "ZQLVlog33010",
    rule_title = "Rules",
    rule_desc = [[
Through the seasons, watch snowflakes with him under the warm sun. 
Event Time: 12/08 5:00-12/27 23:59

[c][C74848] Rules:[-][/c]
1. Go on an outing with Kiro and take photos of him at the attractions to preserve the memory! 

-Visit the attractions and take photos to unlock the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c] of the corresponding location with a record of the memories of the trip.

-Visit the attractions and take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Trip Photo Progress[-][/c]. After obtaining 9 stages, you can claim [c][C74848]SR Karma [Kiro: Warm Winter][-][/c]!

-[c][C74848]New poses[-][/c] will be unlocked as you travel, so take more photos of him! You can use [Retake] to take different photos of him!

2. Tap [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] to take photos in a new location. The photos will be added to your travel album.

-You can obtain 1 chance to [c][C74848]Take Photo[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated. After finished taking photos at all the attractions, there will be no more chance to take photos.

3. Tap [c][C74848]Retake[-][/c] to take new photos of him at the attractions you have already visited.

-You can obtain 6 free [c][C74848]Retakes[-][/c] per day, which will be refreshed at 5:00 every day and will not be accumulated; Retakes can be purchased unlimitedly after being used up.

-Note: The retaken photos will not be updated in the [c][C74848]Travel Album[-][/c]. Please make sure to save the retaken photos!

4. Use the [c][C74848]Quick Photo[-][/c] function to retake multiple photos and earn points.

5. Take photos to obtain [c][C74848]Snowmelt Points[-][/c]. Accumulate required Snowmelt Points to claim [c][C74848]Item Rewards[-][/c].

-Each photo grants 10 Snowmelt Points; each retaken photo grants 5 Snowmelt Points.]]
  },
  [991] = {
    rule_type = "mainlineGachaWishPanel_5",
    rule_desc = [[
