3. The rules for extra Shard Rewards obtained from Wishes are as follows:

[c][C74848]AAAA [-][/c][4 Wish Memories], extra SR Karma Shard x6 or SSR Karma Shard x5 will be rewarded;
[c][C74848]AAAB [-][/c][3 Wish Memories], extra SR Karma Shard x3 or SSR Karma Shard x2 will be rewarded;
[c][C74848]AABB [-][/c][2 Wish Memories + 2 same Memories], extra SR Karma Shard x1 or SSR Karma Shard x1 will be rewarded;
